x_comment(x_SpatialScaleComparableIndividualsFn,"A function used for referencing instances of #$ComparableScalarIndividualType-Spatial.  Where DIST-METRIC is a #$UnitOfDistance (e.g., #$Meter), (#$SpatialScaleComparableIndividualsFn DIST-METRIC) denotes the class of all individuals sharing a range of quantifiable spatial features (given by #$successiveMeasurementFeaturesOnCollectionType) whose values on each instance of the collection fall within a given range such that DIST-METRIC defines a scale of measurement for those objects that's natural for human custom and usage.  Thus (#$SpatialScaleComparableIndividualsFn #$Meter) denotes the class of all 'meter-scale' localized spatial things.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ece81).
