x_comment(x_succeedingScaleComparableTypes,"Where COL1 and COL2 are instances of #$ComparableScalarIndividualsType, (#$succeedingScaleComparableTypes COL1 COL2 COMP-PRED) means that for a collection type COMMON-TYPE  of which COL1 and COL2 are both members, and a class of #$MeasurableQuantitySlots SET where (#$successiveMeasurementFeaturesOnCollectionType COMMON-TYPE SET), the value given by an element of set, MEAS-PRED for any instance of COL1 will have the relation COMP-PRED to the value given by MEAS-PRED for any instance of COL2.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ece88).
