x_comment(x_bindingInPositionFromUsedInPositionInFor,"(#$bindingInPositionFromUsedInPositionInFor QUERY-1 ARG-POS-1 QUERY-2 ARG-POS-2 LF-INDEXICAL ARG-POS-3) means that when QUERY-2 is run -- in the context of some application -- QUERY-1 should be run first and the any answers from the open variable in ARG-POS-1 should be used to created restricted versions of QUERY-2 by binding those answers in ARG-POS-2 in QUERY-2.  Each answer returned by the restricted version of QUERY-2 as a binding for ARG-POS-3 is the assigned value for the the logical field indexical LF-INDEXICAL.  When (#$TheList) is used as the formula arg position in arg 6 , then then QUERY-2  is sent fully bound and either True or False is assigned to the logical field indexical according to whether it returned (NIL) or NIL.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ece8a).
