x_comment(x_topicOfPCW,"<code>(#$topicOfPCW PCW TOPIC)</code> says that <code>TOPIC</code> is a topic of the #$PropositionalConceptualWork <code>PCW</code>.  Note that if <code>(#$topicOfPCW CHAPTER TOPIC)</code> and <code>(#$subWorks WORK CHAPTER)</code>, it does <i>not</i> follow that <code>(#$topicOfPCW WORK TOPIC)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eced3).
