x_comment(x_agentInterestedIn,"<code>(#$agentInterestedIn AGENT THING)</code> means that <code>AGENT</code> is interested in <code>THING</code>, in a very general sense of \"interest\".  For example, <code>AGENT</code> may want to know more about <code>THING</code>, or <code>AGENT</code> may have a vested interest in <code>THING</code> (see #$vestedInterest).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eced9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eced9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
