x_comment(x_subElections,"Where ELECTION is an #$Election held under the auspices of POLITY to fill POSITION-TYPE on DATE (see #$ElectionForPositionInPolityFn), (#$subElections ELECTION SUB-ELECTIONS) means that SUB-ELECTION is the #$properSubEvents of ELECTION consisting in the voting held for POSITION-TYPE on DATE that takes place under the auspices of some SUB-POLITY such that (#$subOrganizations POLITY SUB-POITY).  For example, where (#$ElectionForPositionInPolityFn #$UnitedStatesPresident #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica (#$DayFn 4 (#$MonthFn #$November (#$YearFn 2004)))) denotes the 2004 US Presidential election and (#$ElectionForPositionInPolityFn #$UnitedStatesPresident #$NewYork-State (DayFn 4 (#$MonthFn #$November (#$YearFn 2004)))) denotes the sub-part of that election taking place in the territory of #$NewYork-State, it is true that (#$subElections (#$ElectionForPositionInPolityFn #$UnitedStatesPresident #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica (#$DayFn 4 (#$MonthFn #$November (#$YearFn 2004)))) (#$ElectionForPositionInPolityFn #$UnitedStatesPresident #$NewYork-State (DayFn 4 (#$MonthFn #$November (#$YearFn 2004))))).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed687).
