x_comment(x_evaluationProducesNormalValuesForTestType,"<code>(#$evaluationProducesNormalValuesForTestType EVAL EVAL-TYPE)</code> means that the evaluation <code>EVAL</code> produces results that are considered normal for the test type <code>TEST-TYPE</code>.  Thus, for example, the query, <code>(#$evaluationProducesNormalValuesForTestType ?EVAL #$CreatinineBloodTest)</code> should return as bindings for <code>?EVAL</code> all evaluation events that produced results for a creatinine blood test that are considered to be normal.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed696).
