x_comment(x_Continent,"A specialization of #$LandMass and #$Continent-Generic (qq.v.). Each instance is one of the seven land masses traditionally considered to be a continent.   The seven current traditional instances of #$Continent on the #$PlanetEarth are: the six traditional main land masses on the surface of the earth, plus the two #$geographicalSubRegions of Eurasia, Europe and Asia.  The current instances are: #$ContinentOfAfrica, #$ContinentOfAntarctica, #$ContinentOfAsia, #$ContinentOfAustralia, #$ContinentOfEurasia, #$ContinentOfEurope, #$ContinentOfNorthAmerica, #$ContinentOfSouthAmerica.  Cf. #$TrueContinent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed69a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed69a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
