x_comment(x_investmentAmountDuring,"(#$investmentAmountDuring PT PRODUCT-TYPE THING AMOUNT) means that the amount of #$MonetaryValue AMOUNT was spent on instances of the #$ProductType PRODUCT-TYPE by #$PartiallyTangible PT during the the temporal extent of the #$TemporalThing THING, where PT acquired those instances in order to use them as inputs to production. PT will commonly be an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible that is involved in producing goods, such as a #$Business or #$ManufacturingOrganization.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6a2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6a2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
