x_comment(x_AChEInactivation,"A specialization of #$BiologicalEvent.  Instances are #$ChemicalReactions that take place in the nervous system, typically as the result of exposure to some #$CholinesteraseInhibitingSubstance.  In such reactions, #$Acetylcholinesterase reacts with some #$ChemicalSubstanceType, preventing #$AcetylcholineHydrolysis from taking place.  This, in turn, leads to #$AcetylcholinePoisoning.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6a4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6a4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
