x_comment(x_typeProvidesShelterForType,"<code>(#$typeProvidesShelterForType SHELTER-TYPE TYPE)</code> means that instances of <code>SHELTER-TYPE</code>, a subcollection of #$ShelteringArtifact, are used to provide shelter to instances of <code>TYPE</code>.  For example,\n<code>(#$typeProvidesShelterForType #$HumanShelterConstruction #$HomoSapiens)</code> means that human shelter constructions are used to provide shelter to humans.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6a5).
