x_comment(x_quotationOfExternalAgent,"(#$quotationOfExternalAgent WORK QUOTE) means that the #$Information-Content of the #$TextString QUOTE (which #$TextString usually either contains quotation marks as its first and last characters or is indented within a #$GraphicalStructure) originated outside of WORK and prior to WORK's creation.  The #$Information-Content of QUOTE can, therefore, be attributed to an #$IntelligentAgent different from the creator of WORK or to another #$ConceptualWork.  For example, a quotation of a person and a quotation from another work would both be related to the #$StructurallySpecificWork within which they are contained by #$quotationOfExternalAgent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6a6).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6a6,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
