x_comment(x_keyGroupMembers,"(#$keyGroupMembers GROUP AGENT) means that the instance AGENT of #$Agent-Generic is essential to the normal functioning of GROUP, an instance of (#$GroupFn #$Agent-Generic).  Notable specializations include #$hasLeaders, which relates a group to those who lead it, and #$organizationKeyMembers, which is restricted to groups that are also organizations (c.f., #$Organization).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6ab).
