x_comment(x_GivingEconomicAid,"A collection of events and a specialization of #$GivingSomething and #$MoneyTransaction. In each instance of\n#$GivingEconomicAid, a relatively well-off #$Agent-PartiallyTangible gives some money to another, relatively impoverished #$Agent-PartiallyTangible (often a #$Country), in order to aid their economic development. See also (the related but not identical) #$CharitableDonation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6ac).
