x_comment(x_EntireSurfaceLayerFn,"(#$EntireSurfaceLayerFn SPATIALTHING) returns the\n\ncontiguous #$EntireSurfaceLayer that covers SPATIALTHING.  We\n\nremain agnostic about whether or not it is the case that\n\n(#$physicalParts SPATIALTHING (#$EntireSurfaceLayerFn\n\nSPATIALTHING)), although this may be the case for instances of certain\n\nclasses of #$SpatialThing.  We also remain agnostic as to the nature\n\nof the 'covering' involved--i.e., the working assumption is that\n\n(covers-Generic (SurfaceLayer-WholeThingFn SPATIALTHING)\n\nSPATIALTHING).  Again, for instances of more specific classes of\n\n#$SpatialThing, we may want to introduce assertions that conclude a\n\nmore specific 'covering' relation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6ad).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6ad,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
