x_comment(x_associatedExchangeAgreement,"The predicate used to state that an #$Agreement states the terms of some #$ExchangeOfUserRights.  Such #$Agreements are typically #$OwnershipAgreements such as #$TitleAgreements.  Also see #$associatedUserAgreement.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6af).
