x_comment('x_relyOn-Generic',"(#$relyOn-Generic AGENT THING) means that AGENT relies on THING (or instances of THING, if THING is a #$Collection) for a significant part of AGENT's normal activities.  Note that an instance of #$Organization may ``rely upon'' something as well as an animal.  Plants, not being considered instances of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible (in most circumstances) are not covered by this predicate.  See #$relyOnType, #$relyOnObject, and #$relyOnAgent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6b0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6b0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
