x_comment(x_embeddedRegion,"(#$embeddedRegion SMALL BIG) means that BIG not only surrounds SMALL in all horizontal directions, but it also touches it directly [#$touches-Directly] on all (horizontal) sides and #$bordersOn it.  BIG and SMALL do not share any physical part.  Any horizontal vector from SMALL will be within BIG as soon as it emerges from SMALL.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6b7).
