x_comment(x_IssuingLicenseTypeFn,"An instance of #$UnaryFunction that takes for its value a\nspecialization of #$License-LegalAgreement TYPE and returns the collection\nof all instances in which TYPE was issued.  For example, (#$IssuingLicenseTypeFn DriversLicense) denotes the collection of events in which an agent was issued an instance of #$DriversLicense-LicenseAgreement.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6b8).
