x_comment(x_GameSuperunit,"A collection of individual #$Events.  Each instance of #$GameSuperunit is a standard unit of play which includes several #$GameEvents between the same contestants (even if there is only one contestant) as #$subEvents.  A set of rules regarding the #$DevisedStructuredActivity being performed predefines what is necessary for the completion of a #$GameSuperunit.  Examples include tennis sets and matches, baseball double-headers, and bridge rubbers.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6bb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6bb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
