x_comment(x_implausibleSentence,"(#$implausibleSentence SENTENCE) means that a reviewer who looked at the #$CycLPropositionalSentence SENTENCE felt that the information the sentence expresses is \"unlikely\" in a common-sense case.  For example, (#$isa #$Cynthia #$MafiaContractor) is an unlikely supposition.  The plausibility of a sentence depends on a reviewer's subjective judgement, the context within which the claim is being made, and what other information is available to the system.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6bc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6bc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
