x_comment(x_MSMyComputerZoneFn,"One of a series of functions used to represent Microsoft's \"Internet Security Zone\" concept. The function takes as its argument an instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive, which describes some action which it is possible to perform on certain computers, and allows one to state that that action may be performed when sourced wholly from within the computer itself. The result of this function is therefore also a (qualified) instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6be).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6be,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
