x_comment(x_needingAgent,"Maps from a particular need context to the particular agent that needs what is stated in that context to be true in reality.  Since we have not yet addressed the issue of non-agent's needs, we've restricted the #$arg2Isa to #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6bf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6bf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
