x_comment(x_MiddleEasternPerson,"The collection of all #$MiddleEasternPersons. This\ncollection is a very broad interpretation of what it means to be from\nthe Middle East and includes such collections as\n#$EthnicGroupOfMiddleEasterners and (#$ResidentFn #$MiddleEast-Region).\nThis enables cyclists to make very broad assertions about the people\nof the Middle East.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6c1).
