x_comment('x_Discipline-Sexual',"This is the collection of sexual activities in which one person \n\ndisciplines another for the purpose of sexual arousal. #$Discipline-Sexual\n\nand #$Bondage-Sexual often go together.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6c7).
