x_comment(x_GenreFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction. #$GenreFn takes as its arguments a subset of #$ConceptualWork and an instance of #$ArtisticTypeByStyle and returns the collection of that kind of #$ConceptualWork that are of that genre, or #$ArtisticTypeByStyle. For example, (#$GenreFn #$LiteraryWork-CW #$PropositionalConceptualWork-ScienceFictionGenre) returns the collection of all science fiction literary works.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6c8).
