x_comment(x_SelfConfidence,"Faith in oneself and one's powers without any suggestion of conceit or arrogance.   If one has a large portion of #$SelfConfidence, their state of mind is often marked by ease and freedom from uncertainty, diffidence, or embarrassment.  This is a collection; for an explanation of a typical #$EmotionalQuantityType, see #$Happiness.  A typical more specialized #$EmotionalQuantityType than #$SelfConfidence is #$Vanity.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6cc).
