x_comment(x_precedesInGraphicalStructure,"'(#$precedesInGraphicalStructure WHOLE PARTSTRUC1 PARTSTRUC2)' means that, within the #$GraphicalStructure WHOLE, the #$GraphicalStructure STRUCTURE1 comes before the #$GraphicalStructure STRUCTURE2.  There are certain types of #$GraphicalStructure that always precede certain other types of #$GraphicalStructure within an inclusive #$GraphicalStructure.  For example, within a #$CWStructure, an instance of #$TableOfContents always #$precedesInGraphicalStructure an instance of #$TextString that it is an #$alphabeticalIndexTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6d4).
