x_comment(x_ViticulturalDomain,"The collection of geographical regions principally devoted to viticultural activity, a specialization of #$AgriculturalFacility. Instances of #$ViticulturalDomain  have parts that can include various type of building and geographical or agricultural features, their most important parts are fields of grapevine [#$GrapeVine]. They can be in one piece or constituted of many separated areas. The area cultivated may be in one  or many pieces as well. Such domains are administrated by instances of #$Vineyard.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6da).
