x_comment(x_MeetingSomeone,"A collection of actions.  In a #$MeetingSomeone event, one #$Agent-PartiallyTangible is moving and meets (comes into close proximity with) another #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  This may or may not be purposeful.  It may be done by non-human animals, and occasionally by other sorts of #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles.\n<p>\nNote: this does not mean \"being introduced to someone\", but rather \"going to meet with someone\".") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6db).
