x_comment(x_translationOfTextualPCW,"(#$translationOfTextualPCW OLDPCW NEWPCW) means that NEWPCW is a translation of OLDPCW.  If OLDPCW is not textually-specific, e.g. a book of the #$Bible is being translated and multiple early versions are being used as source material, use the more general predicate, #$translationOfPCW  Note that this predicate relates two #$TextualPCWs. To say that a certain #$TextString is a translation of a #$TextualPCW, use #$translationOfCWToAIS. To say that one #$TextString (or any #$AbstractInformationStructure) is a translation of another, use #$translationOfAISFromTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6dc).
