x_comment('x_acknowledgements-DocumentPartOf',"(#$acknowledgements-DocumentPartOf WORK ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS) means that the #$GraphicalStructure ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS is contained within the #$StructurallySpecificWork WORK and contains an expression of the authors' (or others') gratitude to or appreciation of an individual or organization that was somehow helpful or inspirational to the authors in the creation of WORK.  Acknowledgements may be written by #$Authors, illustrators, or any entity that makes a significant contribution to the work in which the acknowledgements appear.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6e4).
