x_comment('x_InanimateObject-Natural',"An instance of #$ExistingStuffType and a specialization of both #$InanimateObject and #$NaturalTangibleStuff.  Each instance of #$InanimateObject-Natural is an inanimate object that was not created by an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible in a #$PurposefulAction.  Thus, the #$MoonOfEarth, human #$Sweat staining a shirt, and most footprints left by people in the snow belong to this collection; but wood chips left around a tree being chopped down, tailings left from a mine, and the #$ArcDeTriomphe do not.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6e6).
