x_comment(x_JustifiedByAuthority,"An instance of #$CycArgumentTypeByJustificationType.  This is the collection of all cyc arguments which are \"justified by authority\".  This collection is used to that an assertion or group of assertions (mt contents) was purposely added to the Cyc knowledge base by some agent (as opposed to being inferred somehow by Cyc) on the basis of a specific outside authority (e.g. #$ReferenceWork), and is to be treated as sound.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6e7).
