x_comment(x_storesInformationPermanently,"(#$storesInformationPermanently IBT INFO) means that the #$InformationBearingThing IBT stores permanently the #$AspatialInformationStore INFO. In different contexts, what counts as storing permanently will vary. The information content of a book is stored permanently compared to the information content of a chalkboard.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6e9).
