x_comment(x_PreparingForUndesirableSituation,"The collection of #$PurposefulActions in which an agent prepares for a possible situation (#$Situation) that is abnormal, undesirable, and forseeable from the point of view of the agent. The action can be entirely mental, as in #$MakingAPlan, or can involve #$CompositePhysicalAndMentalEvents, such as buying extra food as a preparation for a possible supermarket shortage. To relate #$PreparingForUndesirableSituations to the #$Situations that they prepare for, use the function #$PreparednessFn. See also #$PreventingFromHappening and #$PreventingFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6ea).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6ea,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
