x_comment('x_MilitaryOperationsBackgroundContext-General',"This is the collection of microtheories in which general information relevant to all or most military operations is given. Note that information about specific individuals that are relevant to a particular operation, or a set of particular operations (or proposed operations), should not be asserted in a MilitaryOperationsBackgroundContext-General. Rather, information about individuals should be asserted in a #$SituationSpecificationMicrotheory (or an instance of a spec thereof).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6eb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6eb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505ed6eb,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
