x_comment(x_sourceWorkForSOEMt,"(#$sourceWorkForSOEMt WORK MT) identifies WORK as one of the instances of #$PropositionalConceptualWork whose content is drawn upon in determining the features of the graph that is displayed when querying for a graph of the Cyc ontology from the microtheory MT. Typically, WORK will be used to determine what edges to show, and what nodes are focal (of high interest -- see #$defaultCandidateFocalNodeInSystem).  See also #$SOEGlfMt and #$TheCycOntologyGraph.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6ec).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6ec,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
