x_comment('x_Embassy-TheMission',"#$Embassy-TheMission is a specialization of #$DiplomaticMission-ThePost.  Each instance of #$Embassy-TheMission is an embassy, which is the official diplomatic representation of a country A in a foreign country B. Not to be confused with the buildings in which such offices are hosted. See #$EmbassyBuilding.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6ed).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6ed,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
