x_comment(x_caseTypeOf,"(#$caseTypeOf CASE-TYPE PT) means that the spec of #$CaseProduct, CASE-TYPE, is the collection of  cases of the #$ProductType PT.  Instances of CASE-TYPE are #$PackagedProducts consisting of many instances of PT packaged together in a box.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed6f7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed6f7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
