x_comment('x_wantsToRelnA-Inverse',"(#$wantsToRelnA-Inverse AGT COL RELN) means that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible ?AGT wants the following to be the case: (RELN INS AGT) for some generic instance of COL. See also #$wantsToRelnA.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed701).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed701,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
