x_comment(x_requestReservesPercentageOfIndForInterval,"An assertion of the form (#$requestReservesPercentageOfIndForInterval REQUEST PERCENT INDIVIDUAL INTERVAL) states that the #$ResourceRequest REQUEST represents a request to reserve PERCENT percent of the #$Individual INDIVIDUAL's time during the #$TimeInterval INTERVAL. This is a core predicate for describing what an #$ResourceRequest reserves, see also #$requestReservesPercentageOfIndForInterval.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed719).
