x_comment(x_hasPhysiologicalQuantity,"(#$hasPhysiologicalQuantity BLO QUANT) means that the #$BiologicalLivingObject BLO has the #$PhysiologicalQuantity QUANT.  Note that many, perhaps most, assertions made with #$hasPhysiologicalQuantity will be time-dependent; for example, an individual person is not #$Strong throughout his or her life, but only during a portion of it.  For this reason, many assertions made with #$hasPhysiologicalQuantity will need to be temporally qualified.  Note: this predicate is meant to be used with measurable physiological features such as strength, pain etc.  For ascription of non-measureable physiological features use #$hasPhysiologicalFeature.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed71a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed71a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
