x_comment(x_evaluationOutputSentences,"(#$evaluationOutputSentences EVALUATION-EVENT EVALUATION-STATEMENT) says that the sentence EVALUATION-STATEMENT is the sentence that expresses the (or a) judgment about the evaluee (see #$objectOfEvaluation) of EVALUATION-EVENT, an instance of #$Evaluating, that resulted from EVALUATION-EVENT.  For example, (#$evaluationOutputSentences BobsDriversTest0632 (#$not (#$isa Bob SafeDriver))) says that as a result of Bob's drivers license exam, it was determined that Bob is not a safe driver.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed721).
