x_comment(x_Ball,"An instance of #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a specialization of #$PhysicalDevice.  Each instance of #$Ball is a #$PortableObject, capable of #$RollingOnASurface, which is designed to be moved about (usually thrown, hit, or kicked) as part of some #$Game or recreational activity.  Most #$Balls are #$Spheres (or at least #$Spheroids), but some, such as instances of #$FootballBall-American, are not.  However, #$Ball is disjoint with #$Cylinder, #$LongThinObject, and #$Polyhedron; hence neither a #$FlyingDisc nor a #$Javelin nor a #$Die-TheCube is considered a #$Ball.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed73d).
