x_comment(x_subNetwork,"This predicate is a more specific version of #$subSystems that applies in particular to instances of #$ComputerNetwork. (#$subNetwork NETWORK SUB_NETWORK) means that the instance SUB_NETWORK of #$ComputerNetwork is a distinct part of the instance NETWORK of #$ComputerNetwork and that (see the #$comment on #$subSystems) SUB_NETWORK could have an 'independent existence and still be more or less the same.'  For example, there are many instances of #$LocalAreaNetwork that could be considered #$subNetworks of the #$Internet.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed760).
