x_comment('x_minimumTrafficableValue-PathConstraint',"Let SLOT denote an #$QuantitySlot, SLOT-ARG1 denote the #$arg1Isa constraint on SLOT, SLOT-ARG2 denote the\n\n     #$arg2Isa constraint on SLOT, and VALUE denote the instance of SLOT-ARG2 such that\n\n     (SLOT PATH VALUE).  Then (#$minimumTrafficableValue-PathConstraint\n\n     PATH O-TYPE SLOT MIN) means that PATH is #$pathTrafficableForTransportVia\n\n     #$transporters of type O-TYPE only if (#$greaterThanOrEqualTo VALUE MIN).  See also the related\n\n     predicates #$maximumTrafficableValue-PathConstraint,\n\n     #$maximumTrafficableValue-TransporterConstraint, and\n\n     #$minimumTrafficableValue-TransporterConstraint.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed768).
