x_comment(x_eventHasStyle,"This predicate expresses that some instance of #$PerformingArtActivity 'has' or 'is performed in' some particular style.  For example, (#$relationAllExists #$eventHasStyle #$BalletDancePerformance #$BalletDancing) expresses that all ballet dance performances are performed in the ballet style.  See also #$hasStyle, which is used to relate instances of #$Artifact-Generic (i.e. conceptual works) to the style that they 'have.'") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed774).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed774,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
