x_comment(x_ownsShare,"The predicate #$ownsShare is used to state how much of some thing is owned by a particular #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  (#$ownsShare AGENT SOMETHING SHARE) means that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGENT has SHARE #$Percent (q.v.) ownership of the object or company SOMETHING.  Note that SHARE is a percentage and does not refer directly to a number of shares of #$Stock.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed779).
