x_comment(x_typeIsGenericUseOfTypeFn,"An expression of the form (typeIsGenericUseOfTypeFn ACT-TYPE THING-TYPE) is used to relate a sub-collection of #$SomethignExisting to the sub-collection of #$PurposefulAction that involves the use of instance of THING-THING in the role of #$instrument-Generic.  This is the corresponding predicate of the function #$UsingOfTypeFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed77f).
