x_comment(x_Currency,"A specialization of #$TenderObject.  Each instance of #$Currency is a physical object generally accepted as legal tender, and used as a means of transferring a quantity of #$MonetaryValue (q.v.) between some instances of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  Instances of #$Currency may be coins, items of precious metal, paper bills for which precious objects are payable by a government to the bearer on demand, or unbacked paper bills required by a government to be accepted for payment of debts.  Instances of #$Currency are typically backed by and issued by national governments.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed785).
