x_comment(x_soleProductType,"A binary predicate linking a particular #$Agent-PartiallyTangible to the kind of product or service it produces as its only product (aside from any trivial incidental extras).  (#$soleProductType AGENT PRODUCTTYPE) means that AGENT is a person or organization that sells or performs instances of product type PRODUCTTYPE, and virtually all of the sales that AGENT makes are of instances of this type.  See also #$mainProductType and #$makesProductType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed787).
