x_comment(x_WorkEnvironment,"A collection.  Any instance of #$WorkEnvironment is a #$SpatialThing-Localized subsumed by one's place of work, that is defined by its #$OccupationalPhysicalEnvironmentalQuantitys and #$SocialEnvironmentalAttributes.  An example might be #$Jennifer's usual work environment, which is spatially located in the #$Cycorp lobby, and has certain attributes such as a fair amount of traffic and noise from ringing phones and doors slamming shut.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed78a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed78a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
