xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed78f,[]).
x_comment(x_loves,"(#$loves AGENT1 AGENT2) means AGENT1 loves AGENT2; AGENT2 has a strong emotional affect on AGENT1 whereby AGENT1 is usually loyal and devoted to and wishes well AGENT2, seeks AGENT2's companionship, and will incur substantial personal cost to help AGENT2.  Any #$Agent-PartiallyTangible can love any other #$Agent-PartiallyTangible, though there are specialized types of love which are restricted to two animals, two adult people, a person and a corporation, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed790).
