x_comment(x_DanceCompany,"The collection of EntertainmentOrganizations whose #$actsInCapacity-MainFunction is to produce and present instances of #$EntertainmentPerformances in which dancing is the predominant activity (i.e., instances of #$DancePerformance). Dancers are essential worker-members of instances of #$DanceCompany, as dance performances are an essential activity of such companies.  An instance of #$DanceCompany may be a group of people who have come together to perform one work or may be a professional organization for whom the dancers are #$employees [which they are in #$JobMt].  Since the #$actsInCapacity-MainFunction of an instance of #$DanceCompany is to perform dances (in a theatre, in front of an audience...), a night club at which customers dance socially would not be an instance of #$DanceCompany, although it would be an instance of #$EntertainmentOrRecreationOrganization.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed79c).
