x_comment(x_TVBroadcastOfTypeFn,"#$TVBroadcastOfTypeFn takes as argument any content-defined spec of #$MovingImage (including specs of #$MovieShowing or #$TVShow-IBT) and returns the collection of events that are TV broadcasts of instances of that spec.   For example, (#$TVBroadcastOfTypeFn #$StarTrek-Classic) returns the collection of television broadcasts of the original Star Trek series.  (#$TVBroadcastOfTypeFn DocumentaryFilm) would return the collection of events that are television broadcasts of documentaries.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed79d).
