x_comment(x_DistributionReservoir,"A specialization of #$WaterReservoir.  Each instance of #$DistributionReservoir is a reservoir connected with the distribution system of a water supply project, used primarily to accommodate fluctuations in demand which occur over short periods (several hours to several days) and also to provide local storage in case of emergency, such as a break in a main supply line or failure of a pumping plant.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7a3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed7a3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
