x_comment(x_HomeAudioAndVideoProductsMC,"An element of #$ProductTypeByMarketCategory.  Each element of #$HomeAudioAndVideoProductsMC (i.e., Market Category) is an audio or video device that consumers typically buy for personal use at home, e.g., television sets, stereo systems, telephones.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7a9).
