x_comment(x_infectionReservoir,"(#$infectionReservoir ORG INFECTION) relates a type of infection INFECTION to the reservoir ORG that may carry it.  The reservoir is an alternate or passive host that harbors a pathogenic organism, but does not necessarily suffer from the infection itself.  It is, however, a source from which the infection can spread.  For example, rats are the #$infectionReservoir of the #$BubonicPlague.  The rats transmit the infection to fleas, the #$infectionTypeHasVectorTypes of the #$BubonicPlague, which in turn infect humans.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7aa).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed7aa,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
