x_comment(x_productionRate,"(#$productionRate PRODUCER PRODUCT-TYPE RATE) means that the instance of #$SomethingExisting PRODUCER produces instances of the #$ProductType PRODUCT-TYPE at the #$Rate RATE.  PRODUCER might, for example, be a #$Country, a #$Business, an #$Island, or a #$Person; and RATE might be a number per unit of time, or a volume per unit of time, or a #$MonetaryRate.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7ad).
