x_comment('x_CarBomb-BoobyTrap',"A specialization of #$Bomb-ProximityTriggered.  Each instance of #$CarBomb-BoobyTrap is a bomb designed to explode when a certain sort of event occurs in the car to which it is wired.  For example, it is common for car bombs to be designed to detonate when an ignition fires.  Cf. #$TruckBomb-VehicleDelivered and #$CarBomb-VehicleDelivered") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7b2).
