x_comment('x_Device-Unlocked',"The state of being unlocked.  As a #$LockedState, this refers to the state of a locking device.  As a #$IndividualTypeBySecurityStatus, this refers to the state of an object that may have a lock, such as a house, car, or bicycle.  In this sense, #$Device-Unlocked is a kind of #$OpenAccess.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7b3).
