x_comment(x_typeInstancesStartAfterEndOfIn,"(#$typeInstancesStartAfterEndOfIn LATERTYPE EARLYTYPE MAINTYPE) means that in instances of MAINTYPE, an instance of EARLYTYPE will be followed by an instance of LATERTYPE. Note that this is consistent with no event of type EARLYTYPE occurring in the event of MAINTYPE and a different instance of LATERTYPE occurring prior to an instance of EARLYTYPE in an instance of MAINTYPE.   This is closely related to #$startsAfterEndOfInSituationType but is not restricted to use in #$ScriptedEventTypes and allows for use of more general arguments than those in the range of #$SceneFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7b9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed7b9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
