x_comment(x_FiscalPeriod,"Each instance of this collection is a date (usually either a year (see #$FiscalYear) or a calendar quarter (see #$FiscalQuarter)) kept track of by an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible as part of its financial accounting procedures.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7ba).
