x_comment(x_renownLevel,"A spec pred of #$hasAttributes. (#$renownLevel THING LEVEL) says that THING has the attribute LEVEL, where LEVEL is an instance of #$LevelOfRenown.  For example, (#$renownLevel #$BillClinton #$Famous) says that #$BillClinton is #$Famous.  This predicate is an instance of #$PresuppositionPredicate because one can only truly have an #$LevelOfRenown with respect to some group of #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles.  See #$renownWithinGroup.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7bd).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed7bd,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
