x_comment('x_License-LegalAgreement',"A collection of intangible pieces of information; a subset of #$Permission.   Each element of #$License-LegalAgreement is a credential issued by a granting authority and recorded in some tangible document (see #$License-IBO), which authorizes the agent to whom it is issued to perform actions of a certain kind.  Sample subsets of #$License-LegalAgreement include: #$TrainEngineerLicense, #$DriversLicense-LicenseAgreement, #$PestControlLicense.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7ca).
