x_comment(x_failureForAgents,"The predicate #$failureForAgents is used to indicate that a particular agent fails to achieve (at least one of) its goals in a particular action.  (#$failureForAgents ENDEAVOR AGENT) means that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGENT had some purpose in performing ENDEAVOR that was not realized.  See also #$purposeInEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7cc).
