x_comment(x_MakingABankWithdrawal,"A collection of events; a subset of #$MoneyTransfer.  In an instance of #$MakingABankWithdrawal, an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible (or representative thereof) withdraws currency or other financial tender from a bank account (usually the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible's personal bank account, or the bank account of the company for which the agent works).  An agent may make a withdrawal in person at the bank, but it might also be made by mail, over the telephone, electronically via modem, at an ATM machine, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7cf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed7cf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
