x_comment(x_numberOfPointsOnLoan,"(#$numberOfPointsOnLoan LOAN N) identifies N as the number of \"points\" on the instance of #$LoanAgreement LOAN.  One point translates to 1 percent of the loan amount (c.f., #$initialLoanAmount).  To represent the points on a loan as a monetary amount, user #$pointsValueOnLoan.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7d0).
