x_comment(x_beneficiary,"(#$beneficiary ACT AGT) means that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGT benefits from the performance of the action ACT.  Some desire or interest of AGT is served, enabled, helped, or satisfied by the performance of ACT.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7d4).
