x_comment(x_epidemicCommonVehicleType,"(#$epidemicCommonVehicleType EPI VEHICLE-TYPE) means that the common vehicle of the #$CommonVehicleInfectiousDiseaseEpidemic EPI is such that every member of that common vehicle is an instance of the type of #$InanimateObject VEHICLE-TYPE. The common vehicle is a group of things contaminated with the #$Microorganism that causes the #$Infections that constitute EPI. In other words, every member of EPI is an #$Infection caused by exposure to a contaminated member of the common vehicle, and every member of the common vehicle is an instance of the type of #$InanimateObject VEHICLE-TYPE. See #$epidemicCommonVehicle.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7d5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed7d5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
