x_comment(x_SituationTypeInWhichFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction, #$SituationTypeInWhichFn takes an instance of #$CycLSentence-Assertible and returns the sub-collection of #$Situation whose  instances are all those situations of which the proposition represented by the #$CycLSentence-Assertible is 'constitutively true.'  A sufficient condition for a situation to be a member of the collection denoted by #$SituationTypeInWhichFn is for the situation itself or the instances of #$SomethingExisting which are actors in that situation to have a set of properties that entail the relevant proposition.  So, the fact that #$WorldWarII involved the use of the #$FatMan bomb makes it an instance of the collection (#$SituationTypeInWhichFn (#$relationExistsExists #$deviceUsed #$War #$AtomicBomb)).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7e2).
