x_comment(x_IncurringDamage,"A specialization of #$Event-Localized. Each instance of this collection is an event in which some sort of damage is incurred to an instance of #$SomethingExisting. Examples include denting a car, the breaking of someone's leg, the defacing of a website and slander which negatively impacts someone's reputation. For cases where the thing damaged is a material thing (i.e. an instance of #$PartiallyTangible), or an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible, see the more specialized constants #$IncurringPhysicalDamage and #$HarmingAnAgent respectively. For cases where the damage incurred is so extensive that the thing is destroyed, see the more specialized #$DestructionEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7e5).
