x_comment(x_translationOfPCW,"(#$translationOfPCW PCW NEWPCW) means that NEWPCW is a translation of PCW. Note that this predicate relates a #$TextualPCW to a #$TextuallySpecificWork.  A translation of the #$Bible, for example, is usually not the direct translation of a single #$TextualPCW, but is created by referencing copies of multiple textually specific versions of the #$Bible, often in multiple languages.  If PCW is also a #$TextuallySpecificWork, use the more specific predicate, #$translationOfTextualPCW.  To say that a certain #$TextString is a translation of a #$TextualPCW, use #$translationOfCWToAIS. To say that one #$TextString (or any #$AbstractInformationStructure) is a translation of another, use #$translationOfAISFromTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed7fd).
