x_comment(x_importRate,"(#$importRate COUNTRY PRODUCT-TYPE RATE) means that COUNTRY imports PRODUCT-TYPE at the rate of RATE. Note that RATE may be expressed as a #$MonetaryRate, but also as rate of volume, mass or number depending on the type of product. For example, for oil which is a fluid we can say both (#$importRate #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica #$PetroleumProduct (#$MillionDollarsPerYear NR)) and (#$importRate #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica #$PetroleumProduct (#$MillionBarrelsPerYear NR)). Note that services, i.e. specializations of #$ServiceEvents are included as product types.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed801).
