x_comment(x_usesProgram,"The predicate #$usesProgram relates an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible or a #$ProgramAction to a program (#$ComputerProgram-CW) that is used by that agent or  in that action. (#$usesProgram AGNT-OR-ACT PROG) means the AGNT-OR-ACT uses PROG. Examples include the relationship between a person and their word-processing program, or between a user account and the Unix shell which it is given on startup.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed809).
