x_comment(x_SupportedByMaterialImplication,"An instance of #$CycArgumentTypeByJustificationType.  This collection is the collection of cyc arguments which are supported by material implication.  This collection can be used to indicate that an assertion or group of assertions (mt contents) is supported by one or more applications of an if-then rule.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed819).
