x_comment(x_NonNumericQuantitySlot,"A specialization of #$QuantitySlot (q.v.).  Each instance of #$NonNumericQuantitySlot is a binary predicate that is used to attribute a property to a thing, by relating it to a #$NonNumericScalarQuantity (q.v.) of some sort, typically a #$GenericQuantity.\n<p>\nInstances of #$NonNumericQuantitySlot include #$levelOfEfficiency and #$qualityOfProduct.\n<p>\nCf. #$MeasurableQuantitySlot.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed81c).
