x_comment(x_restenosisOfCoronaryArtery,"(#$restenosisOfCoronaryArtery CAS CORONARY-ARTERY-TYPE) means that there is an instance of #$CoronaryArteryStenosis-Finding affecting the patient's CORONARY-ARTERY-TYPE and that there was some previous percutaneous procedure whose site was \"Coronary Artery\".  As necessary more rules concluding to this relation will be added.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed81d).
