x_comment(x_ReligiousTVShow,"Instances of #$ReligiousTVShow are #$TVShow-IBTs with content usually associated           with religion such as preaching or edification.  They may also present information about           current events or politics from what are commonly considered religious points-of-view.           Examples: 'The 700 Club' or 'Living Word Ministries'.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed81f).
