x_comment(x_PlayingGameTypeFn,"(#$PlayingGameTypeFn GAME_TYPE) returns the collection of instances of #$PlayingAGame of some instance of GAME_Type performed by players or competitors.  For example, (#$PlayingGameTypeFn #$CardGame) returns the collection of actions performed by one or more players while playing at some #$CardGame.  Note that the game does not ever have to be completed for these actions to be part of the playing of the game type.  The predicate also applies to non-game sports (see #$Sport).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed820).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed820,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
