x_comment(x_hasStatusWRTAssignmentOnDateWithEstimatedTimeRemaining,"An assertion of the form (#$hasStatusWRTAssignmentOnDateWithEstimatedTimeRemaining AGENT STATUS-PRED ASSIGN INTERVAL QUANTITY) states that the #$IntelligentAgent AGENT bears the relation STATUS-PRED, an instance of #$WorkStatusBinaryPredicate, to the #$Assignment-Specification during the #$TimeInterval INTERVAL and that AGENT believes there is QUANTITY of work remaining for it to complete it's work on the realization of ASSIGN.  This predicate is designed to work with the FET Template #$ProjectManagement-TemplateTopic and to handle the problem of not being able to substitute values from an FET field into multiple positions within the underlying formula.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed821).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed821,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
