x_comment('x_MediumDuty-PathArtifact',"This is the collection of instances of #$PathForWheeledVehicles\n\nthat can accomodate medium-heavy loads in all weather; these are likely to\n\nbe paved avenues on light foundations. Paths with this attribute will\n\nbe instances of #$PavedPath describing the quality of their\n\nsurface or preferably one of its specialization that reflects the quality\n\nof their foundation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed829).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed829,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
