x_comment(x_typesFollowInSuccession,"(#$typesFollowInSuccession SUBTYPE2 SUBTYPE1 MAINTYPE) means that in events of type MAINTYPE, events of type SUBTYPE1 are followed by events of type SUBTYPE2, i.e. there are instances SUBINS1 and SUBINS2, that are subevents of an instance of MAINTYPE such that (#$followsInProgression SUBINS2 SUBINS1 MAININS).  See also, #$nextSubSituationTypeToStart and #$nextSceneToStartInScript-Ternary for versions of this that apply strictly to scripts and scene types that get reified for these scripts.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed835).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed835,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505ed835,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
