x_comment(x_occasionallyInContactWith,"(#$occasionallyInContactWith X Y) means that X and Y have met at least a few times, but possibly often, and continue to meet each other at more or less random intervals in the indefinite present due to whatever circumstances.  Also expressible as (#$acquaintances X Y #$occasionallyInContactWith) and (#$acquaintances Y X #$occasionallyInContactWith).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed839).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed839,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
