x_comment(x_WritingAComputerProgram,"A specialization of #$CWCreation. Each instance of this collection is an event in which some #$Agent-PartiallyTangible writes some instances of #$ComputerProgram-CW. This will often (but not always) involve instances of #$ProgrammingAComputer -- physically typing a program into a computer -- a specialization of #$IBTGeneration-Original. See also #$Hacking.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed83f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed83f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
