x_comment('x_Advertisement-IBT',"A collection of #$InformationBearingThings. #$Advertisement-IBTs are IBTs intended for a large audience, often #$ThePublic. The originator of the corresponding #$Advertisement-PCW pays to have these instantiations made accessible to the intended audience, and intends that people who access one will be affected by it in a way that is favorable to the originator. #$Advertisement-IBTs take many physical forms, including billboards, magazine and newspapers ads, email, direct mail, and radio and television commercials, among others.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed840).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed840,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
