x_comment('x_appendix-DocumentPartOf',"(#$appendix-DocumentPartOf WORK APPENDIX) means that the #$GraphicalStructure APPENDIX is contained within the #$StructurallySpecificWork WORK and is an appendix in that work.  Appendices usually contain information that supplements the propositional content of the body of the #$StructurallySpecificWork and which is not essential (but which is, perhaps, helpful) to an understanding of the #$Propositions expressed in the #$StructurallySpecificWork as a whole.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed841).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed841,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
