xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed847,[]).
x_comment(x_hasFlawToDegree,"This predicate relates things to the instance of #$LevelOfFlawedness that it has.  Since things are often deemed to be flawed only with respect to some plan, purpose or agent, this predicate may have to be contextualized.  This is a very general relation and it may be preferable to utilize #$flawedWRTRoleInSitType or #$complianceStatus.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed848).
