x_comment(x_VisitingSomeone,"A collection of actions.  In a #$VisitingSomeone event, one #$Agent-PartiallyTangible travels or moves to the vicinity of another #$Agent-PartiallyTangible for the purpose of meeting with that other #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  Each #$VisitingSomeone is purposeful, at least on the part of the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible doing the travelling, and that #$Agent-PartiallyTangible is typically a #$Person, and the purpose is often social in nature.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed853).
