x_comment(x_actionExpressesFeelingToward,"(#$actionExpressesFeelingToward ACTION FEELING OBJECT) means that the\n\ndoer (#$doneBy) of ACTION expresses FEELING about OBJECT by doing\n\nACTION.  Example uses include 'protesters burned a flag to express their hatred of the government', or 'Joe donned a Zoot suit to express his nostalgia for the 1920's.'  See also\n\n#$actionExpressesFeeling, #$feelsTowardsObjectToDegree, #$feelsTowardsEvent.  Note that this predicate describes feelings expressed about OBJECT and does not necessarily entail communicating feelings to OBJECT.  To represent the communication of emotions to others see #$CommunicationAct-Single, #$NonVerbalCommunicating.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed855).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed855,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
