x_comment(x_MakingABankDeposit,"A collection of events; a subset of #$MoneyTransfer.  In an instance of #$MakingABankDeposit, an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible (or representative thereof) deposits currency, checks, or other financial tender into a bank account (usually the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible's personal bank account, or the bank account of the company for which they work).  An agent may make a deposit in person at the bank, but it might also be made by mail, over the telephone, electronically via modem, at an ATM machine, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed869).
