x_comment('x_interestingSentence-Unary',"(#$interestingSentence-Unary SENTENCE) means that a reviewer who looked at the #$CycLPropositionalSentence SENTENCE felt that the information the sentence expresses is (or would be) worth knowing.  This predicate makes no claims about the <i>correctness</i> of the sentence; for example, (#$isa #$Cynthia #$Astronaut) is an interesting sentence which should be asserted into the KB if correct.  See also #$implausibleSentence and #$sentenceTruthFoundToBe.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed873).
