x_comment(x_PropagatedEpidemic,"A collection of #$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemics each of whose instances are such that the cases constituting the #$Epidemic result from the spread of the infectious agent from primary cases to secondary cases and so on. Thus, there is no common source of exposure. The infecting agent must be contagious for an #$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemic to become a #$PropagatedEpidemic. For example, an #$Epidemic caused by #$Smallpox-Virus would likely be a #$PropagatedEpidemic because #$SmallpoxInfection is highly contagious (#$pathogenContagiousWithContactFromTo #$Smallpox-Virus #$Person #$Person #$highAmountOf).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed87f).
