x_comment('x_UniversalSpaceRegion-2D',"A specialization of #$UniversalSpaceRegion  and #$Surface (qq.v.).  This is the collection of two-dimensional spatial universes. In a context whose spatial universe is 2-D (see #$mtSpatialUniverse-2D), every known #$SpatialThing is spatially extended in at most two dimensions, and is spatially subsumed by that universe; and every known 2-D homogeneous extended space region (i.e. #$Surface) is part of (see #$partOfSpaceRegion) that spatial universe.\n<p>\nSee also #$UniversalSpaceRegion-1D and #$UniversalSpaceRegion-3D.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed880).
