x_comment('x_advertisementUsed-Generally',"A predicate relating an advertising event to an advertisement used in all physical advertisements (instances of #$Advertisement-IBT) generated by that event. (#$advertisementUsed-Generally EVENT ADVERT) means that ADVERT, an instance of #$Advertisement-PCW, is instantiated by each instance of #$Advertisement-IBT that is generated by EVENT. For example, an advertising campaign, CAMPAIGN, consisting of many broadcasts of single radio commercial, COMMERCIAL, would be such that (#$advertisementUsed-Generally CAMPAIGN COMMERCIAL). To relate an advertising event to one of several advertisements that it involves, use #$advertisementUsed.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed884).
