x_comment('x_keSuggestionPreds-SpecIns',"A #$KEFacilitationPredicate and #$RuleMacroPredicate.  (#$keSuggestionPreds-SpecIns <code>COL1 BINPRED COL2)</code> means that for every known specialization <code>SPEC1</code> of <code>COL1</code>, it is suggested that there be some instance <code>INS2</code> of <code>COL2</code> such that <code>(BINPRED SPEC1 INS2)</code> is known in the knowledge base.\n<p>\nFor example,\n<p>\n(#$keSuggestionPreds-SpecIns #$FruitOrVegetableFood #$typicalColorOfType #$Color)\n<p>\nmeans that for every known specialization <code>FV-TYPE</code> of #$FruitOrVegetableFood, it is suggested that there be some instance <code>COLOR</code> of #$Color such that <code>(#$typicalColorOfType FV-TYPE COLOR)</code> is known in the knowledge base.\n<p>\nSee also #$keSuggestionPredsInverse-SpecIns.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed88c).
