x_comment(x_SupplyCompany,"A specialization of both #$PrivateSectorOrganization and #$OrganizationWithBusinessCustomers.  Each instance of #$SupplyCompany is an organization whose main function (see the constant #$actsInCapacity-MainFunction) is selling supplies to other organizations.  Instances of #$SupplyCompany include all instances of #$ElectricalSupplyCompany, as well as grocery wholesalers (see the collection #$Wholesaler).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed88e).
