x_comment(x_RoadwayTypeByNumberOfLanes,"Instances of\n#$RoadwayTypeByNumberOfLanes indicate the width of an instance PATH of\n#$PathArtifact at a given point by indicating the _total_ number of lanes\nor tracks in PATH at that point. Note, then, that each instance of\n#$RoadwayTypeByNumberOfLanes will not correspond to a precise number\nrepresenting a distance but rather a scalar interval representing a range\nof distances. These belong to US Army's nomenclature for the representation\nof roads on maps of large and medium scale.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed890).
