x_comment(x_SubcollectionDisjointWithFn,"(#$SubcollectionDisjointWithFn COLLECTION SETOFCOLLECTIONS) specifies the collection of all instances of COLLECTION which disjoint with every collection in SETOFCOLLECTIONS.  For example (#$SubcollectionDisjointWithFn #$RecordedSoundProduct (#$TheSet #$CompactDisc-Audio #$PhonographRecord #$AudioCassette)) would include wax phonograph cylinders, reel-to-reel tapes, and 8-track tapes, but not the recorded music products sold in most #$AudioVideoStores in the late 1990s.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed892).
