x_comment(x_fromConfiguration,"(#$fromConfiguration EV CONF) means that CONF, an instance of #$Configuration, is a state of affairs that held prior to the occurrence of EV, an instance of #$ConfiguringEvent.  I.e., just prior to EV, the #$objectConfiguredDuring EV was #$configuredObjects in the #$Configuration CONF.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed894).
