x_comment(x_hasEmotionAbout,"(#$hasEmotionAbout AGENT THING) means that AGENT has some emotion of some kind about THING.  This means that the agent [#$Agent-PartiallyTangible] is also #$awareOf THING.  One should normally use a more specific predicate than #$hasEmotionAbout, depending upon the type of emotion and whether THING is a proposition [#$ELSentence-Assertible] a collection, a #$TemporalThing, or something else.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed896).
