xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed8ab,[]).
x_comment('x_LeaveOfAbsence-TimeAllocation',"A sub-collection of #$ResourceAllocationSpecification.  Instances of #$LeaveOfAbsence-TimeAllocation describe intervals of time when some instances of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible is not available to work for an #$Organization.  These individuals are not the actual instances of #$TimeInterval or any events that occur during those intervals, instead these individuals are descriptions of those intervals.  This is significant because the properties of instances of #$LeaveOfAbsence-TimeAllocation, most notably their temporal extent are distinct from the intervals to which they refer.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8ac).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed8ac,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
