x_comment(x_loudnessOfObject,"A #$SensoryAttributeDescriptionPredicate and #$QuantitySlot that relates a #$SomethingExisting to a #$AcousticNoiseLevel.  (#$loudnessLevel OBJECT LEVEL) means that the noise/loudness level of the totality of #$AudibleSounds (see #$loudnessLevel) currently being produced by OBJECT is LEVEL.\n<p>\nCf. #$loudnessOfEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8b0).
