x_comment(x_measurementResult,"The Cyc predicate #$measurementResult is used to relate a measuring event to the value that it results in.  (#$measurementResult MEAS ATT) means that the measuring activity MEAS yielded a result of ATT, which is a physical quantity.  For example, if the #$measurementResult of weighing a particular domestic letter is (#$Ounce 2.5), I put 55 cents U.S. postage on it.  See also #$MeasuringFn, #$ScalarInterval.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8b3).
