x_comment(x_RateOfChange,"A specialization of #$NonNumericScalarQuantity (q.v.).  Each instance of #$RateOfChange is a quantity measuring an amount of change or \"happening\" that occurs (over an unspecified amount of time).  Examples of rates-of-change include #$GradualChange, #$ModerateChange, and #$SuddenChange.\n<p>\nSee also #$Rate.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8c9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed8c9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505ed8c9,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
