x_comment(x_FixedFunctionalSystem,"A collection of #$FunctionalSystems whose instances are characterized by the fact that their subsystems--the #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles playing functional roles within the system--play their roles invariably, to the point that any particular #$Agent-PartiallyTangible can be readily identified by referring to a particular role or suite of roles.  I.E., in a #$FixedFunctionalSystem there is for each subsystemic #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles  that is a #$componentInSystem-FunctionalRole a role or delimited set of roles   that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible plays all of the time and that may be said to characterize the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  An #$Organism-Whole is an example of a #$FixedFunctionalSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8cf).
