x_comment('x_preface-DocumentPartOf',"(#$preface-DocumentPartOf WORK PREFACE) means that the #$GraphicalStructure PREFACE is contained within the #$StructurallySpecificWork WORK and is a preface within that work.  Prefaces precede the body of a work, are written by the author or authors of the main propositional content of the work, and often set forth the origins or purpose of the work, the subjects covered, and the audience for which the work is intended. For prefatory textual material that is written by a person other than the author of the work in which the prefatory material is contained, see #$foreword-DocumentPartOf.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8d6).
