x_comment(x_inappropriateAttireTypeAt,"This predicate relates locations to clothing types that are inappropriate clothing items for the kind(s) of event(s) that usually occur at the location. (#$inappropriateAttireTypeAt PLACE ATTIRETYPE) means that if one is a human participating in an instance of a kind of #$HumanActivity that typically occurs at PLACE it would be inappropriate to wear an instance of ATTIRETYPE.  The inappropriateness may result from social conventions or physical factors.  See also #$clothingTypeForSituationTypeAt,\n\n#$clothingTypeFormalit, #$eventTypeAppropriateClothingItem, and #$eventTypeInappropriateClothingItem.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8e5).
