x_comment(x_ElementStuff,"An instance of #$TangibleStuffCompositionType and a specialization of #$InanimateObject.  Each instance of #$ElementStuff is a piece of tangible stuff, composed of a quantity of atoms, all of which are of the same chemical element.  That is, every atom in a given piece of #$ElementStuff has the same number of protons in its atomic nucleus.  For example, all pieces of carbon (i.e. all instances of #$Carbon) are instances of #$ElementStuff.  On the other hand, instances of #$Water, because they are all constituted of both #$Hydrogen and #$Oxygen atoms, do not belong to the collection #$ElementStuff.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8ec).
