x_comment(x_ChickenPox,"A highly infectious disease whereby the skin is covered with spotty lesions that itch a lot.  #$ChickenPox is a usually a children's disease.  In adulthood, the same #$Virus (varicella zoster virus) causes the disease called #$Shingles-Ailment which is much more serious.  Only people who have already had #$ChickenPox acquire #$Shingles-Ailment.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8ed).
