x_comment('x_collectionSalientAttribute-ActuallyRepresented',"A #$CollectionSalientAttributePredicate and specialization of #$collectionSalientAttribute-Represented.  <code>(#$collectionSalientAttribute-ActuallyRepresented COL ATTR)</code> means that <code>ATTR</code> is a predicate or collection-type that is or corresponds to a salient attribute of <code>COL</code> that is explicitly represented in the CycL language by a reified term.\n<p>\nFor more details, see the specializations of this predicate, e.g. #$collectionSalientIsa, #$collectionSalientGenls, #$collectionSalientFacetingBinPred, and #$collectionSalientFacetingCollectionType.\n<p>\nCf. this predicate's sibling #$collectionSalientAttribute-VirtuallyRepresented.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8ee).
