x_comment(x_reusabilityOfTypeForType,"(#$reusabilityOfTypeForType COL EVENTTYPE ROLE QUAN) means that after an instance of COL plays the role ROLE in an event of type EVENTTYPE, then QUAN indicates the likelihood to assign to its  re-usability if one does not know how many times it has played that role before.  If QUAN is a high value this indicates that things are  unlikely to wear out after playing the indicated role.  So we might say that (#$reusabilityOfTypeForType #$Hammer #$HammeringANail #$deviceUsed \n\n#$veryHighAmountOf) because hammers survive many hammering events without any decrease in functionality.  However, (#$reusabilityOfTypeForType #$FacialTissue BlowingOnesNose #$deviceUsed #$veryLowAmountOf).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8f4).
