x_comment(x_DisplayingSomething,"A subcollection of #$VisualInformationGeneratingAct, #$DisplayingSomething is the collection of #$PurposefulActions in which instances of #$PartiallyTangible play the role of #$instrument-Generic when they are intentionally made to be visually accessible by an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible, which plays the #$Role #$senderOfInfo.  This particular collection makes no committments on the intentions or success of the #$senderOfInfo in relation to the display reaching an audience.  Thus, #$recipientOfInfo and #$recipientOfInfo-Intended are note necessary roles in instances of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8fc).
