x_comment(x_Contempt,"An instance of #$EmotionalQuantityType.  Each instance of #$Contempt is a feeling of one agent toward another agent, in which the latter agent is viewed by the former as low, vile, feeble, or ignominious.   Instances of #$Contempt vary depending on the intensity of the feeling, the subject experiencing the feeling, and/or the object of dislike.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed8fe).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed8fe,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
