x_comment(x_intendedAudienceSizeOfCW,"(#$intendedAudienceSizeOfCW IBT-TYPE NUM) means that NUM is the number of people expected to access instances of IBT-TYPE, a #$SpecifiedInformationBearingThingType.  For #$Periodicals, and other such subsets of #$HardcopyInformationBearingObject, the #$intendedAudienceSizeOfCW will be about equal to the number of copies printed.  See also #$MediaSeriesProductType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed907).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed907,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
