x_comment(x_LevelOfPain,"A specialization of #$InternalSensoryQuantity whose elements represent the qualitative levels of pain that may be felt by a perceptual agent.  The source of the pain could be either external or internal; in either case, the subjective feeling is generally `sharper' and hopefully shorter-lived than just `a feeling of discomfort' (see: #$LevelOfDiscomfort.)") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed908).
