x_comment('x_num-GenQuantRelnFrom',"An instance of #$GeneralizedQuantifierRelation (q.v). (#$num-GenQuantRelnFrom RELN THING COL NUM) is true if for exactly NUM instances X of COL (RELN THING X) holds.  For example, (#$num-GenQuantRelnFrom #$neighbors #$BillClinton #$AdultMalePerson 3) means there are exactly three adult males among Bill Clinton's neighbors.  The third argument place of this of this predicate is constrained to instances of #$SetOrCollection -- the more specific #$relationInstanceExistsCount (the third argument place of which is constrained to instances of #$Collection) should be used instead of #$num-GenQuantRelnFrom whenever possible.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed90b).
