x_comment(x_TransportationContainerProduct,"#$TransportationContainerProduct is a specialization of #$ContainerArtifact and #$Conveyance.  Each instance of #$TransportationContainerProduct is a container in which the primary function is to transport substances or objects.  A few examples are #$Luggage, #$BabyCarrier, and #$Trailer.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed90d).
