x_comment(x_attemptAtPerforming,"(#$attemptAtPerforming ATTEMPT ACTIONTYPE) means that\nATTEMPT is an attempt to perform ACTIONTYPE. Specifically, there is an\n#$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGENT who, by virtue of playing the #$performedBy role in\nATTEMPT, is intending to play the #$performedBy role in an instance of\nACTIONTYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed90e).
