x_comment('x_Soul-Spiritual',"The collection of all souls.  In some microtheories every #$SentientBeing incarnates a #$Soul-Spiritual.  In some, souls are eternal or immortal.  In some microtheories souls may incorporate multiple times in the same or different types of organisms, while in others a soul incorporates but a single time.  Souls are #$FictionalThings in #$NaturalismMt.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed90f).
