x_comment(x_ExpellingFromPosition,"A specialization of #$ExpellingFromStatus and #$TransferOut (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$ExpellingFromPosition is an action in which someone holding a position in some organization (see #$PersonTypeByPositionInOrg) is expelled from that position (but not necessarily from membership in that organization; cf. #$ExpellingFromMembership).  Note that this collection does <i>not</i> include voluntary resignations (cf. #$ResigningFromEmployment).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed910).
