x_comment('x_foreword-DocumentPartOf',"(#$foreword-DocumentPartOf WORK FOREWORD) means that the #$GraphicalStructure FOREWORD is contained within the #$StructurallySpecificWork WORK and is a foreword within that work. Forewords precede the body of a work, are written by someone other than the author of the work as a whole (but often praise that author or the work as a whole), and often introduce the author or the subject matter of the work.  Individuals who write forewords are often distinguished in a particular field or otherwise notable for their achievements.  For prefatory textual material that is written by the author of the work, see #$preface-DocumentPartOf.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed914).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed914,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
