x_comment('x_beneficiary-Generic',"(#$beneficiary-Generic EVT IND) allows one to say that IND has benefitted in some way from EVT.  Where IND is an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible, be sure to use the more specific predicate, #$beneficiary.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed918).
