x_comment(x_CourseDuringAMeal,"A specialization of #$ManipulatingFoodOrDrink.  Each instance of #$CourseDuringAMeal is an event in which one or more diners at a meal consume a single course.  Specializations of #$CourseDuringAMeal include #$AppetizerCourse, #$MainCourse, and #$DessertCourse.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed919).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed919,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
