x_comment('x_Multi-MovementComposition',"The collection of all #$MusicalComposition-Classicals that consist of two or more movements. Individual movements are like compositions in their own right, often separated by pauses and in different keys, but they are not typically performed except as a part of the larger composition, and audiences are expected not to interrupt the performance by clapping in between movements.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed91c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed91c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
