xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed91c,[]).
x_comment(x_DisarmingADevice,"The collection of actions in which the #$DeviceTypeByState of a #$PhysicalDevice (such as a #$TrapDevice, #$Bomb, or #$AutomaticFirearm) is changed from armed (or cocked) to idle (or uncocked), without an intervening firing or triggering of the device.  If it is a firing or triggering that causes the state change, that is a discharging of the device, not a disarming of it.\n<p>\nThis collection is general enough to include, e.g., disarming an alarm system.  For the important special case in which the #$deviceDisarmed is a #$Weapon, see #$DisarmingAWeapon.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed91d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed91d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
