x_comment(x_Dislike,"An instance of #$EmotionalQuantityType.  Each instance of #$Dislike is some agent's feeling of disaffection or disaffinity for an agent, event, or thing.  Instances of #$Dislike vary depending on the intensity of the feeling, the subject experiencing the feeling, and/or the object of dislike.  Specializations of #$Dislike include #$Contempt, #$Hate, and #$Disgust.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed923).
