x_comment(x_Peat,"The collection of all pieces of peat, a kind of partially decomposed            vegetable matter formed           by the partial decomposition of aquatic and semiaquatic #$Plants.           #$Peat is found naturally occurring in various kinds of #$WetlandRegion in           temperate climates and consists mostly of #$Water.  Peat has many uses, e.g.           as mulch, as a soil conditioner, as an insulating material and, when dried            (see #$Peat-Dried), as fuel.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed92c).
