x_comment(x_slotValueSum,"(#$slotValueSum SLOT THING SETORCOL) says that the value of SLOT for\nTHING can be computed by summing the values of SLOT over the elements\nof SETORCOL.  For instance, world population is equivalent to the sum\nof population over every country: (#$slotValueSum #$numberOfInhabitants\n#$PlanetEarth #$Country).  See also #$PlusAll: the value of\nSLOT for THING is the value of (#$PlusAll SETORCOL (#$FunctionToArg 2\nSLOT)).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed931).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed931,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
