x_comment(x_dislikesEventsOfType,"(#$dislikesEventsOfType AGENT TYPE) means that AGENT has\n\nnegative feelings associated with events of type TYPE, such that if\n\nEVT is and event of type TYPE, (#$feelsTowardsEvent AGENT EVT\n\n#$Abhorrence Positive).  We also take it that for any role\n\nROLE such that (#$dislikesRoleInEventType AGENT ROLE ACTIVITYTYPE),\n\n(#$dislikesEventsOfType AGENT ACTIVITYTYPE).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed93f).
