x_comment(x_totalValueOfAssets,"(#$totalValueOfAssets AGENT VALUE) relates the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGENT to the sum of the value of all assets (cash, physical plant and possessions, receivables, inventory, prepaid rent or mortgage, etc.) held by that agent.  Note that assets change over time, so assertions using #$totalValueOfAssets should be temporally constrained.  For example, (#$holdsIn (#$YearFn 1998) (#$totalValueOfAssets RichieRich (#$USDollarFn 1000000))).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed944).
