x_comment('x_covers-Ruglike',"An instance of #$CoveragePredicate.  (#$covers-Ruglike MAT OBJECT) means that MAT covers at least part of one surface of OBJECT.  MAT is #$SheetShapedObject, and MAT lies with its two longer dimensions parallel to OBJECT.  See also #$coversWithConformity.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed96b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed96b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
