x_comment(x_GuitarTablatureNotation,"The class of #$TablatureNotation for guitars (see #$Guitar), using marks on lines where each line designate a string of a guitar.  The positions of the marks indicate the musical notes (e.g. A,B,C,D,E,F,G in various octaves); each mark corresponds to such a note that is to be played, and it visually corresponds approximately to a physical location on the guitar.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed980).
