x_comment(x_doesTo,"This event-predicate template expresses the relation between the\nagent (active participant) and the object (passive participant) of an\nactivity. Example: (#$doesTo #$Cleaning #$PeterSuen PetersDesk) is true iff Peter\ncleans Peter's desk (or: is cleaning, depending on the way the assertion is\ntemporally qualified).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed983).
