x_comment(x_buyer,"An #$AgentiveRole (q.v.) and specialization of #$exchangers  that relates a given #$MonetaryExchangeOfUserRights event to the paying #$Agent-PartiallyTangible(s)  in that event.  <code>(#$buyer EXCHANGE BUYER)</code> means that <code>BUYER</code> purchases goods or  services or access rights for sale in <code>EXCHANGE</code>.  <code>BUYER</code> might make the purchase  either directly or through an agent.  Also see and compare #$buyingPerformer and  #$buyingAgent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed984).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed984,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
