x_comment('x_LectureSeries-CW',"The collection of series of #$Lecture-CW that,\n\n  when taken together, constitute a \n\n#$PropositionalConceptualWork.  Keep in mind that\n\n not all (#$GroupFn #$Lecture-CW)'s can be\n\n considered #$ConceptualWorks, even when \n\n  their \"conjunction\" constitues an\n\n official \"course of study.\"  Often,\n\n   #$GraduateSeminarSeriess are performances of\n\n   #$LectureSeries-CW, but this is by no means\n\n always the case. Note, too, that\n\n  #$LectureSeries-CW is not a spec of #$TextualPCW, as\n\n  the performances of their instances (#$FormalLectureSeries-IBTs)\n\n often involve much more than a simple\n\n  expression of propositions, e.g., \n\n  simple experiments.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed987).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed987,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
