x_comment(x_LiquidFilm,"A collection instances of #$Film-SheetOrCoating that are liquid.  Positive exemplars include a patchy film of oil on water, wet paint, and the surface of soap bubbles.  Note that that collection 'soap bubble' is not a kind of #$LiquidFilm but rather a structure whose parts include elements of #$LiquidFilm.  The complete film of a soap bubble is not an exception to the exception to the general rule that all instances of #$Film-SheetOrCoating are also instances of #$SurfaceRegion-Bounded.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed988).
