x_comment(x_Ia64ProcessorArchitecture,"An instance of #$ComputerTypeByArchitecture. #$Ia64ProcessorArchitecture is a type of CISC computer chip, produced by #$IntelCorporation, postdating the popular #$X86ProcessorArchitecture (which included the Pentium), and released around 2001. It also goes by the name of \"Itanium\".") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed990).
