x_comment(x_objectTendered,"A binary predicate which relates instances of #$MoneyTransfer to instances of #$TenderObject, and indicates the financial instrument which is used in a particular transfer of money.  (#$objectTendered TRANS OBJECT) means that the #$TenderObject OBJECT is used to transfer funds in the #$MoneyTransfer event TRANS.  Note that OBJECT is distinct from the quantity of #$MonetaryValue (q.v.) transferred in TRANS (see the related predicate #$moneyTransferred), although of course OBJECT has some monetary value --- is `worth' a certain amount, generally calculated from the numbers printed or stamped or engraved on the #$TenderObject OBJECT --- which in turn is an instance of #$MonetaryValue.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed991).
