x_comment(x_AttributiveReference,"A collection of #$TextStrings.  This instance of #$TextStringTypeByReferenceType consists of the collection of #$TextStrings that are a reference in a certain work which attribute some instance of #$AspatialInformationStore to a particular #$IntelligentAgent or other instance of #$ConceptualWork.  For example, works that contain images often include #$TextStrings that attribute those images to an #$IntelligentAgent or other #$ConceptualWork.  The #$TextString that so attributes the visual sub-structure to something external to the work would be an instance of #$AttributiveReference.  #$TextStrings that immediately follow a #$quotationOfExternalAgent often have an #$AttributiveReference.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed992).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed992,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
