x_comment(x_AppearancesByFn,"#$AppearancesByFn takes as argument any instances of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible and returns the collection of all organized events at which that agent makes a public appearance.  For example, (#$AppearancesByFn #$KeithRichards) returns the collection of all organized events featuring a public appearance by Keith Richards of the #$RollingStones.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed993).
