x_comment(x_sensoryResponse,"(#$sensoryResponse EVT ROLE QUANT) means that a #$PerceptualAgent who participates in the #$PhysicalEvent EVT in the manner ROLE has a quantity of the #$SensoryQuantity QUANT. For example, if TOUCH is a touching-something-very-cold action, then (#$sensoryResponse TOUCH #$doneBy (#$PositiveAmountFn #$LevelOfDiscomfort)) is true --- i.e., whoever does that touching action is likely to feel some discomfort.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed995).
