xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed999,[]).
x_comment(x_PreventingFn,"(#$PreventingFn EVENT-TYPE) maps from the collection EVENT-TYPE (a subclass of #$Event) to a collection of preventings of events of type EVENT-TYPE.  Thus the result of (#$PreventingFn #$CriminalAct) would be the collection of crime prevention events (a subclass of #$PreventingFromHappening).  #$PreventingFn operates on the #$Collection level, and is used to talk about kinds of preventings that can occur.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed99a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed99a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
