x_comment(x_alphabeticalIndexTo,"'(#$alphabeticalIndexTo CWSTRUC BODY INDEX)' means that, within the #$CWStructure CWSTRUC, the #$TextString INDEX is an alphabetical index to the #$GraphicalStructure BODY.  The instance of #$GraphicalStructure which is indexed by the #$TextString that is the third argument of #$alphabeticalIndexTo may be the entire #$TextualPCWStructure of which the index is a part (i.e., some indices reference only the body of a work, while others reference the body, the preface, appendices, and other parts of the work).  Consequently, the value for the first and second arguments of #$alphabeticalIndexTo may be identical.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9a4).
