xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed9aa,[]).
x_comment(x_PersonalTax,"An instance of #$MicrotheoryType and a subset of #$Tax-COC. Each instance of #$PersonalTax places an obligation upon certain persons to pay a tax to some agent (usually, the agent in question will be the government of some instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity). An instance of #$PersonalTax places no tax obligation on any kind of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible (for instance, corporations) other than persons.  A positive example would be a state's tax on personal income, while a negative example would be a state's corporate income tax.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9ab).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed9ab,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
