x_comment(x_BridgingHomeLoan,"An instance of #$LoanAgreementTypeByUse, and a specialization of #$HomeLoan.  Each instance of #$BridgingHomeLoan is a short term loan used to cover the cost of buying a new house before the old one has been sold.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9b0).
