x_comment(x_ibtCreator,"A binary predicate that relates instances of #$InformationBearingThing to instances of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible. (#$ibtCreator IBT AGENT) means that AGENT originally created IBT, an #$InformationBearingThing.  For instance, painters are #$ibtCreators of their paintings, programmers are #$ibtCreators of their programs, and speakers are #$ibtCreators of their #$AnimalUtterance-IBTs.  An IBT can have more than one #$ibtCreator if multiple #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles contributed to its creation, as is typically the case with Hollywood movies, for example.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9b3).
