x_comment(x_FlowControlDevice,"The collection of all #$PhysicalDevices which control the flow of fluid.  Some subsets of this collection, like #$Dam, may mainly obstruct flow, but are also used to produce an outflow that is somewhat independent to the inflow to the #$WaterReservoir.   A #$Stopper, although it can be used to halt exiting flow (by its insertion) and later can allow the flow again (by its removal) is not an example of a #$FlowControlDevice because it does not regulate the flow, but merely blocks it upon being positioned by something external to the #$Stopper.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9b5).
