x_comment(x_PlacingInAnOrientation,"A collection of events.  An instance of #$PlacingInAnOrientation is an event in which an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible changes an object's #$orientation. The event might be a #$Movement-TranslationEvent, like carrying a book from a shelf and laying it in a #$HorizontalOrientation on a table, or it might be a #$Movement-Rotation, like laying down a standing book without moving it to a different place.  In any case, the action is #$doneBy some participant other than the #$objectMoving. Use #$PlacingInOrientationFn to specify particular #$orientations.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9bc).
