x_comment(x_Gratitude,"An instance of #$EmotionalQuantityType.  Each instance of #$Gratitude is some agent's feeling of appreciation towards another agent for a benefit or favor received from the latter agent.  Instances of #$Gratitude vary depending on the intensity of the feeling, the subject experiencing the feeling, or the object of gratitude.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9bf).
