x_comment(x_disapprovedStatement,"#$disapprovedStatement is a specialization of #$ist-Information.  (#$disapprovedStatement INFO DISAPPROVED) means that the #$ELSentence-Assertible DISAPPROVED represents some or all of what the agent disapproves of in the content (INFO) of a disapproval expressed by the agent.  See also #$Disapproving-CommunicationAct.  Cf. #$Approval-CommunicationAct.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9c0).
