x_comment(x_numberOfSexualPartners,"(#$numberOfSexualPartners ?ANIM ?NUM) is true if and only if the individual ?ANIM, which \nmust be an instance of #$Animal has ?NUM #$sexualPartners, where ?NUM must be an integer. This\nmust be understood in the same context in which the predicate #$sexualPartners (q.v.)\nis understood to apply.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9c1).
