x_comment('x_Fender-AutoBodyPart',"The collection of all fenders. A type of #$AutoBodyPart and #$NewAutoDealerPartsMarketCategory. The collection #$Fender-AutoBodyPart is a #$ManufacturedGoodsType, a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType, and an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory.  Each instance of #$Fender-AutoBodyPart is a part of an automobile body that frames a wheel well.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9cb).
