x_comment(x_typicallyLikesRelationshipToType,"(#$typicallyLikesRelationshipToType AGENT_TYPE REL COLLECTION) means that a typical instance of AGENT_TYPE likes to be in the relationship REL with an instance of COLLECTION [#$likesRelationshipToType].  If the relationship is a #$Role and the #$Collection is a spec of #$Event, then #$likesRoleInEventType applies among the typical instance of AGENT_TYPE, #$Role, and #$Event type.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9ce).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed9ce,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
