x_comment(x_pathogenContagiousWithContactFromTo,"(#$pathogenContagiousWithContactFromTo LBA ORGTYPE1 ORGTYPE2 LEVEL) means that if the #$LivingBiologicalAgent LBA causes a certain type of infection (see #$pathogenTypeCausesInfectionType) and an instance of ORGTYPE2 comes into physical contact (see #$PhysicalContactSituation) with an instance of ORGTYPE1 while said instance of ORGTYPE1 has an infection of this type, the likelihood of the instance of ORGTYPE2 contracting an infection of the same type is LEVEL.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9d2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed9d2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
