x_comment(x_Tune,"The collection of all simple tunes, whether recorded or not, extant for centuries or composed on the spot, instrumental or sung, etc.  This is not to be confused with  performances of the tune, although musical performances normally enact instances of one or more #$Tunes.  A song (#$Song-CW) normally has a single #$Tune as a #$subWorks, while a Symphony would have several.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9d5).
