xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ed9d8,[]).
x_comment(x_listHasFormat,"'(#$listHasFormat LIST FORMAT)' means that the #$List-Information LIST has the #$GraphicalStructureByFormat FORMAT.  The #$GraphicalStructureByFormat characterizes the way in which items of an instance of #$List-Information (see #$itemInList-Information) are arranged spatially or in which such items are otherwise distinguished one from another.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9d9).
