x_comment('x_Bill-Currency',"A specialization of #$Currency. Each instance of this collection is an object, generally made of paper (sometimes plastic) used to transfer a quantity of #$MonetaryValue between #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles.  The piece of paper iteself is of little value, but the bill has the value it does because, due to governmental and societal agreement, it can be exchanged for objects or services. It is often engraved (see #$Engraving-Print) with a watermark in order to forestall counterfeiting.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9da).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed9da,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
