x_comment(x_NegativeChange,"#$NegativeChange is an instance of #$LevelOfChange that denotes either (i) a negative change (i.e., a decrease) in the second argument of a binary predicate that takes a quantity as its second argument (\"quantity slot\"), or (ii) a negative dependency between the second argument values of two such binary predicates (i.e., independent increase => dependent decrease, and independent decrease => dependent increase).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9db).
