x_comment(x_requiresForRole,"(#$requiresForRole SIT COL ROLE) means that the success of an agent acting deliberately in the #$Situation SIT (see the predicate #$successfulForAgents) is contingent upon the existence of an instance of the collection COL playing the role ROLE in SIT. Compare this predicate to #$someTypePlaysRoleInSituationType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9dd).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed9dd,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
