x_comment(x_SingingARecitative,"#$SingingARecitative is the collection of musical events which are instances of both #$AnimalUtterance-IBT and #$Song. In other words, a recitative is a speech, which would ordinarily be spoken, but instead is sung. Recitatives occur in operas and musical theatre. (See #$OperaPerformance and #$PlayPerformance-Musical.)") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9e9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ed9e9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
