x_comment(x_costRate,"The rate of cost that applies to an individual product.  The rate may be a #$MoneyPerVolumeRatio, #$MoneyPerMassRatio, etc.  Multiplying this rate by the actual quantity involved (e.g. the mass of the object sold/serviced) gives the #$objectBasicPrice or #$serviceBasicPrice of the object or service.  Since this is instance-level, it will always refer to a particular object (or service) sold by a particular agent at a particular rate.  The value on this slot will therefore often be inferred from a #$costRateForType assertion.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9f1).
