x_comment(x_GameOfProgramFn,"#$GameOfProgramFn is a unary function which returns an instance of #$Game when given an instance of #$ComputerGameProgram as an argument. (#$GameOfProgramFn PROG) denotes the instance of #$Game which is the structured and rule-governed activity in which one engages when one plays with a running copy of PROG.  For example, (#$GameOfProgramFn #$CompleteChess-TheGame) denotes #$Chess.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9fa).
