x_comment(x_MortgageAgreement,"This is a collection of agreements; a subset of #$AuthorizedAgreement.  Each element of #$MortgageAgreement is generated from an instance of #$EnteringIntoAMortgageAgreement.  A #$MortgageAgreement contains the terms of a mortgage (in which money is borrowed and a claim against the borrower's property is given to secure the loan).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ed9fc).
