x_comment(x_feelsTowardsEvent,"(#$feelsTowardsEvent AGT EVT EMOTYPE DEGREE) means that the #$IntelligentAgent AGT feels a feeling of the #$EmotionalQuantityType EMOTYPE towards the #$Event EVT, with intensity DEGREE.\nNote: the first argument can be a non-human intelligent agent, such as a dog or a company, because we often ascribe feelings and emotions to them, and they often behave consistently with having such feelings and emotions.  See also #$feelsTowardsObjectToDegree. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda01).
