x_comment(x_RetainingUserRights,"A collection of static situations holding between an agent and some #$Thing during which the agent retains some user rights over said thing (see #$SituationTypeByUserRights). Such situations may have subevents but they need not.  For example, saving one's money may involve putting money into a savings account or it may not involve any events at all (as when one simply does not *spend*). See also #$objectRetained and #$agentRetaining.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda02).
