x_comment(x_NonNaturalThing,"The collection of non-natural individuals.  This collection is hard to precisely define but, roughly, something is an instance of this collection just in case it is one of the following: 1) #$Individual acts that are intentionally performed by #$IntelligentAgents, or 2) #$Individuals that in some significant sense \"could only have been the result\" of the intentional activities of #$IntelligentAgents (or groups thereof).   Positive examples in the first category include #$CesareanBirths, negative examples include eating.  Positive examples in the second category include instances of industrial pollution and tire tracks.  Negative examples include human vomit and human (bare) footprints.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda17).
