x_comment('x_Biochip-Generic',"An #$ExistingObjectType and a sub-collection of #$Sensor-Device. An instance of #$Biochip-Generic is a device that encapsulates (usually in a very small apparatus) the means for performing a specific type of chemical or biochemical reaction.  These apparatuses are sensors because the chemical reactions are typically designed to determine the presence of specific types of chemicals, compounds, or molecular structures (e.g., #$DNAStuff) within a sample.  For instance, biochips can be used to detect from the presence of #$Anthrax-Bacterium.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda1c).
