x_comment(x_jobPositionDuties,"(#$jobPositionDuties JOB ACT-TYPE) means that the #$JobPosition JOB requires that the #$Person filling the position perform #$Events of type ACT-TYPE. This predicate relates an instance of #$JobPosition JOB to the duties required of the person who stands in the #$personWithJobPosition relation to JOB. To relate job duties to a subcollection of #$WorkAgreements, use #$duties. To relate job duties to an instance of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible who is obligated to perform them in part because she is an instance of an #$PersonTypeByOccupation, use #$dutiesOfAgentInJob.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda1d).
