x_comment(x_HelpingEventTypeFn,"This is a function that, applied to a collection (type)  of #$Events, denotes the collection of all #$Events in which one or more #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles help one or more other #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles in an instance of that type of #$Event. (#$HelpingEventTypeFn FOO) denotes the collection of all events in which agents help others in the events of type FOO.   Example: (#$HelpingEventTypeFn #$Buying) refers to the collection of all cases of helping someone to buy or sell something.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda20).
