x_comment(x_workedOnAssignmentForHoursDuringIntervalWithDescription,"An assertion of the form (#$workedOnAssignmentForHoursDuringIntervalWithDescription AGENT ASSIGN QUANT INTERVAL STRING) states that the #$IntelligentAgent AGENT worked on the #$Assignment-Specification ASSIGN for an interval of duration QUANT, some #$Time-Quantity, during the #$TimeInterval INTERVAL and that STRING is a natural language description of that work.  As of August 13, 2004, this is a work-around predicate designed for use with the FET in order to minimize the number of repetitive fields in #$ProjectManagement-TemplateTopic.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda27).
