x_comment(x_importCapacity,"(#$importCapacity REGION PRODUCT-TYPE RATE) means that the #$Rate RATE is the greatest possible rate at which instances of the #$ProductType PRODUCT-TYPE could be imported by the #$GeographicalRegion REGION.  Note that RATE may be expressed as a #$MonetaryRate, but also as rate of volume, mass or number depending on the type of product.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda31).
