x_comment(x_DeviceFinishingARun,"A collection of events.  An instance of #$DeviceFinishingARun is an event in which some device finishes its normal cycle of processes, e.g., an instance of #$AirplaneLanding.  This is often --- but not always --- the same thing as a device going from the #$Device-On state to the #$Device-Off state --- e.g., the airplane stays `on' for many minutes before it took off.  One could also define the collection dead-start-to-finish-airplane-flight, which would not end with an #$AirplaneLanding but with a true turning-off of the airplane, or even with the exiting of the last crewmember and the post-flight maintenance check of the aircraft.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda32).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eda32,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505eda32,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
