x_comment(x_DeployingMaterial,"The collection of all #$Events, particularly in military or terrorist contexts, in which material,           such as #$ExplosiveMaterial or an #$ExplosiveDevice, is moved and placed into a position           serving some strategic purpose for the #$IntelligentAgent performing the deployment.           It is important that the movement and placement serve some strategic purpose for a            particular instance of #$Event to be an instance of #$DeployingMaterial.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda35).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eda35,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
