x_comment(x_EscapingPrison,"The collection of all escapes from #$Prison.  In every instance, some #$Agent-PartiallyTangible who was confined to a #$Prison escapes from those confines, against the will of whatever #$Agent-PartiallyTangible was doing the imprisoning (see #$GettingFreeFromControl).  Note that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible doing the escaping may be an individual #$Person or a #$Group of people, provided the #$Group is known to qualify as an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible in its own right.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda36).
