x_comment(x_regionLacksTransportMeans,"(#$regionLacksTransportMeans REGION TRANSPORTMEANSTYPE) means that the #$GeopoliticalEntity REGION has no regular, major use of or access to transport by means of instances of TRANSPORTMEANSTYPE.  For example, a #$LandlockedGeopoliticalEntity like #$SanMarino may lack #$Ships.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda3b).
