x_comment(x_Visibility,"A specialization of #$WeatherQuantity.  Each instance of #$Visibility is a measure of how clear the ambient fluid at a location is.  Higher values indicate one can see farther (than one could have at lower values at the same location).  Different degrees of visibility may be designated using a #$GenericValueFunction.  Visibility at a location is expressed with the predicate #$ambientVisibility.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda3c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eda3c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
