x_comment(x_SupplyingMeansOfCommunication,"This collection comprises a large class of (possibly extensive in time and complex)           instances of #$PurposefulAction.  In each instance of this collection some           instance of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible, an  instance of (#$GroupFn #$Agent-PartiallyTangible) or simply some collection of instances           of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible (e.g. the #$Persons in some neighborhood) gain some kind of user rights           to some #$Artifact, e.g. a post office or a radio, that is #$behaviorCapable           of being an #$instrument-Generic in some subcollection of #$InformationTransferEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda3e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eda3e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
