x_comment('x_ComputerGameProgram-SimulationGod',"The collection of instances of #$ComputerGameProgram wherein the major playing activity consists in constructing a model\nor simulation of some functioning thing. The enjoyment in these games comes from playing God, so to speak. The prime examples of this genre are\nthe various Sim- games, such as #$SimCityClassic-TheGame. Flying and driving\ngames are simulations of an experience rather than the creation of a model and \nare not necessarily instances of #$ComputerGameProgram-SimulationGod.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda4b).
