x_comment(x_makesVulnerableToDegree,"(#$makesVulnerableToDegree SITUATION OBJECT RESULT-TYPE DEGREE) means that when in            situation SITUATION, existing object OBJECT is vulnerable to hardships of type            RESULT-TYPE to degree DEGREE. The baseline level of vulnerability is #$lowAmountOf,           when sound security measures are in place, vulnerability is #$veryLowAmountOf,  and when            more than one situation makes an object vulnerable to the same ill effect,            vulnerability to that effect increases.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda4c).
