x_comment('x_feelsTowardsObject-Ternary',"(#$feelsTowardsObject-Ternary AGENT OBJECT FEELING) says that the instance of #$IntelligentAgent AGENT feels the feeling FEELING towards OBJECT.  For example, (#$feelsTowardsObject-Ternary (#$GovernmentFn #$Israel) #$YassirArafat (#$HighAmountFn #$Distrust)) says that the Israeli government feels a high amount of distrust towards Yassir Arafat.  See also #$feelsTowardsObjectToDegree.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda4d).
