x_comment('x_Stealing-Embezzlement',"A collection of events; a subcollection of #$Stealing-InsideJob.  In an instance of #$Stealing-Embezzlement, an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible steals objects, usually money, which that agent was trusted not to steal.  (It is because of that trust that the embezzler has some privileged access to the things stolen, which facilitates the embezzlement.)  The perpetrator need not be in the same physical location with the stolen object during the stealing, since embezzlement is sometimes accomplished by manipulating ledger entries, account balances, bank deposits, funds transfers, and other financial data and activities, which can be done at a site remote from the money, rather than by physically removing the valuables.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda56).
