x_comment(x_feelsSensationInRegionAtLevel,"(#$feelsSensationInRegionAtLevel AGT BODYPARTTYPE QUANT) means that the #$PerceptualAgent AGT feels on its body, in the area specified by BODYPARTTYPE, the quantity of the #$SensoryQuantity indicated by QUANT.  For example, Cyc's knowledge base contains an assertion that the very same part of one's body doesn't feel both hot and cold at the same time.  #$feelsSensationInRegionAtLevel can also be used to state symptoms, e.g., when you're feverish, your head feels hot.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda5d).
