x_comment(x_ComplementaryBasePairingError,"#$ComplementaryBasePairingError is the collection of #$BasePairing events in which there is an error in base-pairing.  Normally, the #$NitrogenBases that are paired in an instance of #$BasePairing are complementary (see #$complementaryBases). However, although it occurs infrequently, it is chemically possible for two #$NitrogenBases that are not complementary to become paired. When this happens, biologists regard it as a base pairing error.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda7f).
