x_comment(x_CapturingSomething,"Every instance of #$CapturingSomething is an instance of #$TransferOfControl in which some #$Agent-PartiallyTangible is captured, in the sense that his, her, or its freedom of action is circumscribed in some important respect.  In every instance of #$CapturingSomething, the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible that #$losesControl is the same as the #$objectOfControlTransfer:  in fact, this is a definitive feature of instances of the collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda84).
