x_comment(x_SpinLikeATop,"Spinning of an object about a near vertical axis.  The #$Axis of rotation rests or moves about a surface which is usually somewhat horizontal.  If the axis of spin is not directly vertical, gravitational force will cause the spinning object to experience #$Precession.  During the spin the velocity of rotation slows down so the #$Stabilizing factor decreases.  The object may translate about the supporting surface as it spins.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda87).
