x_comment(x_opponentsInSitType,"An instance of #$RuleMacroPredicate. \n  (#$opponentsInSitType AGT1 AGT2 TYPE) says that \n  (#$situationTypeIsSuchThat TYPE \n    (#$opponents AGT1 AGT2))).  In other words, situations of type TYPE are typically such that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles AGT1 and AGT2 are opponents.  TYPE need not be a spec of #$ConflictEvent; two units could be opponents in a #$CourseOfAction without directly engaging each other (see, #$coaOpponents).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda8b).
