x_comment(x_EntryPointsFn,"An instance of #$Function-Denotational and #$UnaryFunction\nthat takes an\ninstance of #$PathSystem as an argument and returns the\ncollection of entry points into that system.  \n(#$EntryPointsFn PATH_SYS) denotes the subcollection of\n(#$PointsInSystemFn PATH_SYS), i.e. the collection of points of\nthe instance PATH_SYS\nof #$PathSystem, that are entry points into PATH_SYS, i.e.\nthe collection of all points POINT such that\n(#$entryPointToSystem POINT PATH_SYS) holds.  See also\n#$entryPointOnPathToSystem and #$entryPathToSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda8d).
