x_comment(x_DancePerformance,"#$DancePerformance is the collection of instances of #$EntertainmentEvent such that (#$PerformingFn #$DancePerformance) returns,\n\namong other things, a set which is the union of the collection,\n\n#$Dancing-Human, and all of which instances are done either live, in\n\nfront of an audience, or for a camera, as part of the production of a\n\nfilm for television or the movies.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda91).
