x_comment(x_CircularAnnulusFn,"This function returns the spatial difference of two concentric octagons centered at a given point.\nMore formally, (#$CircularAnnulusFn POINT MIN-RADIUS MAX-RADIUS)\ndenotes the annulus determined by the instance POINT of\n#$Point and the instances MIN-RADIUS and MAX-RADIUS\nof #$Distance.  The vertices of the inner octagon are all of a fixed distance MIN-RADIUS from POINT, while the vertices of the outer octagon are all of a fixed distance MAX-RADIUS from POINT.  See also the predicate #$circularAnnulusAtCenterWithRadii.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda99).
