x_comment(x_mortalityRiskForCondition,"This relation is used to specify the 'mortality risk' for a particular type of #$AilmentCondition.  We conceive this risk to be the prior #$ProbabilityInterval that an individual afflicted with a particular AilmentCondition will die of that condition.  Alternatively (and equivalently) the relation can be viewed as making a prediction about the percentage of individuals in a population afflicted with a certain AilmentCondition that will ultimately die as the result of having that condition, assuming normal conditions and no preventative/ameliorative measures.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda9b).
