x_comment(x_MuseumStructure,"A specialization of #$Landmark, #$ModernShelterConstruction, and #$DisplayStructure.  Each instance of #$MuseumStructure is a construct used to store and display museum holdings (see #$MuseumHoldings).  An instance of #$MuseumStructure may be a part of a building, a single building, or a set of buildings.  Also, instances of this collection encompass both museaum areas open to the public as well as areas holding the non-displayed holdings as well.  See also #$Museum-Organization for the collection of organizations dedicated to housing displays in these structures.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eda9f).
