x_comment(x_Landing,"An instance of #$TemporalObjectType and a specialization of #$ArrivingAtAPlace and #$PhysicalContactMakingEvent.  Each instance of #$Landing is an event in which a (previously) #$Airborne object comes to rest on a flat, horizontal surface--often #$EarthsGround.  Specializations include #$Landing-Aircraft and #$Perching.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edaa0).
