x_comment(x_withinRangeForEventType,"(#$withinRangeForEventType OBJECT1 OBJECT2 SITTYPE) means that OBJECT1 is able to affect OBJECT2 in some SITTYPE. For instance, if #$AlbertGore is five meters away from #$GeorgeWBush, then (#$withinRangeForEventType #$AlbertGore #$GeorgeWBush #$SpokenCommunicating) but not (#$withinRangeForEventType #$AlbertGore #$GeorgeWBush #$ShakingHands).  Different kinds of actions have different ranges, and this predicate can be used to express the conditions for being able to do something to something else via different kinds of actions.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edaa8).
