x_comment(x_MSLocalIntranetZoneFn,"One of a series of functions used to represent Microsoft's \"Internet Security Zone\" concept. The function takes as its argument an instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive, which describes some action which it is possible to perform on certain computers, and allows one to state that that action may be initiated from the \"Local Intranet Zone\". The result of this function is therefore also a (qualified) instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive. The term \"Local Intranet Zone\" refers to the computer's own #$Intranet and actions must be wholly sourced from this zone to be permitted.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edab7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edab7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
