x_comment(x_practiceType,"This predicate is used for asserting that at least one of the practices with which a particular #$MedicalCareProfessional is associated specializes in work done by medical professionals of a certain #$MedicalSpecialtyType.  If (#$practiceType DOCTOR SPECIALTY), then there exists a medical practice PRACTICE such that, if (#$providerOfService DOCTOR EVENT) and EVENT is a #$MedicalCareEvent and (#$representsAgentInEvent PRACTICE DOCTOR EVENT) then  (#$actsInCapacity DOCTOR #$providerOfService EVENT #$actsInCapacity-JobCapacity ).  A doctor may of course be affiliated with different practices of different specialty types.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edab9).
