x_comment(x_eventHonors,"(#$eventHonors OCCURRENCE AGENT) means that the #$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGENT is honored or commemorated by the #$SocialOccurrence OCCURRENCE.  If AGENT is a living #$Person, then (#$eventHonors OCCURRENCE AGENT) usually implies that AGENT is present at OCCURRENCE.  Note that this is the appropriate predicate for relating a #$Funeral to the deceased person for whom the #$Funeral is in honor.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edabc).
