x_comment(x_Gourmet,"This is the collection of people who have specialized knowledge about\n\nfood together with a particular enthusiasm for fine dining. The English\n\nterm is most often used as an adjective. Initially this was incorrect, but\n\nit has become so common that it is now acceptable usage. (See #$GourmetFood).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edabe).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edabe,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
