x_comment(x_SuperiorDirection,"The general direction towards the top and away from the bottom, in or near an object that is #$AnimalShapedThing in an #$UprightPosture.  In the case of a #$Person or other object with attribute #$HumanShaped, this direction almost always corresponds to #$CephalicDirection.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edabf).
