x_comment(x_IndividualArgModeFn,"An expression of the form (#$IndividualArgModeFn SYMBOL TYPE) is used to abstractly represent an instance of the collection TYPE solely for the purposes of being able to provide semantic information abouta #$Predicate to instance of #$InductiveLogicProgrammingProgram-CW for the sake of making rule induction more efficient. This information will be used by communicated to such systems relative to an instance of #$InductiveLogicProgrammingDetermination.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edac0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edac0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
