x_comment(x_actorsPrimaryGenre,"(#$actorsPrimaryGenre ACTOR GENRE) states that the given ACTOR primarily acts in movies of a particular GENRE.  For example, #$JohnWayne is primarily an actor in movies of type #$PropositionalConceptualWork-WesternGenre.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edac5).
