x_comment(x_FilmingAVisualImage,"Using a camera device to record a visual image, whether the medium is film or videotape.  Recording a movie off of cable with an in-line VCR is *not* part of this collection - see #$VideoCassetteRecording.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edac6).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edac6,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
