x_comment('x_totalExportValue-Rate',"(#$totalExportValue-Rate REGION MONETARY-FLOW-RATE) means that the #$MonetaryRate MONETARY-FLOW-RATE is a measure of the rate of export of all goods and services from the #$GeographicalRegion REGION in terms of the monetary value of these goods and services.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edac7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edac7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
