x_comment(x_ConnectionPredicate,"A #$PredicateType that is a  specialization of #$SpatialPredicate, #$TangibleObjectPredicate, #$CoexistingObjectsPredicate, and #$InterExistingObjectPredicate (qq.v.).   Each instance of #$ConnectionPredicate is a specialization of  #$connectedTo (q.v.), and is used to describe a particular sort of  physical connection between pairs of objects.  Examples include  #$nailedTo, #$rivetedTo, #$connectedTo-Rigidly, #$rotationallyConnectedTo, #$hangsFrom, and #$in-Rooted.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edacc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edacc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505edacc,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
