x_comment(x_requiredDocumentsForEventType,"(#$requiredDocumentsForEventType DOCTYPE EVENTTYPE) means that in order to participate in an #$Event of type EVENTTYPE, as a main performer of the action, one must possess documents (or other #$InformationBearingObjects) of type DOCTYPE (i.e. either instances or instantiations depending upon whether DOCTYPE is a type of #$InformationBearingThing or #$ConceptualWork) according to some governing #$CodeOfConduct.  The particular governing #$CodeOfConduct is implicit in the context of the assertion.  For example, (#$requiredDocumentsForEventType (#$TransportViaFn #$Automobile) #$DriversLicense-LicenseAgreement)") :- x_cid(a65b16505edae0).
