x_comment(x_endsDuring,"A #$ComplexTemporalPredicate that is a specialization of both #$endsAfterStartingOf and #$temporalBoundsIntersect (qq.v.).  (#$endsDuring ENDS GOES-ON) means GOES-ON covers the end of ENDS: the #$endingPoint of ENDS is properly temporally-contained-in (see #$temporalBoundsContain) GOES-ON.\n<p>\nFor example, (#$endsDuring #$AmericanBasketballAssociation (#$YearFn 1976)) states that the ABA ceased to exist in 1976.\n<p>\nNote that ENDS and GOES-ON might not temporally intersect (see #$temporallyIntersects); though they must intersect if GOES-ON is #$temporallyContinuousDuring.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edaef).
