x_comment(x_Blimp,"#$Blimp is a specialization of #$LighterThanAirCraft, #$TransportationDevice-Vehicle, and #$Balloon.  Each instance of #$Blimp is a dirigible, motorized, and lighter-than-air craft (airships).  Each generally consists of a gas-filled gas-sack from which a control and passenger cabin hangs (the gas-sack may or may not have rigid reinforcement such as ribs).  A #$Blimp flies more slowly than an #$Airplane.  They are also called blimps, dirigibles and Zeppelins.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edaf5).
