x_comment(x_ListTypeByLength,"A collection of collections.  Each element of #$ListTypeByLength is a collection of sequences of specific lengths or a range of lengths.  For example, (#$ListOfLengthFn 2), the collection of lists of exactly two items, is a member of #$ListTypeByLength.  Another instance would be (#$StringOfLengthFn 9), the collection of 9 character strings. Yet another instance would be (#$ListOfLengthFn (#$IntegerFromToFn 0 6).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb10).
