x_comment(x_Affection,"A feeling of fondness for someone or something.  Sympathy, liking, warmth, tenderness.  This is a #$Collection --- for an explanation of that, see #$Happiness.  Some more specialized #$EmotionalQuantityTypes than #$Affection are #$Love, #$Passion, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb17).
