x_comment('x_MusicalComposition-1990sPop',"The collection of instances of MusicalComposition that are in the 1990s pop music style or genre.  As indicated by the constant name, this is the musical genre popular in the 1990s.  Popularity, however, is not the only criterion for being 'pop' music. During that decade, for instance, pop songs would be played on 'Top 40' music stations and pop musicians were major celebrities and cultural icons called upon to represent products and institute fads. Musicians whose style of music is #$MusicalComposition-1990sPop include #$AlanisMorissette, #$SpiceGirls-MusicGroup, #$BarenakedLadies-MusicGroup, and #$BackstreetBoys-MusicGroup.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb18).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb18,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
