x_comment(x_HeadwaterReservoir,"A specialization of #$WaterReservoir.  Each instance of #$HeadwaterReservoir is a contained in a basin that receives water from no outflow of another reservoir.  The Inflow to a headwater reservoir is typically primarily derived from surface runoff due to precipitation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb20).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb20,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
