x_comment(x_AssertedBelief,"An instance of #$CycArgumentTypeByJustificationType whose instances are all cyc arguments which were asserted into the KB by some agent.  This collection can be used to indicate that an assertion or group of assertions (mt contents) was purposely added to the Cyc knowledge base by some agent (as opposed to being inferred somehow by Cyc), and is to be treated as sound.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb34).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb34,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
