x_comment(x_PenetratingOuterLayerOfBLOFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction that takes a specification\nSPEC of #$BiologicalLivingObject and returns the collection\nof #$PhysicalEvents in which the outer layers of instances\nof SPEC are penetrated via some \"sharp\" object.\n(#$PenetratingOuterLayerOfBLOFn BLO-SPEC) denotes\nthe collection of all #$PhysicalEvents in which some\n\"sharp\" object, say a bullet, insect stinger, tooth,\nthorn, needle or knife, penetrates the outer surface of an\ninstance of BLO-SPEC.  For example,\n(#$PenetratingOuterLayerOfBLOFn #$Bear-Animal) denotes the\ncollection of all events in which a the skin of a bear\nis penetrated by a \"sharp\" object like a bullet\nor an insect stinger.  See #$PenetratingOuterLayerOfBLO.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb35).
