x_comment(x_Spy,"The collection of all elements of #$Person that monitor the activities of another #$Agent-PartiallyTangible under false pretenses or in a covert manner.  The goal of a spy's activities is to provide information about the observed #$Agent-PartiallyTangible for the purposes of another party (possibly the same as said spy) which is typically hostile to said #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  ``Corporate spys'', ``amateur spys'', as well as ``intelligence agents'' operating in the interests of indepent countries are possible elements of this collection.  See also #$IntelligenceGathering, #$intelligenceAgentInMission.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb45).
