x_comment(x_unwantedMatter,"This predicate is used to mark a physical object or piece of stuff as\n\nbeing undesirable in a certain location, from the perspective of a\n\ncertain #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  The unwanted matter is a #$PartiallyTangible, the\n\nlocation a #$SpatialThing-Localized.  Examples:  a #$Cockroach in a\n\n#$HumanOccupationConstruct; #$Dirt on #$SomethingToWear;  a\n\n#$ToxicSubstance in #$Food or #$Drink; a #$Virus or #$Bacterium\n\nanywhere in the #$WholeBody of the viewpoint #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  See also #$wasteProducts.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb4a).
