x_comment(x_screwedIn,"(#$screwedIn SCREW OBJ) means that a threaded cylinder, SCREW, (normally a #$Bolt or a #$Screw-Connector) is #$in-Snugly #$rotationallyConnectedTo OBJ.  SCREW may have created or expanded a #$Cavity in OBJ (in the case of a #$Screw-Connector), or may be located in a pre-existing #$Cavity in OBJ threaded so as to match the threads on SCREW.  This is normally the case if SCREW is a #$Bolt or a threaded #$LightBulbIncandescent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb58).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb58,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
