x_comment(x_harmfulActions,"The predicate #$harmfulActions is used to indicate that an agent engaged in a particular effort would (normally) diminish the chances of success in that effort by taking a certain role in events of a certain kind.  (#$harmfulActions ENDEAVOR SIT-TYPE ROLE DEGREE) means that the #$PurposefulAction ENDEAVOR would (normally) be hindered if its agent participated as described by ROLE in a situation of the type SIT-TYPE.  DEGREE is an instance of #$GenericQuantity used to give an estimate of how damaging such an occurrence would be to the success of ENDEAVOR.  For example, for an agent trying to win in a football game, fumbling the ball disadvantages the agent to a #$highToVeryHighAmountOf degree.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb5b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb5b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
