x_comment(x_permissionsGrantedToPlayRoleInType,"(#$permissionsGrantedToPlayRoleInType GRANTING EVENT SLOT)\nmeans that instances of GRANTING allow, or give permission to some\nagent to play the role of SLOT in an instance of EVENT.  For example, (#$permissionsGrantedToPlayRoleInType (#$IssuingLicenseTypeFn #$DriversLicense-LicenseAgreement) #$TransportInvolvingADriver #$driverActor) means that an instance of (#$IssuingLicenseTypeFn #$DriversLicense-LicenseAgreement) gives an agent permission to operate a motor vehicle.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb60).
