x_comment(x_evidence,"#$evidence is a more specialized form of the predicate #$topicRole.  It relates an instance of #$MentalSituation to an instance of #$SomethingExisting.  Like #$topicRole it is intended to relate an entity to an event where that entity is part of the content of some mental state of some agent in the role of #$deliberateActors in that event and shapes that agent's behavior during the course of that event.  This is a more specialized version, in that it states that this entity acts as evidence for the #$MentalSituation and, so, it promotes other beliefs that guide some agent's behavior.  For instance, a particular fossil could also play the #$evidence in an archaeological investigation.  This predicate provides a coarse representation and buries complex causal and psychological relations. Contrast with #$focalSubject and the other specializations of #$topicRole.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb77).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb77,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
