x_comment(x_likesRoleInActivityCW,"(#$likesRoleInActivityCW AGT SLOT GAME-CW) means that the instance of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible AGT likes playing the role (instance of #$ActorSlot) ROLE in the activity GAME-CW (instance of #$DevisedStructuredActivity). For example, (#$likesRoleInActivityCW #$BillClinton #$spectators #$Broomball-SportCW) means that #$BillClinton likes watching #$Broomball-SportCW. Because games and sports can be represented as either instances of #$DevisedStructuredActivity or specs of #$PlayingAGame (see #$PlayingFn), we need a predicate to represent an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible's relation to the abstract activity, an instance of #$DevisedStructuredActivity. Use #$likesRoleInEventType to represent an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible's relation to collections of #$Events.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb78).
