x_comment(x_Stealing,"A specialization of both #$GainingControl and #$ActsCommonlyConsideredCriminal.  In each instance of #$Stealing, an agent (see the collection #$Agent-PartiallyTangible) takes something belonging to another agent without that agent's permission (and possibly without that agent's knowledge).  Note that there may be some cases in which an agent takes something belonging to another agent without that agent's explicit permission that would nevertheless not be categorized as instances of #$Stealing.  For instance, a pair of agents may have an informal agreement or \"understanding\" that would cover casual \"borrowing\" from one another (and thus excuse it from being stealing).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb7f).
