x_comment(x_RequiredResourceTypeForFn,"A unary function that returns an instance of #$SecondOrderCollection when given a specialization of #$Situation as an argument. (#$RequiredResourceTypeForFn SIT-TYPE) denotes a collection of collections.  Each instance of (#$RequiredResourceTypeForFn SIT-TYPE) is a collection at least one instance of which is required to bring about an instance of SIT-TYPE.  Thus, (#$RequiredResourceTypeForFn #$GraspingSomethingWithATool) denotes the collection of collections instances of which are required to bring about #$GraspingSomethingWithATool.  If (#$someTypePlaysRoleInSituationType #$GraspingSomethingWithATool #$GraspingImplement #$deviceUsed) holds, then #$GraspingImplement is an instance of (#$RequiredResourceTypeForFn #$GraspingSomethingWithATool).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb80).
