x_comment(x_characteristicActivityTypeOfAgentType,"A #$BinaryPredicate that relates a specialization of #$Agent-PartiallyTangible to a specialization of #$Action.  <code>(#$characteristicActivityTypeOfAgentType AGT-TYPE ACT-TYPE)</code> means that performing instances of <code>ACT-TYPE</code> is what makes one an instance of <code>AGT-TYPE</code>.  This predicate is neutral with respect to whether it is\n<blockquote>\n(i) having performed <i>at least one</i> instance of <code>A-TYPE</code>;\n<br>\n(ii) <i>frequently</i> performing instances of <code>A-TYPE</code>; or\n<br>\n(iii) <i>presently</i> performing an instance of <code>A-TYPE</code>\n</blockquote>\nthat makes one (presently) an instance of <code>P-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb8d).
