x_comment(x_lexicalMtOfLanguageForSystem,"<code>(#$lexicalMtOfLanguageForSystem LEXICON LANGUAGE SYSTEM)</code> identifies <code>LEXICON</code> as the <code>LANGUAGE</code>-specific lexicon for the classification system <code>SYSTEM</code>.  For example, <code>(#$lexicalMtOfLanguageForSystem #$GeneralEnglishMt #$EnglishLanguage #$TheCycOntology)</code> means that #$GeneralEnglishMt is the English-specific lexicon for the Cyc ontology.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb91).
