x_comment(x_Blood,"The collection of all volumes of live blood.  Each instance is a portion of fluid that circulates in an #$Animal's #$CirculatorySystem or that is preserved in a living state outside of a body.  Dried blood, blood stains, and scabs are not considered to be #$Blood but (#$DeadPhysicalRemainsFn #$Blood).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb97).
