x_comment(x_CarnivoreOrder,"An instance of #$BiologicalOrder, and a specialization of #$Mammal. Instances of #$CarnivoreOrder are mammals whose teeth are adapted for efficient cutting of meat and tendon. Although instances of #$CarnivoreOrder have teeth adapted for eating meat, not all instances of #$CarnivoreOrder are meat-eaters; #$Bear-Animals are omnivorous, while #$PandaBears are usually vegetarians. See also the collection #$Carnivore.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb98).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edb98,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
