x_comment(x_ProgrammingAComputer,"A specialization of both #$ComputerActivity and #$IBTGeneration-Original. Each instance of this collection is an event in which some #$Agent-PartiallyTangible programs some #$Computer by physically typing a copy of the program into it. For particularly clever or expert programming feats, see #$Hacking. See also #$WritingAComputerProgram -- the collection of events in which some #$Agent-PartiallyTangible creates a #$ComputerProgram-CW (of course many instances of #$WritingAComputerProgram will also be instances of #$ProgrammingAComputer).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb99).
