x_comment(x_IndustryInfrastructureReqFn,"(#$IndustryInfrastructureReqFn INDUSTRYTYPE) returns the collection of all products such that any typical member of an #$Industry-Localized that is an instance of INDUSTRYTYPE will require those products in order to carry out its function.  Usually these products will need to be purchased on the commercial market.  The function takes as its argument an instance of #$IndustryType that is a collection of geographically defined industries (instances of #$Industry-Localized).  Ordinarily, this will be a collection of industries of a particular type, and may be a CycLNonAtomicTerm (NAT) reified via #$ProductionIndustryTypeFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edb9d).
