x_comment(x_completeDiseaseScriptOf,"(#$completeDiseaseScriptOf DIS-TYPE SCRIPT-TYPE) means that the #$ScriptedEventType SCRIPT-TYPE is the complex event-type that charts the typical course of the #$DiseaseType DIS-TYPE from its onset to either recovery or death. The script assumes that the disease is left untreated and that the person undergoing the disease has no immunity. Other relationships might be needed if we want to represent the course of a disease when either or both of these conditions are not met. See #$CompleteDiseaseSituationTypeFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edba1).
