x_comment(x_Admiration,"A feeling of strong approval.  An intense positive attitude towards another person(s) or group.  May be accompanied by emulation.  #$Admiration is different than #$Respect (qv).  This is a collection --- see #$Happiness for an explanation.  Some more specialized #$EmotionalQuantityTypes than #$Admiration are #$Wonder-Admiration, #$Adulation, #$Awe, etc. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505edba8).
