x_comment('x_Guitar-AcousticElectric',"Instances are instances of #$Guitar \n\nthat are acoustic -- i.e., they produce sound\n\n via string vibration amplified in a resonance \n\nchamber -- yet they\n\n are fitted with electronics and are 'plugged\n\n in' to an amplifier so as to generate a \n\n  louder and more sculptable sound.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbae).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbae,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
