x_comment(x_Willingness,"Feeling of willingness to participate in an event or situation; consenting or being prepared to participate.   (#$feelsTowardsEvent AGENT EVENT #$Willingness DEGREE) means that AGENT is willing for EVENT to come about to DEGREE degree.  Note: This is a collection; for an explanation of a typical #$EmotionalQuantityType, see #$Happiness.  A more specialized #$EmotionalQuantityType than #$Willingness is #$Eagerness.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbb1).
