x_comment(x_negativeVestedInterest,"<code>(#$negativeVestedInterest AGT OBJ)</code> means #$Agent-PartiallyTangible <code>AGT</code> has a negative interest in the object <code>OBJ</code> or in the good fortune of <code>OBJ</code>, and a positive interest in its misfortune.  Generally, <code>AGT</code> will be helped or pleased by the destruction, diminution, weakening, or retarding of <code>OBJ</code>, and will be hurt or displeased if <code>OBJ</code> is preserved or enhanced.  See #$positiveVestedInterest.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbb3).
