x_comment(x_TreatingAsIfEvent,"A collection of events. Each element represents a physical\nevent, mental event, or a composite physical and mental event that can\nbe characterized as an event in which an #$Agent-PartiallyTangible behaves (mentally or\nphysically) as though some #$ELSentence-Assertible were true of some #$Thing. For\nexample, each of the following are examples of events in which\n#$Fred is treating #$Sally as if she were his friend:\n<p>\n1. Fred says \"Sally is my friend;\"\n2. Fred thinks \"Sally is my friend;\"\n3. Fred asks Sally to help him move.\n<p>\nThe preds. to use with this event are #$asIfDuringByTo, #$asIfBy, and #$asIfTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbb9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbb9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
