x_comment(x_detects,"(#$detects SENSOR STUFF) means that instance \n\n SENSOR of #$Sensor has detected STUFF.  Be mindful of the\n\n difference between #$detects and #$perceives; only \n\n #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles perceive, which is (partially) accomplished through\n\n   the detection process via some #$Sensors to which they\n\n    are related.  So, for example, you are a perceiver,\n\n    but your ears (or perhaps your auditory sense system as a whole)\n\n     are detectors.  Only tangible things, #$PhysicalEvents or #$PartiallyTangibles, can be detected") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbbb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbbb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505edbbb,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
