x_comment(x_includedItems,"The predicate #$includedItems is used to identify the peripheral items that come with a particular packaged product.  (#$includedItems FORM ITEM) means that the #$Individual ITEM is one of the things that are included in the #$PackagedProduct FORM, along with its #$mainProduct; but ITEM is not the main product itself.  ITEM can be an accessory, owner's manual, warranty agreement, or included service.  ITEM is something that is a regular part of the package.  ITEM does NOT refer to free samples or extras thrown in--for that, see #$includesWithProductType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbc2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbc2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
