x_comment(x_genlSpecifications,"A specialization of #$generalizations. (#$genlSpecifications REFINEMENT SPECIFICATION) says that the REFINEMENT, an instance of #$Specification, is a refinement of the instance of #$Specification SPECIFICATION.  This means that any action ACT that is performed in accordance with REFINEMENT (c.f. #$situationConformsToSpecification) is one that is thereby performed in accordance with the more general SPECIFICATION.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbc3).
