x_comment(x_PossiblySelfEmployed,"A Cyc #$AttributeValue.  The attribute #$PossiblySelfEmployed is used (in conjunction with the predicate #$jobClass) to describe instances of #$PersonTypeByOccupation whose practitioners are commonly, but not always, remunerated on a contract basis or by selling their goods (or services) by the piece (or performance).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbc4).
