x_comment(x_ailmentTypicallyAcquiredBy,"(#$ailmentTypicallyAcquiredBy INFECTIONTYPE ORGTYPE ACTIONTYPE) means, colloquially, that organisms of type ORGTYPE commonly acquire infections of type INFECTIONTYPE via actions of type ACTIONTYPE. To put it more precisely, it means that if organisms of type ORGTYPE are susceptible to a type of #$Microorganism that causes infections of type INFECTIONTYPE, and an organism of type ORGTYPE is the #$nonDeliberateActors in an action of type ACTIONTYPE, the #$likelihood that the organism will acquire an infection of type INFECTIONTYPE is #$highAmountOf.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbc9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbc9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
