x_comment(x_CapitalCityOfRegion,"A specialization of #$City.  Each instance of #$CapitalCityOfRegion is a city that is the capital of its surrounding region.  This includes capitals of countries as well as capitals of subregions of countries, such as states, provinces, and counties.  Examples include #$CityOfRomeItaly, #$CityOfCardiffWales, #$CityOfAustinTX, #$CityOfAbidjanIvoryCoast, #$CityOfLhasaTibet, and #$CityOfColumbusOH.  See also #$capitalCity and #$capitalCityOfState.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbcc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbcc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
