x_comment(x_PlaybackFn,"(#$PlaybackFn MEDIA) returns the collection of events in which some instance of MEDIA is 'played back' via an automated reader/player.  For example, (#$PlaybackFn #$CompactDisc-Audio) denotes those events in which a #$CompactDisc-Audio is played by a #$CompactDiscPlayer.  'Playing' in this sense consists of reading the item's contents and 'broadcasting' them in some way -- typically, by generating either sound or video or both.  Playings of instances of MEDIA may also include an interactive component, as in the playing of a #$VideoGameCartridge by a #$VideoGameSystem.  The function does not return the complete class of automated 'reading' of encoded contents -- e.g., transferring or loading the contents of a CD into memory of a computer.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbe2).
