x_comment(x_abstractOfSameWork,"(#$abstractOfSameWork WORK TEXT) means that the #$TextString TEXT is an abstract of WORK, the #$StructurallySpecificWork within which TEXT is contained.  Abstracts are short summaries of the content of an instance of #$ConceptualWork.  Although abstracts of works often are contained in other works, the application of #$abstractOfSameWork is restricted to abstracts of the #$StructurallySpecificWork in which the abstract is contained.  For abstracts of works contained in other works, see #$abstractOfOtherWork.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbe4).
