x_comment('x_RadarUnit-MilitarySpecialty',"The collection of all instances of #$ModernMilitaryUnit-Deployable which are specialized for operations involving instances of #$RadarDevice.  Two important specializations are #$DirectionFindingRadarUnit-MilitarySpecialty and #$SignalInterceptionRadarUnit-MilitarySpecialty.  The default expectation is that a #$RadarUnit-MilitarySpecialty will be able to perform a nontrivial subclass of #$MilitaryEvents in which instances of #$RadarDevice play an instrumental role.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbe8).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edbe8,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
