x_comment(x_ClothingSizeType,"A collection of collections of collections.  Each instance of #$ClothingSizeType is a type of clothing size. Each instance of an instance is a collection of persons who have that particular size.  For instance, #$ManTypeByShoeSize is an instance of #$ClothingSizeType and each instance of that collection is a collection of people who wear that particular size.  To state a person is a particular size in something use #$humanMeasurements.  To state that an article of clothing is a particular size use #$clothingSize.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbf7).
