x_comment(x_clumpTermsDenoteDomainConceptsOf,"(#$clumpTermsDenoteDomainConceptsOf CLUMP DOMAIN) means that the concepts denoted by the terms which are in the #$CycSubjectClump, CLUMP, are members of (via #$coreConceptOfDomain) the #$ConceptTypeByDomain, DOMAIN.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbfb).
