x_comment(x_iBTTypeIsOfGenre,"(#$iBTTypeIsOfGenre IBT-TYPE GENRE) holds just in case for each instance, INS, of IBT-TYPE there is a corresponding instance of GENRE, INS-CW, such that they stand in a certain relationship.  Sometimes this relationship is 'instantiation'.  Consider the collection of actual showings of action movies MOV (not the events but the images and sounds). (#$iBTTypeIsOfGenre MOV #$PropositionalConceptualWork-ActionGenre) holds and the relation in this case is #$instantiationOfWork; (#$relationAllExists #$instantiationOfWork MOV #$PropositionalConceptualWork-ActionGenre). In general, this predicate relates a type of information bearing thing with its genre.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edbfc).
