x_comment('x_Commission-Organization',"The collection of all commissions formally organized and authorized to perform certain duties or functions. #$Commission-Organizations are groups of individuals and are usually named. Each instance of #$Commission-Organization consists of several individual #$hasMembers and may, and include a #$Commissioner-Rank as an #$organizationHead. They are different from #$Committee-Organizations in that they typically granted an #$hasAuthorityOver over #$Agent-PartiallyTangibles who aren't members of the commission's organizational chain, whereas committees are typically advisory in nature.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc09).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edc09,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
