x_comment(x_InfoStructureOfCWFn,"A function taking a #$ConceptualWork, CW, as its argument and returning the collection of all #$AbstractInformationStructures corresponding to the whole CW.  More precisely, (InfoStructureOfCWFn CW) denotes the collection of all #$CWInfoStructures, ?CWIS, such that (#$infoStructureOfCW CW ?CWIS).  For example, (#$InfoStructureOfCWFn #$MobyDickNovel) is the collection of all #$TextStrings whose physical instantiations are copies of Moby Dick (i.e., instances of #$PartiallyTangible).  Similarly, (#$InfoStructureOfCWFn LoveBugVirus-CW) denotes the collection of #$ComputerCode such that any physical instantiation of an instance of that collection is a copy of the LoveBugVirus-CW.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc1b).
