x_comment(x_MSRestrictedSitesZoneFn,"One of a series of functions used to represent Microsoft's \"Internet Security Zone\" concept. The function takes as its argument an instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive, which describes some action which it is possible to perform on certain computers, and allows one to state that that action may be initiated from the \"Restricted Sites Zone\". The result of this function is therefore also a (qualified) instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive. The term \"Restricted Sites Zone\" refers to  sites explicitly defined as such for that particular computer by its user(s).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc1c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505edc1c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
