x_comment(x_LevelOfRelaxationFeeling,"A specialization of #$InternalSensoryQuantity whose elements represent the qualitative levels of comfort/relaxation/ease that an animal may have.  This feeling is generally internal, and relatively long-lasting (compared with, e.g., the duration of a painful twinge.)  Any positive degree of this #$LevelOfRelaxationFeeling is incompatible with a high level of #$MuscleTenseness, a high #$LevelOfPain, or a high #$LevelOfDiscomfort.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc1d).
