x_comment(x_PublicLibrary,"A specialization of #$Library-Organization.  A #$PublicLibrary allows anyone to refer the items within its #$LibraryHoldings.  However, only the members of a particular #$PublicLibrary are allowed to borrow (see  #$BorrowingLibraryItem) the items within its #$LibraryHoldings.  Certain members of the #$PublicLibrary do not have to pay a membership-fee because  they satisfy certain criteria (for example, residing in the city/county/etc. where the library is based) laid down by the #$PublicLibrary.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc26).
