x_comment(x_MSInternetZoneFn,"One of a series of functions used to represent Microsoft's \"Internet Security Zone\" concept. The function takes as its argument an instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive, which describes some action which it is possible to perform on certain computers, and allows one to state that that action may be initiated from the \"Internet Zone\". The result of this function is therefore also a (qualified) instance of #$ThingTypeByCapability-Passive. The term \"Internet Zone\" refers to the internet at large, except for any sites which might have been defined for that particular computer as falling in the \"Restricted Sites\" zone, (see #$MSRestrictedSitesZoneFn.).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc33).
