x_comment(x_Nervousness,"Feeling of nervousness and excitability.  One can be nervous ABOUT something in particular, or one can have undirected feelings of anxiety.   For the former, state an assertion of the form (#$feelsTowardsObjectToDegree AGT OBJ #$Nervousness DEGREE) or (#$feelsTowardsEvent AGT EVNT #$Nervousness DEGREE); but for the latter (undirected feelings of anxiety) use (#$feelsEmotion AGT #$Nervousness).\n\nNote: This is a collection; for an explanation of a typical #$EmotionalQuantityType, see #$Happiness.  A more specialized #$EmotionalQuantityType than #$Nervousness is #$Panic.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edc37).
