x_comment(x_isograft,"An instance of #$ActorSlot and specialization (see #$genlPreds) of #$allograft. <code>(#$isograft EVENT ORGANISM-PART)</code> identifies <code>ORGANISM-PART</code> as the tissue or organ that is transplanted from a donor organism into a recipient.  For the tissue or organ to qualify as an isograft, the donor and recipient must be genetically identical (but different) organisms.  Transplantations that involve an isograph are distinguished from others that involve (mere) allografts because the recipient's immune response will be the same as it would were the transplant an #$autograft.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edccc).
