x_comment(x_instancesOfCollectionTypeRelevantToTermSummary,"<code>(#$instancesOfCollectionTypeRelevantToTermSummary COL-TYPE ERM-SUMMARY-PRED)</code> means that if a collection <code>COL</code> is an instance of <code>COL-TYPE</code>, then <code>(#$isa THING COL)</code> should appear in the fact sheet for <code>THING</code> under the category associated with <code>TERM-SUMMARY-PRED</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edd01).
