x_comment(x_krRelevant,"This is, by definition, the most general instance of #$KEFacilitationPredicate.  It is intended as a generalization for #$keStrongSuggestion, #$keWeakSuggestion, #$keNeighborSuggestion, #$keStrongConsideration and #$kePlausibleConsideration or any other such predicates which may be suggested.  This predicate, along with #$keRelevantPreds, #$keRelevantInverse, #$keGenlsRelevantPreds, #$keGenlsRelevantInverse are designed to facilitate the implementation of rapid knowledge formation tools implementing #$KEFacilitationPredicates. One should almost always use one of its specializations.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edd22).
