x_comment(x_BNPLevelTest,"A specialization of both #$MeasuringTheLevelOfASubstanceInASample and #$BloodTest.  Instances test blood samples to determine the level of (#$ChemicalSubstanceFn #$BrainNatriureticPeptide) in the blood; the result of the test (see #$measurementResult) is determined to be the #$bnpLevel for the patient at the time the blood sample was drawn.  A significantly high value (at least 500 pg per ml) is considered a strong indicator that the patient is suffering from acute congestive heart failure.  A level below 50 pg per ml is considered a negative result for CHF.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edd7b).
