x_comment(x_signOfAilment,"<code>(#$signOfAilment SIGN AILMENT)</code> means that the instance <code>SIGN</code> of #$PhysiologicalConditionType is a sign that its #$bodilyDoer has the ailment <code>AILMENT</code>.  A sign of an ailment is a condition that typically is only detectible through testing or an exam; see #$symptomOfAilment for the predicate used to identify symptoms (conditions phenomenologically detectible by the patient).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edd7d).
