x_comment(x_controllingCompany,"The predicate #$controllingCompany relates a business to the business which is its parent company.  (#$controllingCompany ORG1 PARENT) means that #$Organization ORG1 is a (partly or wholly owned) subsidiary of #$Business PARENT.  PARENT is the parent company that owns and substantially controls ORG1.  E.g., (#$controllingCompany TheLAWeekly TheVillageVoice).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edde9).
