x_comment(x_controllingOrganization,"<code>(#$controllingOrganization PARENT-ORG ORG)</code> means that <code>PARENT-ORG</code> owns <code>ORG</code>, or at least has some fundamental and ongoing control over it, although <code>ORG</code> is distinct enough from <code>PARENT-ORG</code> that it may or may not count as one of its #$subOrganizations.  A prominent specialization is #$controllingCompany, which relates an instance of #$Business to one of its subsidiaries.  #$controllingOrganization also applies in cases where one or both of the organizations is non-commercial, as when a business or school is run by religious or ideological organization, or a business establishes and then oversees a charitable foundation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eddea).
