x_comment(x_contraindicatedTreatmentTypeForActivityType,"(#$contraindicatedTreatmentTypeForActivityType PROCEDURE-TYPE ACTIVITY-TYPE) means that, if PROCEDURE is an instance of PROCEDURE-TYPE #$performedBy AGENT, and SUBJECT is the #$subjectOfMedicalProcedure-Unique of PROCEDURE, the fact that SUBJECT regularly performs (is the #$performedBy in) instances of ACTIVITY-TYPE at the time of PROCEDURE implies a (#$MediumToHighAmountFn #$Likelihood-QuantityType) that PROCEDURE will be a failure (#$failureForAgents) for AGENT.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edfbc).
