x_comment(x_contraindicatedTreatmentTypeForMedicationType,"(#$contraindicatedTreatmentTypeForMedicationType PROCEDURE-TYPE DRUG-TYPE) means that, if PROCEDURE is an instance of PROCEDURE-TYPE #$performedBy AGENT, and SUBJECT is the #$subjectOfMedicalProcedure-Unique of PROCEDURE, the fact that SUBJECT is regularly taking a drug or drugs of type DRUG-TYPE at the time of PROCEDURE implies a (#$MediumToHighAmountFn #$Likelihood-QuantityType) that PROCEDURE will be a failure (#$failureForAgents) for AGENT.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edfbd).
