x_comment(x_conditionTypeRiskFactorForProcedureSubject,"(#$conditionTypeRiskFactorForProcedureSubject PROCEDURE CONDITION-TYPE) means that where SUBJECT is the #$subjectOfMedicalProcedure-Unique, there is a condition COND of type CONDITION-TYPE, such that (#$physiologicalConditionAffects COND SUBJECT) and such that the duration of COND intersects the time of PROCEDURE, and such that PROCEDURE is of a type, PROCEDURE-TYPE, such that (#$contraindicatedTreatmentTypeForConditionType PROCEDURE-TYPE CONDITION-TYPE).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edfbe).
