x_comment(x_activityTypeRiskFactorForProcedureSubject,"(#$activityTypeRiskFactorForProcedureSubject PROCEDURE ACTIVITY-TYPE) means that, where SUBJECT is the #$subjectOfMedicalProcedure-Unique of PROCEDURE, SUBJECT regularly performs instances of ACTIVITY-TYPE in a time frame which overlaps the time of PROCEDURE, and that PROCEDURE is of a type, PROCEDURE-TYPE, such that (#$contraindicatedTreatmentTypeForActivityType PROCEDURE-TYPE ACTIVITY-TYPE).") :- x_cid(a65b16505edfbf).
