x_comment(x_closestEventOfTypePriorToContainsInstanceOfWithValueFor,"<code>(#$closestEventOfTypePriorToContainsInstanceOfWithValueFor EVT1 EVT2 TYPE CONTAINED-TYPE\nPROPERTY)</code> means that <code>EVT1</code> is the nearest event of <code>TYPE</code> prior to <code>EVT2</code> that contains some instance of <code>CONTAINED-TYPE</code> that has some value for <code>PROPERTY</code>. This entails that\n<pre>\n <code> \n  (#$thereExists ?VALUE\n   (#$thereExists ?CONT1\n    (#$and\n      (PROPERTY ?CONT1 ?VALUE)\n      (#$cCF-contains EVT1 CONT1)\n      (#$isa ?CONT1 CONTAINED-TYPE))))\n</pre>\nIn medical contexts it is assumed that both events involve the same patient.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edfc2).
