x_comment(x_hasHistoryOfConditionOfType,"(#$hasHistoryOfConditionOfType ORG COND-TYPE) means that there is an instance of COND-TYPE, COND, such that (#$physiologicalConditionAffects COND ORG) and such that that the #$startingPoint of COND is, at the latest, temporally coterminous with the starting point of the temporal context of (#$hasHistoryOfConditionOfType ORG COND-TYPE).  Conversely, if it is true that (#$physiologicalConditionAffects COND AGENT), true that (isa COND COND-TYPE), and true that (isa COND-TYPE #$PhysiologicalConditionType, then (#$hasHistoryOfConditionOfType AGENT COND-TYPE) is true in any temporal context whose #$startingPoint is the same as or later than the starting point of COND.") :- x_cid(a65b16505edfd0).
