x_comment(x_defaultWellformednessCheckingMt,"<code>(#$defaultWellformednessCheckingMt SPECIFICATION MT)</code> means that in the CAE specification <code>SPECIFICATION</code>, MT is the appropriate #$Microtheory to use when performing well-formedness checking on queries.  It will commonly be the case that this #$Microtheory will have tighter constraints than are otherwise found in the general Cyc KB, as it is focused more strongly on weeding out ridiculous sentences than on admitting all sentences that might possibly be correct.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee020).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee020,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
