x_comment(x_defaultNLDomainMt,"<code>(#$defaultNLDomainMt SPECIFICATION MT)</code> means that in the CAE specification <code>SPECIFICATION</code>, MT is the appropriate #$Microtheory to use when trying to determine domain facts while performing natural language generation or parsing.  Typically, this Mt will be either the same as or a spec-mt of the #$defaultQueryMt, as the domain assumptions seen by the NL system should be roughly the same as those used by the application for question answering. This Mt is not used for finding lexical assertions.  Those are gated by #$defaultParaphraseMt or #$defaultParsingMt.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee02a).
