x_comment('x_closestEventOfTypePriorToWithValueFor-CYC',"<code>(#$closestEventOfTypePriorToWithValueFor EVT1 EVT2 TYPE PROPERTY)</code> means that <code>EVT1</code> is the nearest event of <code>TYPE</code> prior to <code>EVT2</code> that has some value for <code>PROPERTY</code>.  This entails that \n  <pre>\n   <code> (#$thereExists ?VALUE\n       (PROPERTY EVT1 ?VALUE))</code>\n </pre>\n\nIn medical contexts it is assumed that both events involve the same patient.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee095).
