xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ee09e,[]).
x_comment(x_Dropping,"The collection of physical events in which an object is released from support, falls, and collides with whatever's in the way (such as the ground, a floor, or other support surface).  For more specialized types of events in which some <i>agent</i> must release the object, see\n#$DroppingAnObject and #$DroppingAnObject-Purposeful.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee09f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee09f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
