x_comment(x_ReflexiveAction,"A specialization of #$ActionOnObject (q.v.).  Typically, each instance of #$ReflexiveAction is an action wherein the doer of the action (i.e. the filler of the #$doneBy role) is the same as the object acted on (i.e. the filler of the #$objectActedOn role).  Representative specializations are #$Suicide and #$ScratchingOneself.  Contrast this collection with #$IrreflexiveAction.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0a1).
