x_comment(x_NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournament,"The #$Collection of all NCAA Men's Division 1 Regional Basketball Tournaments, or more colloquially, 'regionals'.  Every such tournament is a subevent (#$properSubEvents) within a larger #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament, a.k.a. 'March Madness' tournament, and every #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament includes exactly four instances of #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournament, running more or less concurrently.  The four #$playoffWinners of these four tournaments are considered the 'final four' teams of the particular subsuming #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament (see #$finalFourTeamOfMarchMadnessTournament) and advance to the #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballNationalSemiFinalGames.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0e8).
