x_comment(x_NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalFinalsGame,"The #$Collection of all regional finals games in that occur in #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament.  Each such game functions as the respective #$PlayoffChampionship of the #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournament that it concludes:  hence there are four such games in any given 'March Madness' tournament.  The eight teams which advance to compete in the #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalFinalsGames of a given #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament are known as the 'elite eight' (#$eliteEightTeamOfMarchMadnessTournament), and the winners of these games are known as the 'final four' of the tournament (#$finalFourTeamOfMarchMadnessTournament).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0ed).
