x_comment(x_winnerInOutcome,"(#$winnerInOutcome OUTCOME WINNER) means that, where (#$outcomeOfConflict CONFLICT OUTCOME), WINNER, during the period of OUTCOME has the social or cultural status associated with being one of the 'victors' in CONFLICT.  What this status is varies with respect to the type of conflict of which OUTCOME is the #$outcomeOfConflict.  E.g., in the case of a #$War, it often entails having certain rights of control over the loser, while in the case of a #$SportsEvent, it usually means having the accolades of the masses, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0f3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee0f3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
