x_comment(x_loserInOutcome,"(#$loserInOutcome OUTCOME LOSER) means that, where (#$outcomeOfConflict CONFLICT OUTCOME), LOSER, during the period of OUTCOME has the social or cultural status associated with being one of the 'losers' or defeated agents in CONFLICT.  What this status is varies with respect to the type of conflict of which OUTCOME is the #$outcomeOfConflict.  E.g., in the case of a #$War, it oten entails being the subject of enforceable claims on the part of the winner , while in the case of a #$SportsEvent, it usually means having the opprobrium of ones fans, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0f4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee0f4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
