x_comment(x_NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalSemiFinalGame,"The #$Collection of all regional semi-finals games which occur in #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournaments.  Every such game occurs as part of one of the four #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournaments included in the overall #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament, and each #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournament includes two #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalSemiFinalGames.  The sixteen teams which advance to compete in the #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalSemiFinalGames of a given tournament are known as the 'sweet sixteen' (#$sweetSixteenTeamOfMarchMadnessTournament), and the eight teams which win their respective semi-finals are known as the elite eight (#$eliteEightTeamOfMarchMadnessTournament).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0f7).
