x_comment('x_Restaurant-Organization',"#$Restaurant-Organization is a specialization of #$ServiceEstablishment, #$FoodServiceOrganization, and #$OrganizationWithIndividualCustomers.  Each instance of #$Restaurant-Organization is an organization that operates individual restaurants.  For example, the group of individuals that operates the Threadgills on Lamar in Austin (and no other restaurants) is an instance of #$Restaurant-Organization, while the #$Organization that owns and operates both Threadgills (the one on Lamar and the one on Barton Springs) is not an instance of this collection (that organization would be an instance of #$FoodServiceOrganization).  Instances of #$Restaurant-Organization operate out of #$RestaurantSpaces.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee0f9).
