x_comment(x_eliminatedFromPlayoff,"Where PLAYOFF is a #$Playoff such that it includes a #$TeamSportsCompetition-Entire-SameCompetitors, MATCH such that (#$eliminationMatchFor PLAYOFF TEAM), it follows that (#$eliminatedFromPlayoff PLAYOFF TEAM).  Also, where TEAM is a #$SportsTeam and (#$eliminatedFromPlayoff PLAYOFF TEAM), it follows that everyone who is a member of TEAM at the time of PLAYOFF is also #$eliminatedFromPlayoff with respect to PLAYOFF.  (#$eliminatedFromPlayoff PLAYOFF AGENT) entails that (#$loserOfGameInMultiGameCompetition PLAYOFF AGENT), and, more specifically, where AGENT is a #$SportsTeam, that there is a #$sportsEventInPlayoff, GAME, such that (#$eliminationMatchFor GAME AGENT).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee100).
