x_comment(x_NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalRound2Game,"The collection of all 'second round' games in #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournaments.  A NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament begins with four separate 'regionals' or regional tournaments, the #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalTournaments.  Each of these tournaments is seeded with sixteen starting teams (see #$teamSeeds) and starts with eight separate opening round games (#$NCCAMensDivision1BasketbalRegionalRound1Games) in which these teams are matched against each other.The tournament is not re-seeded after the first round, and a second round of four games (the #$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballRegionalRound2Games) follows in which the winners of the playoff-predecessors of these games are matched against each other (see #$playoffSuccessors-Direct).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee110).
