x_comment(x_usingExpandedGraphTrigger,"Setting this to True and turning forward the genlRules rule on ExpandedGraphRDF-TypeCCFOWLClass will propagate the meta assertions on the rules for the specs of those expanded graph terms which will instruct the inference engine to only use the general rule and not the spec rule when generating results for the genl term.  If the system is querying unexpanded graphs as well, then the rule should be turned backwards and a null edit performed to remove the dependents.  Currently there is no after adding or similar piece of code associated with this to perform this clean-up and it has to be done by manually turning the rule forward or backward.  So, for now, this simply serves a documentation purpose.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee111).
