x_comment('x_intervalBetweenStages-EndToStart-Min',"An assertion of the form <code>(#$intervalBetweenStages-EndToStart-Min INT-SPEC QUANT)</code> is used to represent the duration of an interval which will exist between the subsituations of instances of a given type of #$Situation.  Given the assertions <code>(#$sitTypeHasInterStageSpec SIT-TYPE INT-SPEC)</code> <code>(#$earlierStage INT-SPEC TEMP1)</code> and <code>(#$laterStage INT-SPEC TEMP2)</code> hold, in any instance of the sub-collection of #$Situation, <code>SIT-TYPE</code> any subsituation which falls under the #$TemporalStageSpecification <code>TEMP2</code> will begin only after a #$TimeInterval of duration <code>QUANT</code> has passed since the ending of any subsituation which falls under the #$TemporalStageSpecification <code>TEMP1</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee19a).
