x_comment(x_closestEventOfTypePriorToWithinIntervalWithValueForOf,"<code>(#$closestEventOfTypePriorToWithValueForOf EVT1 EVT2 TYPE INTERVAL PROPERTY VALUE)</code> means that  <code>EVT1</code> is the nearest event of <code>TYPE</code> prior to <code>EVT2</code> within <code>INTERVAL</code> that has <code>VALUE</code> for property.  This entails that \n  <pre>\n   <code> \n       (PROPERTY EVT1 VALUE)</code>\n </pre>\n\nIn medical contexts it is assumed that both events involve the same patient.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee1b6).
