x_comment(x_defaultAutotypeSuggestionFromType,"An instance of #$KEFacilitationPredicate used to derive default typing information for new things introduced into Cyc's domain of discourse via automatic or semi-automatic knowledge acquisition methods.  <code>(#$defaultAutotypeSuggestionFromType COL #$isa)</code> means that, given some instance INS of #$Thing for which we can determine is either an instance or specialization of the collection <code>COL</code>, then, given the absence of any other evidence, we should conclude that <code>(#$isa INS COL)</code>.  <code>(#$defaultAutotypeSuggestionFromType COL #$genls)</code> means that, given some instance INS of #$Thing for which we can determine is either an instance or specialization of the collection <code>COL</code>, then, given the absence of any other evidence, we should conclude that INS is a #$Collection and that <code>(#$genls INS COL)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee24f).
