x_comment(x_PlayoffSeries,"An important specialization of #$MultiSportsEventSportsCompetition.  Each instance of #$PlayoffSeries is a #$MultiSportsEventSportsCompetition in which a partial order is defined on the subsidiary competitions via the #$playoffSuccessors-Direct relation which maps two or more #$SportsEvents to single #$SportsEvents in a tree structure that converges to a final 'root' node, the #$PlayoffChampionship.  Where it is true the (#$playoffSuccessors-Direct PRIOR-GAME SUCCESSOR-GAME) and WINNER is a #$competingAgents-TopLevel in PRIOR-GAME and a #$winnerInConflict in PRIOR-GAME, it follows that (#$competingAgents-TopLevel SUCCESSOR-GAME WINNER):  moreover, no #$competingAgents-TopLevel who is a loser (#$defeatedInConflict) in PRIOR-GAME can be a #$competingAgents in SUCCESSOR-GAME.  Thus, the winners of games in the #$playoffSuccessors-Direct tree structure inherit as competitors to their games' immediate successor, and so on down the tree until the #$PlayoffChampionship determines a #$playoffWinners.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee26b).
