x_comment(x_ExternalResourceSupportVocabularyTerm,"The collection of instances of #$CycLTerm that have been added to the CycL vocabulary solely to support the mappings of specific external knowledge sources into Cyc, either by virtue of having shared semantics with a term from that source (see, e.g., #$synonymousExternalConcept) or by contributing the axiomatization of the mapped vocabulary.  CycL terms should be tagged as instances of this collection only if their addition to the KB is not justified beyond the specific mapping task in question.  For example, the term #$NFLGame was introduced to facilitate a specific mapping task for #$MachineReadingProject; however NFL games are of general interest, and we would anticipate reuse of this term and not include it in this class of terms.  However, #$TouchdownNotSucceededByASuccessfulConversionAttempt is an instance of this class of terms: it was only introduced to be a target for a term of the source ontology, as it is a 'mix-in' whose semantics we would have otherwise represented as a rule.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee2e9).
