x_comment('x_InterferonBeta-1b',"#$InterferonBeta-1b is a drug in the interferon family used to treat the relapsing-remitting and secondary-progressive forms of multiple sclerosis.  It is approved for use after the first MS event.  It is administered by sub-cutaneous injectin and has been shown to slow the advance of the afflication as well as reduce the frequency of the attacks.  Studies have determined that interferon-beta improves the integrity of the blood-brain barrier (which generally breaks down in MS patients). (LinkedLife DB http://www.linkedlifedata.com).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee2f6).
