x_comment(x_ExistenceCotemporalCollection,"A specialization of #$InitialCollection (q.v.). This is the collection of all first-order collections whose instances belong to them throughout the entire time during which they are also instances of #$SomethingExisting, and only then.  That is, each instance ECC of #$ExistenceCotemporalCollection is such that (i) a thing can be an instance of ECC only while the thing is also an instance of #$SomethingExisting and (ii) if a given thing is ever an instance of ECC, there is no time during the time during which the thing is also an instance of #$SomethingExisting at which it is not an instance of ECC.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee31a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee31a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505ee31a,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
