x_comment(x_InitialCollection,"A specialization of #$TimeDependentCollection (q.v.).  Each instance EDIC of #$InitialCollection is a collection such that (i) a thing can be an instance of EDIC only while the thing is also an instance of #$SomethingExisting, (ii) any instance of EDIC starts as an instance of it, and (iii) if an instance of EDIC changes to no longer being an instance it can never become an instance again.  For example, #$Virgin is such a collection.  Cf. #$NonInitialCollection and #$TerminalNonInitialCollection.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee31c).
