x_comment(x_isACountOfQuantity,"<code>(#$isACountOfQuantity COUNT-QTY N)</code> identifies <code>N</code> as the instance of #$IntervalOnNumberLine for which the instance <code>COUNT-QTY</code> of #$CountQuantity is a count of.  For example, <code>((#$UnitOfCountFn #$Doughnut) 212)</code> is count of 212; hence <code>(#$isACountOfQuantity ((#$UnitOfCountFn #$Doughnut) 212) 212)</code> holds. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee370).
