xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505ee393,[]).
x_comment(x_onlyOccasionOnWhich,"<code>(#$onlyOccasionOnWhich SIT SIT-TYPE SET-OF-ROLE-ACTOR-PAIRS)</code> means that the situation <code>SIT</code> is the only instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> such that the actors play the roles specified in <code>SET-OF-ROLE-ACTOR-PAIRS</code>. For example, <code>(#$onlyOccasionOnWhich (#$BirthFn #$AbrahamLincoln) #$BirthEvent (#$TheSet (#$TheList #$birthChild #$AbrahamLincoln))</code> means that the birth of Abraham Lincoln is the only (i.e., first and last) #$BirthEvent situation in which Lincoln plays the #$birthChild role. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee394).
