x_comment(x_multipleChoiceOptionIndexLabel,"A predicate used to represent informal features common to the presentation of multiple choice questions.  Specifically, in human-targeted representatons of questons, options are typically given an index (often a numeral or a letter) used as a shorthand way to refer to that option within the context of that question.  <code>(#$multipleChoiceOptionIndexLabel OPTION INDEX)</code> identifies the string <code>INDEX</code> as the string used to assign an index to <code>OPTION</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee406).
