x_comment(x_Mitosis,"A specialization of #$BiologicalProcess-CellularLevel. Each instance of #$Mitosis is an event in which the nucleus of a #$EukaryoticCell divides to result in a separation of the raw materials suitable for constructing two new nuclei, each with the same chromosome number and genomic content as the parent cell. This is the type of nuclear division that occurs in the somatic cells of multicellular eukaryotic organisms. Each #$Mitosis event is a sub-event of a #$MitoticPhaseOfCellCycle during which an instance of #$Cytokinesis happens after the mitosis.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee454).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee454,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
