x_comment(x_rolePlayerTypeDeterminedBySubSitType,"<code>(#$rolePlayerTypeDeterminedBySubSitType SUPER-TYPE ROLE TYPE SUB-TYPE)</code> means that whether any instances of <code>TYPE</code> play the role <code>ROLE</code> in an instance <code>I</code>of <code>SUPER-TYPE</code> is dependent on the existence of an instance of <code>SUB-TYPE</code> as a #$subSituations of <code>I</code>.  Specifically, the exact number of instances/amount of <code>TYPE</code> such that <code>ROLE</code> relates those instances/that amount to <code>I</code> must be exactly the same number/amount that are so related to the relevant instance of <code>SUB-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee455).
