x_comment(x_EntityOfTypeBetweenStagesFn,"A collection denoting function used for denoting classes of role players that are temporally 'at' certain stages in situations that are instances of 'scripted' #$TemporalObjectTypes.  Specifically, where OBJ-TYPE is a kind of #$SomethingExisting, SIT-TYPE is a class of #$Situation in whose instances instances of OBJ-TYPE are known to play a 'constituent' role (see #$someTypePlaysRoleInSituationType), SUBSIT-TYPE1 is a known 'stage' of instances of SIT-TYPE (see #$properSubSituationTypes), SUBSIT-TYPE2 is a known 'stage' of instances of SIT-TYPE succeeding instances of SUBSIT-TYPE1 (see #$properSubSituationTypes and #$startsAfterEndOfInSituationType), (#$EntityOfTypeBetweenStagesFn OBJ-TYPE SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE1 SUBSIT-TYPE2) deonoes the collection of all instances of OBJ-TYPE such that they are #$actors in an instance of SIT-TYPE, and such that they are at the instant of having completed an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE1 in the SIT-TYPE instance, and have yet to undergo a succeeding instance of SUBSIT-TYPE2.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee45a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee45a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
