x_comment('x_EntityOfTypeBetweenStages-ScriptImplicitFn',"A collection denoting function used for denoting classes of role players that are temporally 'at' certain stages in situations that are instances of 'scripted' #$TemporalObjectTypes.  Specifically, where OBJ-TYPE is a kind of #$SomethingExisting, and SUBSIT-TYPE1 and SUBSIT-TYPE2 are known successive 'stages' of a instances some 'scripted' situation type in whose instances instances of OBJ-TYPE are known to play a role, (#$EntityOfTypeBetweenStagesFn OBJ-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE1 SUBSIT-TYPE2) deonotes the collection of all instances of OBJ-TYPE at the instant of having completed an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE1 in the SIT-TYPE instance, and have yet to undergo a succeeding instance of SUBSIT-TYPE2.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee45d).
