x_comment(x_existsAgentOfTypeInRoleFromSubSituationOfType,"A rule-macro predicate for encapsulating a certain existential claim about #$Situation instances, their #$properSubSituations, and role players in those #$properSubSituations.  Specifically, where SIT is a #$Situation, AGT-TYPE is a specialization of #$SomethingExisting, SUBSIT-TYPE is a specialization of #$Situation, and ROLE is a #$BinarySituationPredicate, (#$existsAgentOfTypeInRoleFromSubSituationOfType SIT AGT-TYPE ROLE SUBSIT-TYPE) holds if and only if there exists an instance AGT of AGT-TYPE and an instance SUBSIT of SUBSIT-TYPE, such that (ROLE SUBSIT AGT) and (#$properSubSituations SIT SUBSIT).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee46f).
