x_comment(x_stageMultiplicationFactor,"(#$stageMultiplicationFactor SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-INDEP-TYPE SUBSIT-DEP-TYPE BASE EXP) means that, where SIT is an instance of SIT-TYPE and N is equal to the number BASE rased to the EXPth power, each instance of SUBSIT-INDEP-TYPE that is a #$properSubSituations of SIT will cause on the order of N instances of SUBSIT-DEP-TYPE as #$properSubSituations of SIT, thereby insuring that SIT situationally subsumes at least N instances of SUBSIT-DEP-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4a6).
