x_comment(x_pathStageFacilitatesCellularResponseType,"A predicate for relating a characteristic stage in a transduction pathway type (#$TransductionPathwayMultiStageReactionType) to a cellular response type mediated by the #$TransductionPathwayMultiStageReactionType.  Where TRANSDUCTION-TYPE is a kind of #$TransductionPathway-MultiStageReaction, PATH-STAGE is a kind of #$Situation, and RESPONSE-TYPE is a #$CellularProcessType, (#$pathStageFacilitatesCellularResponseType TRANSDUCTION-TYPE PATH-STAGE RESPONSE-TYPE) means that, where TRANSDUCTION is an instance of TRANSDUCTION-TYPE with an instance of PATH-STAGE as a #$properSubSituations, there will normally exist a 'mass' event composed of PATH-STAGE instances (a (MassEventOfTypeFn PATH-STAGE)) that temporally subsumes the aforementioned PATH-STAGE instance, and that in turn is a subsituation of an instance of RESPONSE-TYPE that figures among the causes of that instance of RESPONSE-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4b2).
