x_comment(x_specificValueOfTypeForArgUnknown,"A predicate used to represent a certain kind of incompleteness of knowledge, <code>(#$specificValueOfTypeForArgUnknown SENTENCE TYPE N)</code> means that the true sentence <code>SENTENCE</code> contains a skolemized or otherwise indeterminate instance of <code>TYPE</code> in its <code>N</code>th place, and that no specific, determinate instance of <code>TYPE</code> is known to be identical to that indeterminate instance.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4b4).
