x_comment(x_objectTypeReleasedIntoIntercellularMediumDuring,"The corresponding predicate (#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical) of #$IntercellularMediumReleaseOfChemicalObjectTypeFn.  WhereWhere OBJ-TYPE is a class of #$ChemicalObject and MEDIUM-TYPE is a class of #$InternalAnatomicalPart, (#$objectTypeReleasedIntoIntercellularMediumDuring OBJ-TYPE MEDIUM-TYPE RELEASE-TYPE) means that RELEASE-TYPEis the collection of all events wherein an instance of (#$ChemicalSubstanceFn OBJ-TYPE) is dispersed into an instance of MEDIUM-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4ba).
