x_comment(x_maximalProperSubSituationTypes,"A #$RuleMacroPredicate expressing an important relationship between types of #$Situation.  Specifically, where SIT-TYPE and SUBSIT-TYPE are both specializations of #$Situation, (#$maximalProperSubSituationTypes SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE) means that for any two different instances of SUBSIT-TYPE, SUBSIT-1 and SUBSIT-2 that are both #$properSubSituations of an instance of SIT-TYPE, neither (#$properSubSituations SUBSIT-1 SUBSIT-2) nor (#$properSubSituations SUBSIT-2 SUBSIT-1) is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4bb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee4bb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
