x_comment(x_EnzymaticInhibition,"A subcollection of #$ChemicalBonding, each instance of which involves the binding of an #$EnzymeMolecule, where the bonding has the effect of \"tying up\" that enzyme so as to prevent it from forming the sorts of bonds that allow it to fulfill its \"normal\" biological function.  Thus of all the various bonds a given enzyme might form, this collection represents those bond-formings that are typically of medical interest: instances of this collection are commonly abnormal for the organism, and many are artificially induced by the introduction of some #$DrugSubstance in that organism's body.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4c0).
