x_comment(x_SumOfSubsitsOfTypeInFn,"A #$IndividualDenotingFunction.  Where SIT is a #$Situation with one or more instances of SUBSIT-TYPE as #$properSubSituations, (#$SumOfSubsitsOfTypeInFn SIT SUBSIT-TYPE) denotes the #$Situation SUM such that i) every instances SUBSIT-TYPE that is a #$properSubSituations of SIT is a #$subSituations of SUM and ii) no #$Situation that is not an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE is a #$properSubSituations of SUM unless it is temporally subsumed by some instance of SUBSIT-TYPE that is a #$subSituations of SUM.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4f5).
