x_comment('x_only-TC',"An instance of #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot that relates an instance of #$CapabilityPredicate-TypeLevel to a more restrictive version of that predicate.  In particular, each instance <code>CPTL</code> of #$CapabilityPredicate-TypeLevel has the following semantics: <code>(CPTL TYPE SIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> holds iff every instance of <code>TYPE</code> has the relevant capability (curried into <code>CPTL</code>) of playing the role <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>; however <code>(#$only-TC CPTL RCPTL)</code> identifies <code>RCPTL</code> as the ternary predicate that restricts this capability to <i>only</i> instances of <code>TYPE</code>.  Thus <code>(RCPTL TYPE SIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> holds just in case <code>(CPTL TYPE SIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> and for no collections <code>COL</code>, <code>(CPTL COL SIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> holds unless <code>COL</code> is a specialization of <code>TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee4ff).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee4ff,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505ee4ff,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
