x_comment(x_objectSchemaColumnPredicate,"A #$BinaryPredicate relating a #$DatabaseColumn to a #$BinaryPredicate. (#$objectSchemaColumnPredicate <code>COLUMN</code> <code>PRED</code>) means that in an #$objectSchemaTranslation, for each row <code>ROW</code> in the table to which <code>COLUMN</code> belongs, the referent, X, of the primary key value in <code>ROW</code>, and the referent Y, of the intersection of <code>ROW</code> and <code>COLUMN</code>, are such that (<code>PRED</code> <code>X</code> and <code>Y</code>).  See #$objectSchemaTranslation for a more precise explanation of the translation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee535).
