x_comment(x_outlierStageWithRespectToChangeInSlotValue,"<code>(#$outlierStageWithRespectToChangeInSlotValue EVT-TYPE SUB-EVT-TYPE SLOT)</code> identifies <code>SUB-EVT-TYPE</code> as the stage in <code>EVT-TYPE</code> during which changes to the arg2 value of the instance of #$QuantitySlot <code>SLOT</code> takes place.  There is a presupposed level of granularity in the notion of \"stage\" here: <code>SUB-EVT-TYPE</code> counts as stage in the relevant sense if and only if there is a recognized level of decomposition of <code>EVT-TYPE</code> (representable via #$coveringOfEventType) according to which <code>SUB-EVT-TYPE</code> is one of among several sub-event-types that jointly comprise <code>EVT-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee56c).
