x_comment(x_QueryModificationStrategy,"A collection of strategies for modifying a query in order to generate relevant results.  Some strategies may apply before the query is run, while others may only be relevant to iterative runs of successively modified queries.  In general, When a \"strategy\" is active in a given query session, the applicability condition is checked and if the condition holds, the strategy is applied and the query is run or rerun.  Each instance of this collection is typically associated with at least one query to which it applies, an applicability condition -- the condition that gates whether to apply the strategy, and some number of additional features like ordering conditions, definitions of how the strategy is applied, etc. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee5a0).
