x_comment(x_PhotoresistExposure,"The collection of all semiconductor wafer processing events (#$SemiconductorProcessing-Wafer) wherein an image generated by means of a #$MaskingReticle is projected onto a layer of #$Photoresist-Substance that has been deposited onto a wafer substrate, and the chemical properties of the exposed resist are thereby altered to either heighten their solubility (positive resist) or reduce it (negative resist). Each instance of #$PhotoresistExposure thus consists in the reticle projection (#$MaskingReticleProjection) followed by the solubility alteration #$PhotoresistSolubilityAlteration-PhotochemicalReaction.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee5af).
