x_comment('x_PhotolithographyProcess-SingleIteration',"The collection of all manufacturing events wherein a single member of an #$MEProcessingWaferLot (an instance of #$SemiconductorWafer is subjected to a process wherein an instance of #$Photoresist-Substance is deposited in a layer over the wafer substrate and an image is burned into the photoresist via a process of stepped projection:  depending on whether the resist is 'positive' or 'negative', exposed or unexposed portions of the resist are then washed away by means of a solvent to which they have been sensitized by the radiation exposure.  Every instance of #$PhotolithographyProcess-SingleIteration thus consists of at least three sub-stages:  deposition (#$PhotoresistDeposition), stepped exposure (#$PhotoresistExposure-Stepped) and development with solvent (#$PhotoresistDevelopment).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee5d0).
