x_comment(x_LotProcessingOfInWithFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction used to represent and reason about various important types of #$LotProcessingStep-Serial.  Where ARTIFACT-TYPE is a specialization of #$Artifact-Generic and ITERATION-TYPE is a specialization of #$ManufacturingASingleObject such that instances of ARTIFACT-TYPE are typically processed in instances of ITERATION-TYPE and such that instances of ARTIFACT-TYPE are typically composed into 'lots' for processing in INDUSTRY-TYPE (see #$standardProcessingLotTypeForIndustry), (#$LotProcessingOfInWithFn ARTIFACT-TYPE INDUSTRY-TYPE ITERATION-TYPE) denotes the collection of all events wherein an industrial 'lot' composed of instances of ARTIFACT-TYPE is processed in association with INDUSTRY-TYPE in the strict sense that an instance of ITERATION-TYPE is applied successively to each instance of ARTIFACT-TYPE in the lot.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee6bd).
