x_comment(x_sustainsPeakDuringSubSituationType,"(#$sustainsPeakDuringSubSituationType\nCOMP-QUANT-PRED ROLE THING SUB-SIT-TYPE SIT-TYPE) means that for the ROLE-PLAYER that plays the role ROLE during any instance of SUB-SIT-TYPE that is a sub-situation of SIT  (an instance of SIT-TYPE), (COMP-QUANT-PRED ROLE-PLAYER THING QUANT) is such that QUANT first reaches its highest values relative to all other unsubsumed sub-situations of SIT prior to SUB-SIT, and has maintained those peak levels through SUB-SIT.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee80a).
