x_comment(x_AccountSystem,"#$AccountSystem is a specialization of #$ComputationalSystem.  Each instance of #$AccountSystem is a computational system which is such that users must log on to it to make use of it.  Instances  of #$AccountSystem can consist of one or many nodes (i.e. computers).  Each node in an #$AccountSystem shares a given set of accounts with any other nodes in that #$AccountSystem (such that someone with an account can log in at any node).  See also #$nodeInAccountSystem, #$accountForSystem, and #$ComputerAccount.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee856).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee856,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
