x_comment(x_NewThingFn,"An instance of #$EvaluatableFunction with an #$arity of 0 \nthat can be used to add new constants to the CycL language on the fly.  \nEvaluating <code>(#$NewThingFn)</code> will result in the creation of \na new #$CycLConstant with a global unique identifier (GUID -- see \n#$GUIDString) that can be used to denote an object in the universe by \nstipluating a reference and adding CycL assertions to it.  \n#$NewThingFn is very similar in this way to instances of #$SkolemFuncN \nintroduce terms that can be used to describe objects, but without the \nindeterminacy of denotation feature of skolem functions.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee864).
