x_comment(x_Baud,"A function and an instance of #$UnitOfBandwidth, used to represent a standard unit of computer data transmission speed -- one symbol or pulse per second, encoding one or more bits per second. Like all instances of #$UnitOfMeasure, its #$arity is variable between one and two, and its arguments must be instances of #$SubLRealNumber. If a single instance of #$SubLRealNumber is put in the argument position to this function, it returns a quantity of symbols per second (which is an instance of #$Bandwidth). If two #$SubLRealNumbers are put in the argument position, it returns an interval (which is also an instance of #$Bandwidth).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee8e7).
