x_comment(x_Nucleotide,"The collection of all nucleotides.  Instances of this\ncollection are chemical compounds consisting of a phosphate group, a\nsimple 5-carbon sugar, and a #$NitrogenBase.  This collection divides\ninto two groups: #$Ribonucleotide, whose instances use #$Ribose as the\nsimple 5-carbon sugar, and #$Deoxyribonucleotide, whose instances use\n#$Deoxyribose as the simple 5-carbon sugar. When joined in a chain to form a polymer, #$Nucleotides make up the nucleic acids (see #$PolynucleotideMolecule) RNA and DNA (see #$RNAMolecule, #$DNAMolecule).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee936).
