x_comment('x_mainFunctionalComponent-TypeType',"A #$BinaryPredicate that relates a specialization of #$PartiallyTangible to another specialization of #$PartiallyTangible.  <code>(#$mainFunctionalComponent-TypeType TYPE1 TYPE2)</code> means that every instance of <code>TYPE1</code> has an instance of <code>TYPE2</code> as its #$mainFunctionalComponent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee94f).
