x_comment(x_nthProgramActionTypeSpecifiedWithNoValueForParameter,"(#$nthProgramActionTypeSpecifiedWithNoValueForParameter CODE ACTION-TYPE N SIT-PRED) means that the structure of CODE is such that, other things being equal, an ordinary execution of CODE will feature no agent in the situation role of SIT-PRED in the Nth instance of ACTION-TYPE occuring in the execution. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee96f).
