x_comment(x_nthProgramActionTypeSpecifiedWithParameterValueOtherThan,"(#$nthProgramActionTypeSpecifiedWithParameterValueOtherThan CODE ACTION-TYPE N SIT-PRED THING) means that the structure of CODE is such that, other things being equal, anything that plays the situational role SIT-PRED in the Nth occurrence of type ACTION-TYPE in a normal execution of CODE will be #$different from THING.  I.e., the structure of CODE is such that THING can*not* ordinarily play the role SIT-PRED in the Nth occurrence of SIT-TYPE that occurs as part of any normal execution of CODE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee970).
