x_comment('x_Selection-Generic',"Instances of #$Selection-Generic are events in which one or more items from among a group of candidates is chosen for, or happens to become subject to, different treatment than the others.  Note that instances may involve, but do not necessarily involve purposeful action on the part of an agent.  #$Selection-Generic occurs when lighting strikes a forest, and two trees out of hundreds are hit. #$Selection-Generic also occurs when one person of three is elected mayor.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee973).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ee973,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
