x_comment(x_equatorOfSpheroid,"A specialization of the binary predicate #$parallelOfSpheroid (q.v.) that relates any #$Spheroid that is not a perfect #$Sphere to its unique equator.  <code>(#$equatorOfSpheroid EQUATOR SPHEROID)</code> means that <code>EQUATOR</code> is an #$AtLeastApproximatelyACircle that is a section of <code>SPHEROID</code> centered at the same point as it, and perpendicular to <code>SPHEROID</code>'s #$axisOfSurfaceOfRevolution. \n<p>\nSee also #$greatCircleOfSphere.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee98b).
