x_comment('x_Metaphase-Generic',"#$Metaphase-Generic is the generalization of the metaphase steps of mitosis (see #$MitoticPhaseOfCellCycle), meiosis I, and meiosis II (see #$FirstMeioticCellDivision and #$SecondMeioticCellDivision). Each instance of #$Metaphase-Generic is a sub-event of a cell division event (either mitotic or meiotic) during which the chromosomes line up on the metaphase plate (see #$metaphasePlateOfCell).  In the case of #$MetaphaseI in the first meiotic division, chromosomes line up as tetrads (see #$Tetrad-Chromosomal).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ee9ed).
