x_comment(x_FinancialServicesAgreement,"A subcollection of #$LegalAgreement.  Each instance of #$FinancialServicesAgreement is an agreement between two or more agents whereby some sort of financial service is provided to some of the parties by one or more of the other parties.  For example, one may contract with a brokerage firm to purchase X shares of stock in company Y under certain conditions.  Another example would be subscribing to a news service that provides various stock tickers, financial news feeds and dashboards, etc.  The latter type of service would typically be a subcollection of #$FinancialServicesAgreement-Ongoing.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eea06).
