x_comment(x_ActivationOfProductOrService,"A specialization of #$MakingAnAgreement.  Each instance of this collection is the action taken to activate a particular service or program with respect to a particular device or artifact -- e.g. a cell phone, an internet device, a program copy.  Typically some major or main function of the device or program is inactive or has limited functionality before the activation.  Full functionality is only achieved after activation and is typically associated with an ongoing agreement that covers the length of the period during which the product's functionaity is available and the responsibilities of the agreeing parties.  \"Activations\" of services not associated with a particular artifact are not covered under this concept and are typically represented as either service events of some sort or agreements -- e.g. a periodical subscription is an agreement for the publisher to provide you with copies of or (in the case of online subscriptions) allow access to the periodical on an ongoing basis.  The \"activation\" in those cases would be the agreement between the publisher and the customer and would not be an instance of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eea0e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eea0e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505eea0e,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
