x_comment(x_ActivationOfProductFn,"A unary function that takes a product type requiring activation such as a specific type of program copy or particular type of device like a cell phone and returns the subcollection of #$ActivationOfProductOrService that consists in just those instances of #$ActivationOfProductOrService that are activations of the product type in arg1.  E.g. (#$ActivationOfProductFn #$BlackBerry-Smartphone) is the collection of actions which are the activations of particular BlackBerrys.  See the corresponding predicate #$activationOfProductType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eea0f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eea0f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
