x_comment(x_agreementTypeRequiresSystemType,"(#$agreementTypeRequiresSystemType AGREE-TYPE SYSTEM-TYPE) means that some instance of SYSTEM-TYPE is required for the #$agreeingServiceProvider to provide the agreed upon service in an #$AgreementForOngoingService.  Typically, the #$agreeingServiceRecipient  needs to provide and maintain at least some portion of this instance of SYSTEM-TYPE for the #$agreeingServiceRecipient.  For example, to provide telephone service there must exist a particular system of phone wires that the house is connected to that ultimately connect up to the provider's network.  Note that while some ongoing service agreements require some sort of ongoing system, many do not.  A service agreement for someone to mow your lawn every other week requires no particular system in this sense.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eea1d).
