x_comment(x_AligningSomething,"The collection of events in which something is aligned with another thing.  This alignment is relative to the goals/intentions of the agent or system doing the alignment.  Note that the intended alignment required in members of this collection is stricter than that of its generalization #$LocatingInIntendedPosition.  E.g. A placement of a book on a shelf would be an instance of #$LocatingInIntendedPosition if the intended position were simply between this book and that one.  That event would not necessarily be an instance of this collection in that case.  On the other hand, a book placement where the achieved goal was to line up the bindings of the placed book with the bindings of the other book would be an instance of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eea6b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eea6b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
