x_comment('x_FinancialDataCommunicationSystem-Dedicated',"The collection of instances of #$SystemOfDevices designed and configured to provide information and communication regarding financial products.  This includes systems that involve some dedicated equipment or other (dedicated servers, client artifacts, etc.), but doesn't include communication systems that consist only of software products that only provide compilation services of existing data feeds from other sources.  A positive example would be the system involved in the Bloomberg Professional Service where there is dedicated client software and servers and a physical authentication device required for client log-on.  A negative example would be a software system that runs on the user's existing machine and connects to the internet via the user's existing connection and compiles snippets of financial data from third party websites.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eea6d).
