x_comment(x_eventSceneIterations,"(#$eventSceneIterations ITERATED-SCENE ITERATION) states that ITERATION is one of the events of a particular type that is repeated to make up ITERATED-SCENE.  Note that #$eventSceneIterations is a specialization of #$subEvents, not #$properSubEvents, to allow for degenerate forms in which an #$IteratedEventScene has only one iteration, which is the event itself.  An example of this from the biology domain is #$MitoticPhaseOfCellCycle.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeab5).
