x_comment('x_shareParts-TypeType',"A #$FirstOrderCollectionPredicate that is a type-level correlate of #$shareParts (q.v.).   <code>(#$shareParts-TypeType T1 T2)</code> means that for every instance <code>I1</code> of type <code>T1</code> there exists at least one instance <code>I2</code> of type <code>T2</code> such that (#$shareParts <code>I1 I2)</code> holds.  Note that #$shareParts-TypeType is antisymmetric and reflexive, but not transitive.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeaca).
