x_comment(x_expectedMinTemporalOverlapOnArgs,"Where PRED is a #$CoexistingObjectsPredicate, (#$expectedMinTemporalOverlapOnArgs PRED DUR) means that, if (PRED ARG1 ARG2) holds in any context that accesses the context of the #$expectedMinTemporalOverlapOnArgs assertion, the expectation is that the temporal overlap between ARG1 and ARG2, as established by their start and end times, is at least DUR.  For example, asserting (expectedMinTemporalOverlapOnArgs spouse (YearsDuration 18)) means that, in the context of the assertion, if (spouse ARG1 ARG2) holds, there is an expectation that the temporal overlap between ARG1 and ARG2 is at least 18 years.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeacc).
