x_comment(x_programAccessed,"(#$programAccessed ACTIVITY PROGRAM) means that in the computer account accessing activity ACTIVITY, a running program copy of PROGRAM was utilized and was the interaction destination during the course of ACTIVITY.  This is a specialization of #$programUsed and is intended to capture a direct and purposeful use of PROGRAM during the course of some accessing a computer account.  Positive examples include logging on with an SSH client and accessing an Outlook email client.  In that case the Outlook email client would be the #$programAccessed during the SSH connection.  Although the SSH client was a #$programUsed during the SSH connection, it was not a #$programAccessed during this activity because it was not the interaction destination.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeb02).
