x_comment(x_UserStatusSpecification,"A specialization of #$Specification. Each instance of this collection is a declaration or specification of some state of affairs reflecting the status of the program user or the status of the system as specified by the user.  Positive examples include entries for a meeting in a calendar application or declarations of availability in a chat program like \"free\" or \"busy\".  Other positive examples include the specification of specific instructions to the program like sending a reminder email.  A negative example would be a \"working\" message generated by the program in response to a particular program state.  In that case the message is not intended to provide feedback to someone about the user or program state.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeb1c).
