x_comment(x_Nucleolus,"#$Nucleolus is a specialization of #$Organelle.  Each instance of #$Nucleolus is a structure found in a #$CellNucleus which serves to synthesize #$RibosomalRNA and to assemble ribosomes. A #$CellNucleus may have more than one #$Nucleolus.  At the beginning of #$Prophase and #$ProphaseI, the nucleoli disappear; new nucleoli form at the end of cell division in #$Telophase and #$TelophaseII.  In some types of eukaryotes, nucleoli also form in #$TelophaseI and disperse in #$ProphaseII.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeb39).
