x_comment(x_CodingCheckSpecification,"The collection of all declarative code statements (instances of #$ComputerCodeStatement-Declaration) which specify conditions that determine whether or not a particular piece of executable code (a #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable) gets executed or not.  Essential attributes include #$conditionCheckAppliesTo (identifies the executable code that the condition applies to) #$comparisonConditionChecked (identifies the #$NumericComparisonPredicate, if any, used in checking the condition, and #$nthArgForConditionCheckDenotedByExpression (used to identify the #$ComputerCodeExpression that denotes the term appearing in the Nth argument of the statement of the condition to be checked.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeb49).
