x_comment(x_cellMembranePotential,"(#$cellMembranePotential CELL VOLTS) states that the voltage difference across the #$CellMembrane of CELL is the #$Voltage VOLTS.  Membrane potential is determined by subtracting the voltage of the environment outside the cell (which may be the external enviroment if the cell is a single-celled organism, or the #$ExtracellularFluid if the cell is part of a larger organism) from the voltage of the cytoplasm inside the cell.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeb54).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eeb54,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
