x_comment(x_DephosphorylatingAProteinMolecule,"The collection of all events in which a #$PhosphateIon is removed from a #$ProteinMoleculeOrProteinComplex and released as a free ion.  Instances of #$DephosphorylatingAProteinMolecule are catalyzed by 'dedicated' enzymes, usually #$ProteinPhosphataseMolecules. The protein which is the #$outputsCreated of a #$DephosphorylatingAProteinMolecule is often thereby inactivated (see #$inactivatedFormOfEnzyme), and hence ready to be once again activated.  However, some proteins can be phosphorylated at multiple sites, and removing one phosphate group may not fully inactivated them.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebbd).
