x_comment(x_deviceTypeUsedWithDeviceType,"An instance of #$SymmetricBinaryPredicate, (#$deviceTypeUsedWithDeviceType   TYPE1 TYPE2) means that instances of TYPE1 and TYPE2 are designed to interact functionally with each other.  There is no specific temporal order to the design so this relation holds between two object types that were designed to work together from the start as well as between two object types where one was designed well after the design of the first.  The only constraint along these lines is that the design is intentional.  So, this relation does not hold between Screwdriver and ViceGrip even though instances of each can be used with each other.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebbf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eebbf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
