x_comment(x_ExpertisePreservingThroughMacroPredicate,"The collection of predicates that specify relations where expertise is transferred via rule macros such as #$relationExistsAll or #$relationAllExists through the associated technical problem concepts.  E.g. #$hasAccessory is a member of this collection because when a tech support person for an organization has some expertise in computer desktop hardware, and there is a hardware component type such that each of its instances is an accessory for some computer desktop hardware and that component type is in general supported by the organization for which the tech support person works, then at least some expertise in supporting that accessory type can be assumed.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebc0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eebc0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
