x_comment(x_ComputerProgramTypeBySimilarWorkflow,"A collection of types of computer programs.  Each instance of #$ComputerProgramTypeBySimilarWorkflow is a collection of programs (see #$ComputerProgram-CW) whose instances all serve a similar function and whose functions are accessed in a similar manner.  For instance, #$WordProcessingProgram-Visual is an instance of this collection because the workflow paradigms of highlighting text, dragging and dropping paragraphs and other functions are performed in a similar manner among the instances of that collection -- e.g. while there are many differences between Open Office and MS Word, the basic workflow remains similar.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebc2).
