x_comment(x_VideoTeleconference,"The collection of all teleconferences where at least some participants are also viewing live video of participants of the teleconference.  There must be at least some cases of two-way video communication.  That is, at least one pair of participants from discrete locations must be able to see each other through the video link.  For example, if Bob, Mary and John are involved in a teleconference and each are at a discrete location, then the participants would not be video teleconferencing if Bob were viewing Mary, Mary were viewing John and John were viewing Bob.  At least one pair out of the three must be viewing each other.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebd3).
