x_comment(x_Nocardia,"A collection of #$BiologicalSpecies in the #$MoneraKingdom.  These are non-motile #$BacillusBacterium with branching vegetative hyphae.  These are Gram-positive to Gram-variable #$Bacterium.  They are mesophilic and catalase-positive.  Also, these are chemoorganotrophic with an oxidative type metabolism.  #$Nocardia is often mistaken for #$Actinomyces-Genus, but these are strict #$AerobicBacterium.  These rarely cause disease in humans, predominately in immunocompromised patients.  #$BiologicalSpecies may be distinguished from one another by their patterns of proteolytic hydrolysis.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebe7).
