x_comment(x_Pasteurellaceae,"A collection of #$ProkaryoticCells in the #$MoneraKingdom.  It includes #$BiologicalGenus such as #$Pasteurella, Haemophilus, and Actinobacillus.  These #$ProkaryoticCells are straight rigid coccoid to rod-shaped cells.  They are parasites to vertebrates.  These are #$Bacterium-Immotile and #$NonSporeFormingBacterium.  Most are #$AerobicBacterium with some species being #$AnaerobicBacterium-Facultative or microphilic.  Also, they are chemoorganotrophs with respiratory and fermentative metabolism.  Reacts positively with oxidase, catalase, and alkaline phosphatase.  They require organic nitrogen sources.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebed).
