x_comment(x_Escherichia,"A collection of #$Bacterium in the #$MoneraKingdom.  These are straight #$BacillusBacterium that occur singly or in pairs.  Either #$Bacterium-MotileByFlagellum or #$Bacterium-Immotile.  Chemoorganotrophic with both a fermentative and respiratory metabolism.  They are oxidase-negative.  May use acetate as a sole carbon source, but not citrate.  This #$BiologicalSpecies  is a pathogen for humans, responsible for food poisoning, #$UrinaryTractInfections, and neonatal meningitis (see (#$InfectionFn #$Meninges)).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebf2).
