x_comment(x_Gracilicutes,"A collection of #$ProkaryoticCells in a #$BiologicalDivision within the #$MoneraKingdom; the #$Gracilicutes are #$ProkaryoticCells with a thin cell wall.  These cells are #$GramNegativeBacterium, with a few exceptions.  Cell shape may be spheres, oval, straight or curved rods, helices or filaments.  The majority reproduce by binary fission but some members reproduce by budding.  This group does not from endospores.  Motility varies as does respiration.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eebf3).
