x_comment(x_DataLocationAlteringFunction,"The collection of all #$CodingFunctions such that, if a piece of executable code that calls the function (a #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable where the function is the #$codingFunctionInvoked) is executed in a normal runtime environment, the resulting execution will be a ComputerDataAlteration: i.e., will result in a change to the content of one or more locations in computer memory.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec10).
