x_comment(x_mutableArgumentPosition,"Where FN is a #$DataLocationAlteringFunction, (#$mutableArgumentPosition FN N) means that, when a piece of executable code (a #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable) for which FN is the #$codingFunctionInvoked is executed in a normal run-time environment, the numeric value of the Nth argument given for FN in the execution denotes a #$ComputerDataStorageLocation whose content will be changed by the application of FN.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec11).
