x_comment('x_OWLProperty-AutogeneratedSKSIMappings',"A subcollection of #$SKSISupportedOWLProperty.  Each instance of this collection is an OWL or RDF property that will have its needed logical schema assertions autopopulated.  The subject encodings and decodings will reference the codemapping supplied by #$hasAssociatedCMLS.  For object properties, the object encodings and decodings will also reference that reified mapping.  The object encoding and decodings for data properties are handled on a case by case basic with specific rules on subcollections of this collection for data properties whose ranges are literal strings, integers, reals, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec87).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eec87,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
