x_comment(x_owlPropertyHasImplicitUnitOfMeasure,"(#$owlPropertyHasImplicitUnitOfMeasure PROP UNIT) means that the owl datatype property PROP implicitly references the #$UnitOfMeasure, UNIT.  For example, consider an OWL property like example:hasLengthInMeters.  The actual asserted #$rdfs:range on this property might be #$xsd:float.  but any use of it implicitly means that the length of the subject is that number of meters.  In this case, (#$owlPropertyHasImplicitUnitOfMeasure example:hasLengthInMeters #$Meter) would be asserted.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec8b).
