x_comment(x_ProteinConformationChangeEvent,"Instances of #$ProteinConformationChangeEvent are events in which one #$ProteinMoleculeOrProteinComplex changes shape.  This can occur in response to binding by a ligand, to the unbinding of a bound ligand, or to other environmental factors like changes in temperature, pH, ion concentration or phosphorylation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec8e).
