x_comment(x_ReceptorMoleculeInactivationEvent,"The collection of #$ChemicalInteractions in which some #$ReceptorMolecule becomes inactive, so that it no longer initiates a signal transduction pathway (see #$SignalTransduction-CellularProcess).  For many receptor types, the necessary first step of receptor inactivation is the disassociation of the receptor from a ligand.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec93).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eec93,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
