x_comment(x_ConstitutivelyActiveReceptorMolecule,"The collection of all #$ReceptorMolecules which are constitutively active.  This means that in the absence of a bound ligand, the receptor is able to initiate its typical signal transduction leading to a biological response.  Such receptors can have their activity blocked by an inverse agonist, and have their activity increased by binding with an agonist.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec95).
