x_comment(x_eventTypeFallsOnNthDayInMonth,"(#$eventTypeFallsOnNthDayTypeInMonth EVENT MONTH NUM) is used to say that a special event falls annually on a specified Nth day during a certain month MONTH.  For example, to say that Groundhog Day falls on the second of February: (#$eventTypeFallsOnNthDayInMonth #$GroundhogDay #$February 2).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec97).
