x_comment(x_GroundhogDay,"Each of these is a one-day-long annual #$Holiday celebrated on February 2nd in the United States and Canada.  Tradition dictates that if a groundhog sees its shadow when it emerges from its burrow on this day, winter will continue for six more weeks (and otherwise it will end soon).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec98).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eec98,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
