x_comment(x_ListOfTypeFn,"A unary #$CollectionDenotingFunction from collections to collections of lists of instances of those collections.  (#$ListOfTypeFn <b>COLL</b>) is the collection of all #$Lists (i.e. ordered n-tuples) of things such that each item in the list is an instance of <b>COLL</b>.  For example, (#$ListOfTypeFn #$Integer) is the collection of lists of integers, and (#$TheList 1 2 3) is an instance of this collection. Cf. #$ListOfSpecsFn.\n<p>\nSee the corresponding predicate #$instanceListMemberType.  And see #$SetOfTypeFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eec99).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eec99,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
