x_comment('x_RDFTripleStore-AutoGenerated',"The collection of SKSI RDF triple store representations that have the bulk of their SKSI assertions auto-generated.  In general, once creating an instance of this collection one would only need to add the URL address of the triple store as shown below\n\n<pre>\n  (ist (MappingMtFn KS)\n    (sparqlServiceEndpointForKS KS URL))\n</pre>\n\nand assign it a name like shown below\n\n<pre>\n  (ist SKSIMt\n    (canonicalNameForTripleStoreKS KS NAME))\n</pre>\n\nIt only takes a few moments for the required assertions to propagate.  The knowledge source is now ready to be assigned some OWL properties via #$hasAssociatedCMLS.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eecb2).
