x_comment(x_BoneTheStuff,"Hard, largely mineralized (see #$BoneMineral) connective tissue of which the adult skeleton of most vertebrates is chiefly composed.  Although bones (see #$Bone-BodyPart) are largely made up of #$BoneTheStuff, they also contain other tissue types, such as #$BoneMarrow, #$NerveTissue, and #$BloodVessels. #$BoneTheStuff refers only to the hard, mineralized portions of bones and the cells locally involved in its development, maintenance and metabolism.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eed11).
