x_comment(x_AtLeastMultipotentCell,"Individual #$EukaryoticCells which are not yet fully differentiated (see #$CellularDifferentiation) are elements of this collection.  #$AtLeastMultipotentCell includes cells which are multipotent (see #$MultipotentCell), meaning they are limited in which types of cells they can become, as well as #$PluripotentCells and #$TotipotentCells, which have fewer limitations.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eed28).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eed28,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
