x_comment(x_TerminallyDifferentiatedCell,"#$TerminallyDifferentiatedCells are the end result of #$CellularDifferentiation and normally cannot develop any further.  They are also typically unable to divide.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eed29).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eed29,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
