x_comment(x_cellularOutputs,"(#$cellularOutputs PROCESS CELL) states that the individual #$Cell, CELL, is one of the outputs resulting from PROCESS (an instance of #$BiologicalProcess-CellularLevel).  There may be other, non-cellular outputs from PROCESS.  CELL may or may not have been created by PROCESS.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eed2a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eed2a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505eed2a,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
