x_comment(x_productOfBLO,"<code>(#$productOfPlant PLANT PRODUCT)</code> means that <code>PLANT</code> is the source of <code>PRODUCT</code>.  For example <code>(#$productOfPlant MapleTree001 MapleSyrup001)</code> means that <code>MapleTree001</code> is the source of <code>MapleSyrup001</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eed2f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eed2f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
