x_comment(x_bLOTypeLifelongProcessType,"(#$bLOTypeLifelongProcessType BLO-TYPE PROC-TYPE) states that instances of the type of #$BiologicalLivingObject, BLO-TYPE, are doing (probably unconsciously) a type of #$BiologicalProcess, PROC-TYPE, throughout their existence as living things.  Given any portion of the life of such an instance of BLO-TYPE, including its entire life, there will be some instance of PROC-TYPE that is a cotemporal sub-event of that #$Living (see #$cotemporalProperSubEvents).  For example, (#$bLOTypeLifelongProcessType #$AerobicOrganism #$Respiration).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eedbf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eedbf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
