x_comment(x_EukaryoticCellCycle,"The collection of all single iterations through #$TheCellCycle for eukaryotic cells.  Each instance consists of interphase (see #$InterphaseOfEukaryoticCellCycle), which starts at the moment the cell appears and is largely period of growth and preparation for division, and the M phase (see #$MitoticPhaseOfCellCycle), during which the cell undergoes #$Mitosis and #$Cytokinesis.  For the collection of all iterations through (along a single path) events of this type (i.e., the eukaryotic cell cycle <i>as a cycle</i>, see #$TheEukaryoticCellCycle.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eedc8).
