x_comment(x_DeleteriousCodeInjection,"The collection of all #$CodeInjections where the unspecified data that is introduced by the program execution has the potential to generate an undesirable effect on being executed in turn, in terms of compromising the intended functionality of the program.  At best a #$DeleteriousCodeInjection may involve an unintended introduction of code that cuases the program to yield incorrect results, go into an infinite loop, or halt with an error condition.  At worst, it may allow an unauthorized person or application to take control of the machine state and either read from or write to an unauthorized location (or both).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eee1c).
