x_comment(x_ReadFileFn,"#$ReadFileFn reads data from the file or input/output device at the position specified by the file pointer if supported by the device. The first argument specifies a handle to the device being read from (the parameter must have been created with read access)  The second argument gives a pointer to the buffer that receives the data read.  The third argument specifies the maximum number of bytes to be read.  The fourth, optional argument gives a pointer to the variable that receives the number of bytes read when using a parameter that is synchronous with the arg1 position.  The fifth, optioonal argument gives a pointer to a valid and unique Overlapped structure.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eee55).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eee55,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
