x_comment(x_subColWhoseInstancesSeriallyRecurWithFrequency,"The corresponding predicate (#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical) of #$AllInstancesOfTypeWithSerialFrequencyFn.  Where SIT-TYPE is a specialization of #$Situation and FREQUENCY is a #$Frequency, (#$subColWhoseInstancesSeriallyRecurWithFrequency SIT-TYPE FREQUENCY SUB-TYPE) means that SUB-TYPE is the collection of all instances of SIT-TYPE such that each instance is part of a temporally extended series that can be parsed into an institutionally or culturally sanctioned linear sequence of events, occurring with a regularity of FREQUENCY and sharing a definitive set of features in common with the instance, including, but by no means\nlimited to, membership in SIT-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eee93).
