x_comment(x_AllInstancesOfTypeWithSerialFrequencyFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction.  Where SIT-TYPE is a specialization of #$Situation, (#$AllInstancesOfTypeWithSerialFrequencyFn SIT-TYPE FREQUENCY) denotes the collection of all instances of SIT-TYPE such that each instance is part of a temporally extended series that can be parsed into an institutionally or culturally sanctioned linear sequence of events, occurring with a regularity of FREQUENCY and sharing a definitive set of features in common with the instance, including, but by no means\nlimited to, membership in SIT-TYPE.  Thus, e.g., (AllInstancesOfTypeWithSerialFrequencyFn SportsEvent Yearly) denotes the set of all SportsEvents such that each instance is part of an institutionally sanctioned series of annually-occurring like events:\nexample instances would include the (#$AnnualEventOfYearFn #$SuperBowlGame (#$YearFn 1989), or the (#$AnnualEventOfYearFn\n#$NCAAMensDivision1BasketballChampionshipTournament (#$YearFn 2009)).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eee95).
