x_comment('x_partSynthesizesSubstance-TypeType',"(#$partSynthesizesSubstance-TypeType PARTTYPE SUBSTANCETYPE) states that instances of PARTTYPE produce portions of SUBSTANCETYPE biosynthetically.  PARTTYPE must be specific enough with respect to its species, stage of development, etc. so that every instance can typically be expected to synthesize SUBSTANCETYPE, but exceptions can apply in unusual conditions. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeed0).
