x_comment(x_transmittingCell,"<code>(#$transmittingCell COMMUNICATION CELL)</code> identifies <code>cell</code> as the instance of #$Cell that is the source of the \"signal\" being sent to other cell(s) in <code>COMMUNICATION</code>, an instance of #$CellularCommunication.  Chemically, this means that <code>cell</code> is the #$secretionSource in the instance(s) of #$CellularSecretionEvent that start <code>COMMUNICATION</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeeec).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eeeec,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
