x_comment('x_substanceInBLOContributesToBioProcess-TypeLevel',"(#$substanceInBLOContributesToBioProcess-TypeLevel ?SUBST-TYPE ?BLO-TYPE ?P-TYPE) states that the presence of some adequate amount of ?SUBST-TYPE in an instance of ?BLO-TYPE is a precursor to the occurrence of an instance of the biological process, ?P-TYPE.  The presence of ?SUBST-TYPE may not be necessary, or sufficient; however, when an instance of ?P-TYPE occurs, typically an instance of ?SUBST-TYPE has been present.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeeee).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eeeee,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
