x_comment('x_substanceInBLOTriggersBioProcess-TypeLevel',"(#$substanceInBLOTriggersBioProcess-TypeLevel ?SUBST-TYPE ?BLO-TYPE ?P-TYPE) states that the presence of some adequate amount of ?SUBST-TYPE in an instance of ?BLO-TYPE is a sufficient precursor for the occurrence of an instance of the biological process, ?P-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeeef).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eeeef,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
