x_comment(x_onlyOrganismTypeSynthesizesType,"(#$onlyOrganismTypeSynthesizesType ORGTYPE SUBSTANCETYPE) states that every instance of ORGTYPE produces portions of SUBSTANCETYPE biosynthetically, and that furthermore if a portion of SUBSTANCETYPE is naturally biosynthesized by some organism, that occurs within the body of an instance of ORGTYPE.  (Note that in laboratory settings, it may be possible to artificially synthesize SUBSTANCETYPE, or to cause cells from an instance of ORGTYPE to produce SUBSTANCETYPE, or even to genetically modify some other type of organism so that it produces SUBSTANCETYPE.) ") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeef4).
