x_comment(x_signalMolecules,"<code>(#$signalMolecules CELL-COMMUNICATION-EVENT MOLECULE)</code> means that the instance <code>MOLECULE</code> of #$Molecule is a signal molecule in <code>CELL-COMMUNICATION-EVENT</code>, an instance of #$CellularCommunication.  A signal molecule is a molecule that is one of the #$outputsSecreted by the #$transmittingCell in a cellular communication event, and thus is the first object involved in a series of chemical interactions (possibly of length 1) that comprise the \"transmission\" of the \"message\" sent by the cell to the #$targetCells.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeef6).
