x_comment(x_targetCells,"<code>(#$targetCells CELL-COMMUNICATION CELL)</code> means that <code>CELL</code> is one of the instances of #$Cell that \"receives\" the \"signal\" from the #$transmittingCell in CELL-COMMUNICATION, an instance of #$CellularCommunication.  Each of the #$targetCells is the #$locusOfCellularProcess-Cell for a specific instance of #$CellSignalingProcess-LocalizedToSingleCell that starts with the reception of the signal.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeef9).
