x_comment(x_GeneTypeBySpeciesAndProductFamily,"A collection of collections of #$GeneticInformationStructures. Each instance GIS-TYPE of this collection is composed of instances of #$Gene-GIS that share these properties: 1) Each is a sequence that is instantiated (see #$instantiationOfGene-GIS) as a physical gene in the genetic material of members of the same #$BiologicalSpecies, and 2) Each is a sequence that, when its physical instantiation is transcribed to produce an #$RNAMolecule and optionally translated to produce a #$ProteinMolecule, will result in molecules all belonging to the same instance of #$PeptideMoleculeTypeBySourceGene.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef04).
