x_comment(x_PhysicalGeneTypeByExactSequence,"Each instance PGTBES of #$PhysicalGeneTypeByExactSequence is a specialization of #$Gene-HereditaryUnit (and thus a collection of segments of DNA) comprising instances that are locationally the same, more or less (modulo variation in surrounding DNA).  Furthermore, each instance of PGTBES possesses the same sequence of nucleotides, and each instance belongs to organisms of the same species.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef09).
