x_comment(x_partExpressesGene,"(#$partExpressesGene PART GENETYPE) states that the #$OrganismPart, PART, produces the products of GENETYPE via biosynthesis.  If PART is multicellular, this means that there are cells within PART which express GENETYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef18).
