x_comment(x_cellExpressesGene,"(#$cellExpressesGene CELL GENETYPE) states that CELL produces the products of GENETYPE via biosynthesis.  This entails that the physical instantiation of GENETYPE present in CELL is transcribed into mRNA (see #$Transcription-DNAToRNA) and, if GENETYPE's ultimate product is a protein, that mRNA is translated (see #$Translation-RNAToProtein) into a protein prouduct within CELL.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef1a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eef1a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
