x_comment(x_SomaticCell,"The collection of instances of #$Cell that (outside a petri-dish or having otherwise been artificially or accidentally removed from a body) make up the body (i.e., are the constituent cells of the tissues and organs) of any multi-cellular organism (and which constitute the bodies of single-celled eukaryotes).  Thus an organism's somatic cells are all of its cells aside from its sex cells (its instances of #$Gamete and #$GermCell).") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef1f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eef1f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
