x_comment(x_platformOrTechnologyTypeImplicatedInWeaknessType,"If PLATFORM-OR-PLATFORM-TYPE is an #$Artifact-Generic, (#$platformOrTechnologyTypeImplicatedInWeaknessType CODE-TYPE PLATFORM-OR-PLATFORM-TYPE) means that executing code that is an instance of CODE-TYPE in a run-time environment that features PLATFORM-OR-PLATFOM-TYPE carries a nontrivial risk of realizing whatever undesirable behavior is associated with CODE-TYPE (see #$codeTypeHasPropensityForActionOfType).  If PLATFORM-OR-PLATFORM-TYPE is a #$FirstOrderCollection, (#$platformOrTechnologyTypeImplicatedInWeaknessType CODE-TYPE PLATFORM-OR-PLATFORM-TYPE) means that executing code that is an instance of CODE-TYPE in a run-time environment that features some instance of PLATFORM-OR-PLATFOM-TYPE carries a nontrivial risk of realizing whatever undesirable behavior is associated with CODE-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef43).
