x_comment(x_valueTypeCitedByConditionExpression,"(#$valueTypeCitedByConditionExpression EXPRESSION VALUE-TYPE) means that the #$ConditionExpression EXPRESSION explicitly states a condition according to which a variable (the #$variableCitedInConditionExpression) has a value that belongs to the #$MeasurableScalarIntervalType VALUE-TYPE. That is, if the value of the #$variableCitedInConditionExpression is an instance of VALUE-TYPE, this is both a necessary and sufficient condition for meeting the requirement given by EXPRESSION.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef7a).
