x_comment(x_wikipediaArticleName,"(#$wikipediaArticleName THING NAME) means that in the English Version of #$Wikipedia-WebSite THING is described by an article with the title NAME . Note that this title is the last part of the URL, not the title that appears at the top of the rendered page.  This predicate differs from #$wikipediaArticleName-Canonical in that this predicate is not #$singleEntryFormatInArgs, which is to say that there may be multiple arg2 values for any given arg1 value.   Typically, this predicate will be used for redirect links, while wikipediaArticleName-Canonical should used for canonical page name.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eef8b).
