x_comment(x_ForStatement,"A class of #$IterationCodeStatements found in programs authored using members of the #$C-ProgrammingLanguageFamily. Every #$ForStatement features exactly three #$ConditionExpressions and one #$subStatementOfIterationStatement.  The first condition, the #$initializingConditionExpressionOfForStatement, specifies the initial settings of any relevant variables prior to entering the iteration loop specified by the #$subStatementOfIterationStatement.  The #$terminationConditionExpressionOfForStatement specifies the test condition for terminating the iteration loop.  Finally, the #$reInitializingConditionExpressOfForStatement is evaluated after each iteration, and thus specifies a re-initialization for the loop.  The #$subStatementOfIterationStatement specifies the process to be iterated.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eefa7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eefa7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505eefa7,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
