x_comment(x_TerminationConditionOfForStatementFn,"A #$ReifiableFunction for referencing the statement of the termination condition for a given #$ForStatement.  Where FOR-STATE is a #$ForStatement, (#$TerminationConditionOfForStatementFn FOR-STATE) denotes the #$ConditionExpression that specifies the test condition for terminating the iteration loop specified by the #$subStatementOfIterationStatement of FOR-STATE.  See also the corresponding predicate (#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical) #$terminationConditionExpressionOfForStatement.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eefac).
