x_comment(x_ReInitializingConditionOfForStatementFn,"A #$ReifiableFunction for referencing the specification of the re-entrant settings of the relevant variables relative to the iteration loop given by the #$subStatementOfIterationStatement of a #$ForStatement.  Where FOR-STATE is a #$ForStatement, (#$ReInitializingConditionOfForStatementFn FOR-STATE) denotes the #$ConditionExpression that states the internal initialization settings for the variables prior to each successive execution of the iteration loop.  See also the corresponding predicate (#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical) #$reInitializingConditionExpressionOfForStatement.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eefae).
