x_comment('x_PhysicalGeneTypeOfGene-GISFn',"Where GIS is a genetic information structure that is an instance of #$Gene-GIS, (#$PhysicalGeneTypeOfGene-GISFn GIS) denotes the collection of physical genes, i.e., specs of #$Gene-HereditaryUnit, which instantiate GIS (see #$instantiationOfGene-GIS.)  Note each instance of #$Gene-GIS represents a single, specific sequence of nucleotides, and does not admit variation that may occur between two individuals for the same gene, or even between a single individual's two chromosomes.  Therefore, the instances of (#$PhysicalGeneTypeOfGene-GISFn GIS) are physical genes instantiating the same specific sequence of nucleotides.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eefc7).
