x_comment(x_collRelationUnique,"A ternary #$RuleMacroPredicate that relates a predicate to a pair of collections such that each instance of the first (second) collection is related by the predicate to (from) exactly one instance of the second (first) collection.  Thus, <code>(#$collRelationUnique PRED COL1 COL2)</code> is true if and only if both of these are true:\n<pre>\n  (#$relationAllExistsUnique PRED COL1 COL2)\n\n  (#$relationExistsUniqueAll PRED COL1 COL2)\n</pre>\nFor example,\n<pre>\n  (#$collRelationUnique #$internalParts #$Thigh #$Femur)\n</pre>\nmeans that (i) every thigh has or had a unique femur inside it and (ii) every\nfemur is or was inside a unique thigh.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eefdc).
