x_comment(x_collectionOfValuesFromFnApplicationToArg,"This is the corresponding predicate to #$CollectionOfValuesForFunctionFn.  (#$collectionOfValuesFromFnApplicationToArg FUNCTION COLL NUM VALUE-COLL) menas that VALUE-COLL is the collection of values achieved by applying FUNCTION to each instance of COLL (A subcollection of the NUMth argument position of FUNCTION) along with any other arguments (if FUNCTION is binary or higher).  That is, VALUE-COLL is that subset of the range of FUNCTION such that each NUMth element in its domain is an instance of COLL.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eeff2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eeff2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
