x_comment('x_Metaphysis-BoneSubPart',"The collection of all metaphyses. Each is a region of a #$LongBone between the diaphysis (see #$BoneShaft) and the two epiphyses (see #$BoneExtremity) and is a type of #$BoneSubPart.  Each long bone has two.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef041).
