x_comment(x_EpiphysealPlate,"Instances are regions of #$HyalineCartilage tissue at each metaphysis (see #$Metaphysis-BoneSubPart) of #$LongBones in immature #$Vertebrates that are still growing. This is a region of proliferating #$Chondrocytes responsible for the increase in the length of bone as the organism grows. Older chondorcytes are pushed away from the plate, where they degenerate.  #$Osteoblasts replace this tissue with bone. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef042).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef042,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
