x_comment(x_LamellarBoneTissue,"A type of bone tissue based on the organization of its collagen fibers.  In #$LamellarBoneTissue, #$Collagen fibers are organized in a regular parallel arrangement, resulting in bone that is mechanically stronger than #$WovenBoneTissue.  #$WovenBoneTissue is produced as the first kind of bone in fetal development, and after #$BoneFractures.  It is later remodeled into #$LamellarBoneTissue.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef044).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef044,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
