x_comment(x_allProperSubSitTypesOf,"(#$allProperSubSitTypesOf SIT-COL COL-TYPE) means that COL-TYPE is a collection of collections such that every collection instance of COL-TYPE is a #$properSubSituationTypes of SIT-COL.  That is, (#$allProperSubSitTypesOf SIT-COL COL-TYPE) means that a collection COL is an instance of COL-TYPE if and only if every instance of SIT-COL has some instance of COL as a #$properSubSituations.  This is the corresponding predicate (#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical) of #$AllProperSubSitTypesOfFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef051).
