x_comment(x_slotsDirectlyProportionalViaConstantToSlotForRelatedTypes,"(#$slotsDirectlyProportionalViaConstantToSlotForRelatedTypes  OBJ-TYPE1 OBJ-TYPE2 BIN-PRED SLOT-1 SLOT-2 CONSTANT) means that when INST-1 and INST-2 (instances of OBJ-TYPE1 and OBJ-TYPE2 respectively) stand in BIN-PRED such that (BIN-PRED INST-1 INST-2), then the values for SLOT-2 for INST-2 are directly proportional to the values for SLOT-1 for INST-1 via CONSTANT -- i.e SLOT-VAL-OBJ2 = CONSTANT-VAL * SLOT-VAL-OBJ1.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef11c).
