x_comment(x_SingleFocalObjectFormula,"The collection of mathematical formulas that express some physical principle #$PhysicalPrinciple via values on some quantity slots where the subject of each of the slots is assumed to be the same object.  This entails the same conditions of applicability as asserting (#$constraintForQuantityBasedFormula FORMULA QUANT1 QUANT2 #$equals) for each pair of quantities involved in FORMULA.  For example, the area of a rectangle is a function of the length and height of the rectangle -- it is assumed the values for length and height are from the same rectangle.  Contrast this with a formula to determine the combined area of two rectangles where the area of one is added to the area of the other.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef146).
