x_comment(x_constraintForQuantityBasedFormula,"(#$constraintForQuantityBasedFormula QBF QUANTITY1 QUANTITY2 BIN-PRED) means that for the formula to be applicable, the thing with QUANTITY1 must stand in BIN-PRED to the thing with QUANTITY2.  So, if SLOT-1 and SLOT-2 are the slots associated with those quantities via #$unitSlotsForFormula, then the following must be true for the formula to be applicable to INS-1 or INS-2 (#$and (SLOT-1 INS-1 QUANTITY1) (SLOT-2 INS-2 QUANTITY2) (BIN-PRED INS-1 INS-2)).  Note that this expresses a necessary condition of the formula's application.  A sufficient condition is that all relevant constraints for the formula are satisfied.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef147).
