x_comment(x_FunctionCallForNthArgumentOfFunctionCallFn,"A #$ReifiableFunction used to denote a #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable with a certain use.  Where SUPER-CALL is itself a #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable, (#$FunctionCallForNthArgumentOfFunctionCallFn SUPER-CALL N) denotes the #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable such that whatever value is returned by its #$codingFunctionInvoked on its #$actualArgumentListOfFunctionInvocation is specified as the value supplied to the Nth argument of the #$codingFunctionInvoked in SUPER-CALL.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef1e6).
