x_comment(x_FunctionCallSetsInitializationValueForVariableFn,"An #$IndividualDenotingFunction used to reference function calls (instances of #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable) which are used to set the initialization values of #$InitializationStatements.  Specifically, where INIT is an #$InitializationStatement and VAR is a #$ComputerCodeVariable such that INIT sets the initialization value for VAR by means of a #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable, (#$FunctionCallSetsInitializationValueFn INIT VAR) denotes the #$ComputerFunctionInvocation-Executable that INIT uses to set the initialization value for VAR.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef1e7).
