x_comment(x_LotProcessingStep,"The collection of all industrial #$ProcessingEvents wherein a delimited 'step' or 'stage' in an industry fabrication process model is instantiated as a subevent for every element of a processed 'lot' (#$ProcessingAllotment), with as many such subevents obtaining as there are elements in the #$ProcessingAllotment.  The subevents may occur sequentially (#$LotProcessingStep-Serial) or simultaneously (#$LotProcessingStep-Parallel):  that is, the elements of the #$ProcessingAllotment being processed in the #$LotProcessingStep may be processed one after the other, or all together.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef2db).
