x_comment(x_objectHasSlotValueAtConditions,"A predicate used to describe the effects of different environmental conditions (most notably temperature and pressure) on a sample of tangible stuff.  <code>(#$objectHasSlotValueAtConditions OBJ SLOT VALUE PLACE)</code> means that were <code>OBJ</code> to have its temperature and pressure approach the approximate temperature and pressure of the instance <code>PLACE</code> of #$Place, <code>(SLOT OBJ VALUE)</code> would obtain.  <code>SLOT</code> here is a #$MeasurableQuantitySlot, such as #$massOfObject, and <code>VALUE</code> is constrained to be an appropriate arg2 value for <code>SLOT</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef334).
