x_comment(x_PartonomicRatioSlot,"A specialization of #$QuantitySlot (q.v.).  Each instance of #$PartonomicRatioSlot is a binary predicate that is used to relate an individual to a #$RatioQuantity based on the proportion of some part of some type of that individual to a part of of some other type of that individual.  To tersely state the types of parts being compared, the dimension along which they are compared (e.g., #$massOfObject), and the dividend/divisor roles, use #$slotCalculatesRatioOfPartTypeToPartTypeForTypeAlongDimension.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef383).
