x_comment(x_slotCalculatesRatioOfPartTypeToPartTypeForTypeAlongDimension,"A predicate used to tersely describe the semantics of an instance of #$PartonomicRatioSlot.\n<code>(#$slotCalculatesRatioOfPartTypeToPartTypeForTypeAlongDimension SLOT ARG-1-TYPE PART-TYPE-1 PART-TYPE-2 DIMENSION)</code> means that <code>SLOT</code> relates an instance of <code>ARG-1-TYPE</code> to the ratio of the <code>DIMENSION</code> -- an instance of #$MeasurableQuantitySlot, e.g., #$massOfObject -- of the part of it that is of type <code>PART-TYPE-1</code> to the <code>DIMENSION</code> of the part of it that is of type <code>PART-TYPE-2</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef384).
