x_comment(x_maximalWithRespectToType,"<code>(#$maximalWithRespectToType THING PRED  COMPARISON-COLLECTION)</code> means that relative to other things in <code>COMPARISON-CLASS</code>, the #$Thing <code>THING</code> is maximal with regard to the manner in which it stands in the relation <code>PRED</code> to some #$ScalarQuantity <code>QUANT</code>.  I.e. it is true that <code>(PRED THING QUANT)</code> and for any #$Thing <code>OTHER-THING</code> in <code>COMPARISON-CLASS</code>, if there is some other #$Quantity <code>OTHER-QUANT</code> of such that <code>(PRED OTHER-THING OTHER-QUANT)</code>, <code>OTHER-QUANT</code> is less than <code>QUANT</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef48e).
