x_comment(x_MaximalRolePlayerWRTSlotDuringIndividualHistoryFn,"<code>(#$MaximalRolePlayerWRTSlotDuringIndividualHistoryFn T-THING SIT-TYPE ROLE SLOT)</code> denotes the individual <code>IND</code> which is such that during the temporal extent of <code>T-THING</code> from its inception until the present, <code>T-THING</code> has done (see #$doneBy) one or more instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, and <code>IND</code> played the role <code>ROLE</code> in at least one such instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> and is maximal with regard to its value for <code>SLOT</code> compared to all other things that have played the role <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> done by <code>IND</code>.\n<p>\nThis function is useful for denoting the largest fish someone has ever caught, or the highest mountain someone has ever climbed.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef490).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef490,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
