x_comment(x_maximalWithRespectToPlace,"<code>(#$maximalWithRespectToPlace ST PRED PLACE)</code> means that relative to other things found in <code>PLACE</code>, the #$SpatialThing-Localized <code>ST</code> is maximal with regard to the manner in which it stands in the relation <code>PRED</code> to some #$ScalarQuantity <code>QUANT</code>.  I.e. it is true that <code>(#$objectFoundInLocation OBJ PLACE)</code>, and <code>(PRED THING QUANT)</code>, and if <code>(PRED THING QUANT)</code> and for any other #$SpatialThing-Localized <code>OTHER-OBJ</code> found in <code>PLACE</code>, if there is some other #$Quantity <code>OTHER-QUANT</code> of such that <code>(PRED OTHER-OBJ OTHER-QUANT)</code>, <code>OTHER-QUANT</code> is less than <code>QUANT</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef493).
