x_comment(x_minimalRolePlayerWRTSlotDuringIndividualHistory,"<code>(#$minimalRolePlayerWRTSlotDuringIndividualHistory IND T-THING SIT-TYPE ROLE SLOT)</code> means that during the temporal extent of <code>T-THING</code> from its inception until the present, <code>T-THING</code> has done (see #$doneBy) one or more instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, and <code>IND</code> played the role <code>ROLE</code> in at least one such instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> and is minimal with regard to its value for <code>SLOT</code> compared to all other things that have played the role <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> done by <code>IND</code>.\n<p>\nThis predicate is useful for indicating the smallest puppy someone has ever seen, or the smallest apartment someone has ever lived in.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef4a0).
