x_comment('x_tissueSynthesizesObject-TypeType',"(#$tissueSynthesizesObject-TypeType TISSUETYPE OBJECTTYPE) states that instances of the #$BiologicalTissue, TISSUETYPE, produce portions of OBJECTTYPE biosynthetically.  TISSUETYPE must be specific enough with respect to its species, stage of development, etc. so that every instance can typically be expected to synthesize OBJECTTYPE, but exceptions can apply in unusual conditions.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef4ce).
