x_comment('x_cellSynthesizesObject-TypeType',"(#$cellSynthesizesObject-TypeType CELLTYPE OBJECTTYPE) states that instances of CELLTYPE produce portions of OBJECTTYPE biosynthetically.  CELLTYPE must be specific enough with respect to its species, cell lineage, stage of development, etc. so that every instance can typically be expected to synthesize OBJECTTYPE, but exceptions can apply in unusual conditions.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef4d1).
