x_comment('x_LinearRegionMode-Transistor',"The collection of transistors\n(particularlyMOSFET) whose gate to source voltage is more than the threshold\nvoltage of the device but where the difference between the gate source voltage\nand the threshold voltage is greater than or equal to the drain to source\nvoltage.  The gate will be on and the device is acting as a resistor controlled \nby the gate voltage relative to both drain and source voltages.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef590).
