x_comment(x_FlashMobScript,"A specialization of #$CoordinatedGroupActivity.  Each instance of #$FlashMobScript is a three-stage event in which members of the group (the prospective #$FlashMob) slowly and inconspicuously occupy a public area, mixing with other, unsuspecting occupants of that area (see #$FlashMobSetup); then, at a prearranged time or in response to a signal, break out into a scripted routine, such as a choreographed dance or some other activity unusual for a public area (see #$FlashMobPerformance); then, at the conclusion of the routine, dissipate into the crowd (see #$FlashMobDispersal).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5b3).
