x_comment(x_nthCodeStatementOfCodeStatement,"(#$nthCodeStatementOfCodeStatement BLOCK\nSUB-BLOCK N) means that, first, SUB-BLOCK is contained in BLOCK and there is no \nother #$ComputerCodeStatement such that BLOCK contains it and it contains\nSUB-BLOCK \n(i.e., (#$nearestProperSubsumingCodeStatement SUB-BLOCK BLOCK)), and second,\nthat\nthere are exactly N #$ComputerCodeStatement that have BLOCK as the\n#$nearestProperSubsumingCodeStatement, and that precede SUB-BLOCK within BLOCK. \nIntuitively, SUB-BLOCK is the Nth 'top-level' #$ComputerCodeStatement appearing \nin\nBLOCK.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5bb).
