x_comment(x_ProteinMoleculeActivityRegulationEvent,"Instances are #$ChemicalInteractions in which, by virtue of being bound to or unbound from some other #$ChemicalObject, an #$ProteinMolecule has its 'activity' altered.  By 'activity', we mean the ability of the molecule to act in the typical kinds of #$ChemicalReactions it normally participates in.  These might include catalyzing certain reactions, activating some other protein, or, in the case of ion channels, opening or closing to change the flow of ions across a membrane.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5bd).
