x_comment('x_ProteinMoleculeInhibition-Competitive',"A subcollection of #$ProteinMoleculeInhibition-Reversible, instances of which have the property that the regulatory molecule and the normal target molecule or substrate of the protein cannot bind to the protein at the same time, because they bind to the same location.  This type of inhibition is so named because the regulatory molecule and the target molecule 'compete' for the same binding site.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5d0).
