x_comment(x_statementLoadsTheRegisterOfType,"Where STATEMENT is a #$ComputerCodeStatement, (#$statementLoadsTheRegisterOfType STATEMENT REGISTER-TYPE) means that STATEMENT is a specification such that any #$ProgramAction that executes it in a 'normal' run-time environment will write to the unique #$CPUMemoryRegister of type REG-TYPE on the physical machine implementing the program.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5d9).
