x_comment(x_statementOverwritesTheRegisterOfType,"(#$statementOverwritesTheRegisterOfType STATEMENT REG-TYPE) means that when STATEMENT is executed in a normal runtime environment, the #$ProgramAction which executes it will write a result to the unique #$CPUMemoryRegister of type REG-TYPE in the operating platform executing the program of which STATEMENT is a part, where this register already holds some previous value inserted there as a result of executing a prior statement (a statement on which STATEMENT depends) in the program:  as a result of the new write operation, the previous value stored in the register will be lost.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5da).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef5da,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
