x_comment(x_transconductanceOfTransistorAtPointOnCurve,"<code>(#$transconductanceOfTransistorAtPointOnCurve TRANS SIEMENS)</code> means that the transistor <code>OBJ</code> has <code>SIEMENS</code> of transconductance at a given drain current and gate to source voltage that define a point on the operating curve in the \"on\" region.  For DC field effect transistors, this is the ratio of 2 x drain current at that bias point over the difference between the gate voltage and the threshold voltage (effective or overdrive voltage).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef5df).
