x_comment(x_supplementalSlotsForFormula,"(#$supplementalSlotsForFormula QUANTITY SLOT) means that there is some quantity used in formula that is a function of SLOT.  This holds if the quantity is used directly in the formula (see #$unitSlotsForFormula) or if the quantity determines some quantity that is used in the formula.  E.g. If a formula uses (#$The #$Area), then since area is a function of length x width, both (#$The #$Length) and (#$The #$Width) and their associated slots are supplemental units in the formula.  The exact relationship to the other slots can be spelled out via other attributes of the formula.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef685).
