x_comment(x_expressionDeterminesQuantityForFormula,"<code>(#$expressionDeterminesQuantityForFormula QBF EXPRESSION QUANT)</code> means that in the context of the constraints of QBF, EXPRESSION is one way of determining the value of QUANT.  For example, this predicate can be used to state that the area quantity in the formula can be decomposed into an expression of (length X width) subject to the other constraints placed on the formula.  The slots used to attribute the quantities used in the expression are associated with the formula via supplementalSlotsForFormula.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef68f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef68f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
