x_comment(x_ChemicalObjectExtraCellularToIntraCellularSignalTransmissionEvent,"An important specialization of #$ChemicalObjectSignalTransmissionEvent.  Each instance is a case of#$ChemicalObjectSignalTransmissionEvent in which the information transfer is from the extracellular environment to the internal environment of a cell.  Instances of this type of signal tranmission are often parts of some #$ChemicalObjectInterCellularSignalTransmissionEvent.   One or more #$ChemicalObjects (individual atoms, ions, molecules) serve as the #$meansOfInfoTransfer, and often the transmission is mediated by a #$MembraneReceptorMolecule . ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6a3).
