x_comment(x_instancesExecuteWithVariantValueModulo,"The corresponding predicate (#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical) of #$ExecutionOfStatementWithVariantValueFn.  Where STATEMENT is a #$ComputerCodeStatement, VAL-PRED is a spec-pred of #$statementExecutionValue, and COMP-PRED is a #$NumericComparisonPredicate, (#$instancesExecuteWithVariantValueModulo STATEMENT VAL-PRED COMP-PRED EXEC-COL) means that EXEC-COL is the class of all #$ProgramActions that are executions of STATEMENT in which the value indicated by VAL-PRED which STATEMENT would otherwise get as a result of the specifications of the program in which STATEMENT appears is replaced by another value bearing the same relation to STATEMENT in execution, and bearing the relation COMP-PRED to the dispreferred value.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6bf).
