x_comment(x_indicatedStatementMitigationForProgram,"Where PROG is a #$ComputerProgram-CWIS, STATEMENT is a #$ComputerCodeStatement within PROG, VALUE-PRED is a #$CodeStatementValueAssignmentPredicate, and COMP-PRED is a #$NumericComparisonPredicate, (#$indicatedStatementMitigationForProgram PROG STATEMENT VALUE-PRED COMP-PRED) means that at least one of the weakness types exhibited by PROG can possibly be ameliorated in execution if the value indicated by VAL-PRED that STATEMENT would otherwise be given as a result of the specifications of PROG is replaced by another value bearing the same relation to STATEMENT in execution, and bearing the relation COMP-PRED to the dispreferred value.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6c2).
