x_comment(x_situationAffectsThingInWay,"(#$situationAffectsThingInWay  SIT OBJ EVT-TYPE) says that as a result of OBJ's participation in SIT, there is a good likelihood that there will be events of EVT-TYPE (denoted by #$IncreaseOnSlotFn or #$DecreaseOnSlotFn) in which the associated quantity slot will increase or decrease, accordingly, for OBJ.  E.g. (#$situationAffectsThingInWay SIT OBJ (#$IncreaseOnSlotFn #$massOfObject)) means that as a result of SIT there is good chance that the mass of OBJ will increase.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6cb).
