x_comment(x_fcvShortStringAreaChangeIndicatesShutInAtDate,"<code>(#$fcvShortStringAreaChangeIndicatesShutInAtDate WELL CURRENT-DATE STRING AREA DATE)</code> means that the short-string FCV values available at <code>CURRENT-DATE</code> indicate <code>AREA</code> (an area by which an FCV valve has changed over the course of 30 minutes) means that <code>WELL</code> was shut-in at <code>DATE</code>. This measurement in isolation is not sufficient to indicate a shut-in (see also #$thtShortStringTemperatureChangeIndicatesShutInAtDate and #$thpShortStringPressureChangeIndicatesShutInAtDate).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6d5).
