x_comment(x_nearNarrowSpecs,"<code>(#$nearNarrowSpecs COL NEAR-SPEC)</code> relates any collection <code>COL</code> to the nearest \"narrow\" collections <code>NEAR-SPEC</code> which are both subsets of <code>COL</code> and are \"narrow\" in the sense that they are not overly general (upper ontology) collections.  This predicate is #$notAssertible, since it must always be recomputed from the current state of the genls hierarchy.  #$nearNarrowSpecs is supported by code.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6df).
