x_comment(x_preventativeForWeaknessTypeInDevelopmentStage,"(#$preventativeForWeaknessTypeInDevelopmentStage WEAKNESS-TYPE PREVENTATIVE-TYPE STAGE-TYPE) means that, other things being equal, a computer program (#$ComputerProgram-CWIS) that is the 'output' (strictly speaking, the #$contentOfCreatedIBO-AIS) of an instance of #$SoftwareDevelopmentProcess-Complete will not instantiate WEAKNESS-TYPE if the instance of STAGE-TYPE that is subsumed by the #$SoftwareDevelopmentProcess-Complete includes (properly subsumes) an instance of PREVENTATIVE-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6e2).
