x_comment(x_palliativeForWeaknessTypeInDevelopmentStage,"(#$palliativeForWeaknessTypeInDevelopmentStage WEAKNESS-TYPE PALLIATIVE-TYPE STAGE-TYPE) means that if CODE is a #$ComputerProgram-CWIS instantiates WEAKNESS-TYPE and is the product (the #$contentOfCreatedIBO-AIS) of a certain #$SoftwareDevelopmentProcess-Complete, then the likelihood that execution of CODE will include an unwanted action of the type associated with WEAKNESS-TYPE (#$codeTypeHasPropensityForActionOfType) is much reduced if the STAGE-TYPE stage of the development process includes (properly subsumes as a subsituation) an instance of PALLIATIVE-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6e3).
