x_comment(x_candidateMitigationForWeaknessType,"Where CODE-TYPE is a #$ComputerCodeTypeByDeficiency such that (#$codeTypeHasPropensityForActionOfType CODE-TYPE ACTION-TYPE), (#$candidateMitigationForWeaknessType CODE-TYPE MITIGATION-TYPE) means that, other things being equal, if an execution of an instance of CODE-TYPE is an instance of MITIGATION-TYPE, the likelihood that the execution will feature an instance of ACTION-TYPE will be greatly reduced or eliminated, compared with the prior likelihood of an instance of ACTION-TYPE occurring as part of an execution of the same instance of CODE-TYPE that is not known to be an instance of MITIGATION-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6e4).
