x_comment(x_Synapse,"The collection of specialized junctions which link two cells, often #$Neurons, and which function to pass chemical or electrical signals from one cell to the other. The signaling cell is always a #$Neuron, and the signal is passed from its #$Axon to the second cell, which might be another #$Neuron or a muscle cell (see #$Myocyte) or a cell of a #$Gland.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6f5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef6f5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
