x_comment(x_cellularCommunicationPath,"<code>(#$cellularCommunicationPath CELL-COMMUNICATION PATH)</code> means that the \"signal\" released from the #$transmittingCell and received by one of the #$targetCells in <code>CELL-COMMUNICATION</code> moves through or along <code>PATH</code>.  Where communication occurs between cells of a #$MulticellularOrganism, <code>PATH</code> is part of that organism.  However, in the case of #$SingleCellOrganism instances, <code>PATH</code> is through some medium outside the individual organisms.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6f7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef6f7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
