x_comment(x_wellHasShutInAtStartDateAccordingToParameterChanges,"<code>(#$wellHasShutInAtStartDateAccordingToParameterChanges WELL CURRENT-DATE FCV-VALUE THT-VALUE THP-VALUE DATE)</code> means that values available at <code>CURRENT-DATE</code> of <code>FCV-VALUE</code> (an area by which an FCV valve has changed over the course of 30 minutes), <code>THT-VALUE</code> (a temperature differential over 2 hours measured by a THT gauge) and <code>THP-VALUE</code> (a pressure differential over 2 hours measured by a THP gauge) indicate <code>WELL</code> was shut-in at <code>DATE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef6fe).
