x_comment(x_massEventSpreadsFromPlaceToPlace,"<code>(#$massEventSpreadsFromPlaceToPlace ME P1 P2)</code> means that the mass event <code>ME</code> has one subevent at <code>P1</code> and some of its subsequent subevents at <code>P2</code>.  The subevent of <code>ME</code> that occurs at <code>P1</code> need not be the first subevent of<code>ME</code>; it need only be some proper sub event that occurs prior to other proper subevents of <code>ME</code>  that occur at <code>P2</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef71a).
