x_comment(x_minimalNumberOfTopLevelInstancesOfTypeInSitType,"(#$minimalNumberOfTopLevelInstancesOfTypeInSitType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE N) means that every instance of SIT-TYPE features at least N situations SUBSIT such that (#$topLevelInstanceOfTypeInSit SIT SUBSIT-TYPE SUBSIT). That is, (#$minimalNumberOfTopLevelInstancesOfTypeInSitType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE N) holds if and only if every instance SIT of SIT-TYPE properly subsumes at least N instances of SUBSIT-TYPE, none of which is properly subsumed by another instance of SUBSIT-TYPE that SIT subsumes.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef72c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef72c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
