x_comment(x_maximalNumberOfTopLevelInstancesOfTypeInSitType,"(#$maximalNumberOfTopLevelInstancesOfTypeInSitType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE N) means that every instance of SIT-TYPE features at most N situations SUBSIT such that (#$topLevelInstanceOfTypeInSit SIT SUBSIT-TYPE SUBSIT).  That is, (#$maximalNumberOfTopLevelInstancesOfTypeInSitType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE N) holds just in case every instance SIT of SIT-TYPE properly subsumes at most N instances of SUBSIT-TYPE, none of which is properly subsumed by another instance of SUBSIT-TYPE that SIT subsumes.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef72d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef72d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
