x_comment(x_CodingFunctionTypeByPurityOfFunction,"A faceting collection that partitions #$CodingFunction.  There are two collection instances: #$PurelyFunctionalCodingFunction and #$ImpureCodingFunction.  The former is the collection of all #$CodingFunctions which carry out mathematical operations without otherwise perturbing the machine state:  the latter is the collection of all #$CodingFunctions whose execution results in discernable 'side effects' in the machine state that have to be taken account of in subsequent operations.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef751).
