x_comment('x_objHasSlotValueTimePointSetForPreviousDurationFromDateAtParameterizedPart-SecondOffsets',"(#$objHasSlotValueTimePointSetForPreviousDurationFromDateAtParameterizedPart-SecondOffsets OBJ DATE DURATION SLOT QUANT PART-SLOT PART-QUANT SET) means SET is a set of points defined as tuples of QUANT and a quantity of seconds,  where the quantity of seconds is duration in seconds before or after DATE, and QUANT is the value SLOT such that there exists a part PART of OBJ such that at the date specified by the corresponding quantity of seconds (SLOT PART QUANT) where PART is the part of OBJ such such that (PART-SLOT PART PART-QUANT) is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef76d).
