x_comment(x_atLeastNthSubSitTypeOfTypeInSitType,"(#$atLeastNthSubSitTypeOfTypeInSitType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE FRAMING-TYPE N) means that any instance SIT of SIT-TYPE will properly subsume an instance SUBSIT of SUBSIT-TYPE such that 1) SUBSIT is also an instance of FRAMING-TYPE; 2) there is no instance of FRAMING-TYPE that properly subsumes SUBSIT and that SIT in turn properly subsumes; and 3) there are at least N-1 other instances OTR-INST of FRAMING-TYPE such that i) SIT properly subsumes OTR-INST; ii) there is no other instance of FRAMING-TYPE that properly subsumes OTR-INST and that SIT properly subsumes; and iii) SUBSIT starts after the ending of OTR-INST.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef78d).
