x_comment(x_unitAbsoluteScaleOffset,"A ternary #$MetaFunction predicate that relates two interconvertible #$UnitOfMeasures (q.v.) to the real number by which the units are offset when the measurements are absolute (not relative to some other value.)  <code>(#$unitAbsoluteScaleOffset UNIT1 UNIT2 N)</code> and a corresponding <code>(#$unitMultiplicationFactor UNIT1 UNIT2 M)</code> means that when converting from <code>UNIT1</code> to <code>UNIT2</code>, after multiplying the <code>UNIT1</code> value by <code>M</code> we add <code>N</code>.  This is primarily useful for temperature conversions.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef7b4).
