x_comment(x_biologicallyResponsibleFor,"A specialization of #$biologicalFunction, <code>(#$biologicallyResponsibleFor BLO-TYPE EVENT-TYPE ROLE)</code> means that not only is it a #$biologicalFunction of objects of type ?BLO-TYPE to play the role <code>ROLE</code> in events of type <code>EVENT-TYPE</code>, <i>only</i> objects of type <code>BLO-TYPE</code> can play this role. So while small esophagus, small intestine, and stomach all have as biological functions the moving of food through the digestive tract, only the heart has the biological function of, and thus is responsible for, pumping blood.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef8a3).
