x_comment('x_codeStatementDependsOnStatement-AllExecutions',"(#$codeStatementDependsOnStatement-AllExecutions DEPENDENT DEPENDED-ON) means that, in any possible execution of a program containing both DEPENDENT and DEPENDED-ON, DEPENDENT will not be executed unless DEPENDED-ON is executed.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef93e).
