x_comment('x_codeStatementDependsOnStatement-SomeExecutions',"(#$codeStatementDependsOnStatement-SomeExecutions DEPENDENT DEPENDED-ON) means that in some executions (at least one execution) of the program which subsumes both DEPENDENT and DEPENDED-ON, DEPENDENT cannot be executed without executing DEPENDED-ON as part of the same execution.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef93f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef93f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
