x_comment(x_codeStatementCandidateDependency,"(#$codeStatementCandidateDependency CAND-DEPENDENT CAND-DEPENDED-ON) means that, within the substructure of a certain #$ComputerProgram-CWIS, it is possible to identify a linear of #$ComputerCodeStatements between CAND-DEPENDENT and CAND-DEPENDED-ON (possibly consisting of just CAND-DEPENDENT and CAND-DEPENDED-ON, but possibly not) such that #$codeStatementDependsOnStatement-SomeExecutions holds between any two immediate successors within the order.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef940).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef940,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
