x_comment('x_Election-SingleIssue',"An instance of #$TemporalObjectType and a specialization of #$Election.  Each instance of #$Election-SingleIssue is an event in which members of an #$Organization cast votes to determine the answer to one issue.  Important specializations include #$ElectionForOffice, where voters are asked what individual should serve in a particular office or what political party should get seats on a governing body, and #$Referendum, in which the voters are asked to accept or reject a single proposal.  #$Election-SingleIssue is contrasted with #$Election-MultipleIssue, instances of which consist of several, #$cotemporal instances of #$Election-SingleIssue.  ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef967).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef967,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
