x_comment(x_ephemeralTermDescriptionCollection,"A predicate for autolexifying ephemeral terms. If (#$ephemeralTermDescriptionCollection TYPE LEXICAL-MT) is asserted in the query mt for an inference, then ephemeral terms denoting instances of TYPE hypothesized for that inference will receive lexifications of the form 'the TYPE' in LEXICAL-MT.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef96c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef96c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
