x_comment(x_electionCandidates,"A #$BinaryRolePredicate used to identify the contestants in an #$Election.  (#$electionCandidates ELECTION CANDIDATE) means that CANDIDATE is (in the 'timeless' sense of 'is' one of the declared candidates running in ELECTION. Note that the candidates in an election can be individual people, but they instead might be instances of #$PoliticalParty.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef970).
