x_comment(x_CampaignOrganization,"A sub-collection of #$PoliticalOrganization. Each instance is a team of people who work to maximize the success of one #$PoliticalElectionCampaign.  The goal of each such organization is to convince voters to vote for the candidate of the campaign (see #$politicalCampaignOf).") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef974).
