x_comment(x_campaignHasOrganization,"<code>(#$campaignHasOrganization CAMPAIGN ORGANIZATION)</code> means that <code>CAMPAIGN</code>, an instance of #$PoliticalElectionCampaign, is directed by the instance of #$CampaignOrganization, <code>ORGANIZATION</code>. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef975).
