x_comment(x_setHasPointsWithAveragedYValuesOfSetsOfPoints,"<code>(#$setHasPointsWithAveragedYValuesOfSetsOfPoints SET-OF-SETS-OF-POINTS SET-OF-POINTS)</code> means that <code>SET-OF-POINTS</code> is the set of points whose X values match all of the X values of the points in each of the sets in <code>SET-OF-SETS-OF-POINTS</code>, and whose Y values are the average of the Y values of the points in each of the sets in <code>SET-OF-SETS-OF-POINTS</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef978).
