x_comment(x_getTraceTimeStampByFiberID,"<code>(#$getTraceTimeStampByFiberID FIBER START-DATE END-DATE N DATE)</code> means that the DTS fiber <code>FIBER</code> produced a trace at <code>DATE</code>, which is a date between <code>START-DATE</code> and <code>END-DATE</code>.  If <code>N</code> = 0, <code>DATE</code> is the earliest date of a DTS using <code>FIBER</code> in that date range,  and if <code>N</code> = 1, <code>DATE</code> is the latest date of a DTS using <code>FIBER</code> in that date range.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef980).
