x_comment(x_IntroducingABill,"A specialization of #$LegalProceeding.  Each instance of #$IntroducingABill is an event in which one or more members of a #$LegislativeOrganization introduces a bill for consideration as a potential law by the members of that organization.  The person or persons who introduce the bill are the sponsors or cosponsors of the bill.  In many legislative bodies, this is the first step of the process of #$Legislating.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef988).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef988,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
