x_comment(x_Legislating,"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$LegalProceeding and #$GroupActivity.  Each instance of #$Legislating is an event in which #$Legislators introduce legislation (see #$IntroducingABill), deliberate (see #$LegislativeDeliberation), and decide the fate of proposed legislation (see #$AcceptingOrRejectingProposedBill and its specializations.).  Depending on the procedures followed by the particular legislative body performing a #$Legislating, other events might be included, but these three steps are the most fundamental steps followed in all cases.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef989).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef989,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
