x_comment(x_AcceptingOrRejectingProposedBill,"A specialization of #$LegislativeActivity.  Each instance of #$AcceptingOrRejectingProposedBill is an event in which the members of a #$LegislativeOrganization collectively decide the fate of a proposed bill.  Successful bills are passed into law (see #$PassingALaw), while unsuccessful ones can be rejected outright (see #$RejectingProposedBill) or allowed to die without coming to a vote.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef992).
