x_comment('x_Deciding-Collectively-AmongChoices',"A specialization of #$Deciding-Collectively and of #$SelectingSomething.  Each instance of #$Deciding-Collectively-AmongChoices is an event in which a group of agents selects one choice from a set of options, either informally (as when a group of friends decides where to eat lunch together) or formally (as when an #$ElectionForOffice is held to choose who will serve in some elected position.)  This collection is contrasted with #$Deciding-Collectively-YesOrNo, in which a group of agents accept or reject a proposal.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef99a).
