x_comment('x_Deciding-Collectively-YesOrNo',"A specialization of #$Deciding-Collectively.  Each instance of #$Deciding-Collectively-YesOrNo is an event in which a group of agents accepts or rejects a particular proposal.  This collection includes instances in which the decision-making is informal, such as when a pair of friends decides whether or not to enter a bridge tournament, and instances involving formal yes or no decision making, such as a #$Referendum or an instance of #$AcceptingOrRejectingProposedBill done in a legislature. This collection is contrasted with #$Deciding-Collectively-AmongChoices, in which a group of agents selects one choice from a set of options.") :- x_cid(a65b16505ef99b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505ef99b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
