x_comment(x_TimeMonitoringRAPStatement,"The collection of all 'MONITOR-TIME' clauses that appear in instances of #$ReactiveActionPackageSpecification-CWIS.  Such clauses cause the RAP to suspend for a specified period of time, which may be given either in absolues terms (see #$referenceDelayDeadlineAbsolute-RAP) or relative terms (see #$referenceDelayDeadlineRelative-RAP).") :- x_cid(a65b16505efa2e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efa2e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
