x_comment('x_referenceDelayDeadlineRelative-RAP',"(#$referenceDelayDeadlineRelative-RAP MONITOR-TIME WAIT-DUR DUR-UNTIL-SUSPEND) means that the #$TimeMonitoringRAPStatement MONITOR-TIME says that the task specified by the #$ReactiveActionPackageSpecification-CWIS in which MONITOR-TIME appears must suspend when the #$Time-Quantity DUR-UNTIL-SUSPEND has elapsed, and must at that point wait for a duration of WAIT-DUR until resuming.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efa2f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efa2f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
