x_comment(x_FailureCriterionForRAPStatement,"Instances of #$FailureCriterionForRAPStatement are used in circumstances where a programmer wants to specify conditions under which execution of a #$ReactiveActionPackageSpecification-CWIS will fail.  A  #$FailureCriterionForRAPStatement states that executions of the #$ReactiveActionPackageSpecification-CWIS of which it is a part will fail if the condition that the  #$FailureCriterionForRAPStatement (#$failureCriterion-RAP) specifies becomes true.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efa37).
