x_comment(x_PreconditionCriterionForRAPStatement,"The collection of all #$RAPConditionSpecificationStatements that state preconditions for executing RAPS.  More specifically, each instance of #$PreconditionCriterionForRAPStatement is a clause which states that the #$ReactiveActionPackageSpecification-CWIS of which it is a component should not be executed unless a specified condition (see #$precondition-RAP) is met.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efa39).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efa39,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
