x_comment(x_relationPercentExists,"A quaternary #$RuleMacroPredicate that can be used to state that some percentage of a collection's instances stand in a particular binary relationship to some instance of another class.  <code>(#$relationPercentExists BINPRED COL1 COL2 PERCENT)</code> states that, for <code>PERCENT</code> of the instances <code>INS1</code>of <code>COL1</code>, there exists some instance <code>INS2</code> of <code>COL2</code> such that <code>(BINPRED INS1 INS2)</code>.  For example, <code>(#$relationPercentExists #$owns #$HumanAdult #$Automobile 0.05)</code> means that five percent of #$HumanAdults own a car.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efa46).
