x_comment(x_mrHoldsAt,"An instance of both #$TemporalPredicate and #$ModalPredicate that is used to state that a given sentence is true at some #$TimePoint.  <code>(#$mrHoldsAt SENT TIME-POINT)</code> means that <code>SENT</code> is true at <code>TIME-POINT</code>. This predicate is a mirror of the #$owl:ObjectProperty, holdsAt, in the #$MR2011Ontology.  Although the intent of this predicate is to have instances of #$TimePoint as arg2, the digested document content we will need to import may have other sorts of things in that argument position, so the second argument is left lightly constrained.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efb0a).
