x_comment(x_mrMinimallyOccursWithin,"An instance of #$TemporalPredicate that is used to give the smallest #$TimeInterval within which (see #$mrOccursWithin) an event occurs. <code>(#$mrMinimallyOccursWithin EVENT INTERVAL)</code> means that <code>EVENT</code> occurs within (see #$mrOccursWithin) <code>INTERVAL</code>, but does not occur within any time interval properly contained by <code>INTERVAL</code>. This predicate is a mirror of the #$owl:ObjectProperty, minimallyOccursWithin, in the #$MR2011Ontology.  Although the intent of this predicate is to have instances of #$TimeInterval as arg2, the digested document content we will need to import may have other sorts of things in that argument position, so the second argument is left lightly constrained.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efb14).
