x_comment(x_mrMaximallyOccursOver,"An instance of #$TemporalPredicate that is used to state that a given event occurs over the course of some #$TimeInterval, but not over any larger containing interval.  <code>(#$mrMaximallyOccursOver EVENT INTERVAL)</code> means that <code>EVENT</code> occurs over (see #$mrOccursOver) <code>INTERVAL</code>, and there is no other interval over which <code>EVENT</code> occurs and which properly contains <code>INTERVAL</code>. This predicate is a mirror of the #$owl:ObjectProperty, maximallyOccursOver, in the #$MR2011Ontology.  Although the intent of this predicate is to have instances of #$TimeInterval as arg2, the digested document content we will need to import may have other sorts of things in that argument position, so the second argument is left lightly constrained.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efb15).
