x_comment(x_mrHoldsSometime,"An instance of #$TemporalPredicate that holds between a given sentence and a #$TimeInterval when the sentence is true throughout or at sometime during the time interval.  This is a very general predicate and does not mirror any instances of #$owl:ObjectProperty from the #$MR2011Ontology, but is intended to provide a way to ask Cyc ''Can we find bindings for the variables in this sentence, and some time interval with respect to which the sentence has some truth status?''.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efb16).
