x_comment(x_mrNAryDefinitionMt,"The Erudite machine reading ontology, #$MR2011Ontology, introduces a layer of representation in which logical statements are reified (see #$MRGeneralizedStatement) so that non-binary relationships (such as a ternary relationship between an organization, a person, and their role in the organization, or a temporal qualification on a binary statement) can be stated only with binary relationships.  This predicate states the microtheory in which conclusions defining terms that are part of this ''binarized'' layer are to be stored.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efb3f).
