x_comment(x_inflowLengthsWithStartingDepths,"(#$inflowLengthsWithStartingDepths WELL DEPTH-TEMP-POINTS-IN-LINER DEPTH-LENGTH-PAIRS) means that the #$Well WELL has liner inflow sections described by the list of lists, DEPTH-LENGTH-PAIRS, as evinced by the depth/temperature pairs in DEPTH-TEMP-POINTS-IN-LINER (the set of depth/temperature points from the liner of WELL from a single DTS trace taken during a shut-in).  DEPTH-LENGTH-PAIRS is a list of lists; it's sub-lists are pairs of distances D1 and D2.  Each D1 indicates the start of a liner inflow section and each D2 indicates the length of the liner inflow section started at D1.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efb52).
