x_comment(x_Evolution,"Every instance of #$Evolution is a #$BiologicalProcess and an #$IntrinsicStateChangeEvent in which there is change across successive generations in the genetic material of individuals belonging to a group capable of interbreeding (a population within a #$BiologicalSpecies), resulting in changes in the inherited characteristics displayed by those individuals.  Although change from one generation to the next can be small, taken together over time these changes add to genetic diversity and can result in new forms of life arising.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efbd1).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efbd1,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
