x_comment('x_DistributionOfGeneticMaterial-CellularProcess',"A cellular process common to various forms of cell division, including #$BinaryFission, #$Mitosis and #$Meiosis, in which chromosomal structures within a dividing cell are separated and  move to opposite \"poles\" of the cell, where they will wind up being the total chromosomal content of the cells that result from the impending division.  ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efbe5).
