x_comment(x_numberOfMainSpecifiedComponentTypeInSystemType,"(#$numberOfMainSpecifiedComponentTypeInSystemType TYPE1 TYPE2 NUM)</code> means that there is a specification relevant in the context of assertion in which it was specified that there are NUM instances of TYPE2 as main functional components in instances of TYPE1.  This relationship does not hold of unspecified components (even if they play large functional roles in instances of TYPE1).  For example, an assertion about a certain type of server farm may specify that there are 6 computer servers of a certain sort as specified components, but it would not follow that there are thereby 6 motherboards as specified components even though each computer server has a motherboard as a main functional component.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efc4c).
