x_comment(x_prescriptionForPatient,"Identifies the animal that a prescription is for.  <code>(#$prescriptionForPatient SCRIP ANIMAL)</code> states that <code>SCRIP</code> is a doctor's prescription which authorizes (and recommends) that the drug or medical device identified in <code>SCRIP</code> (see #$prescribedType) be purchased for the named patient, <code>ANIMAL</code>, and that it be be used by that patient in the manner specified.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efce0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efce0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
