x_comment(x_prescribedType,"Identifies the drug or medical device that a prescription is for.  <code>(#$prescribedType SCRIP TYPE)</code> states that <code>SCRIP</code> is a doctor's prescription which authorizes (and recommends) that the drug or medical device, <code>TYPE</code>, be purchased for the patient named in the prescription (see #$prescriptionForPatient), and that it be be used by that patient in the manner specified.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efce2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efce2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
