x_comment(x_prescriptionDescribesDrugTreatmentType,"The predicate #$prescriptionDescribesDrugTreatmentType is used to associate instances of #$DrugPrescription-Specification with a specialization of DrugTreatment which are their focal content.  <code>(#$prescriptionDescribesDrugTreatmentType SPEC TYPE)</code> means that the content of #$DrugPrescription-Specification <code>SPEC</code> is directed at the occurrence of an instance of <code>TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efcec).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efcec,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
