x_comment(x_IontophoreticTransdermalAdministration,"The collection of events in which a drug is administered by using a small electric charge to drive its molecules through the skin and into the bloodstream. A device including a chamber containing the drug and a solvent is placed against the skin.  If the drug molecules are positively charged, a positive charge will force it across the skin.  If they are negatively charged, a negative charge is used in that chamber. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd08).
