x_comment('x_TransportationDevice-RemotelyControlled',"The collection of #$TransportationDevices that operate under the control of a driver (see #$driverActor) who is not in or on the device.  Examples include drone aircraft operated by remote control and remotely controlled vehicles that perform dangerous tasks or visit dangerous places (e.g., deep water explorers).  Note that not every instance of #$TransportationDevice-RemotelyControlled is also an instance of #$TransportationDevice-Unmanned, as there exist passenger vehicles that can be controlled remotely - for example, some trains that carry people between buildings at airports.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd0e).
