x_comment('x_PeriodicEventSeries-HumanScale',"The collection of instances of #$PeriodicEventSeries that are discernible by humans under ordinary circumstances.  Positive examples include the rhythmic tapping of a pencil on a desk and the rising and setting of the sun each day.  Negative examples include the periodic passing of haley's comet through our region of space and the sequence of base-matching steps that go into replicating DNA.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd18).
