x_comment(x_TankerTruck,"The collection of all tanker trucks. A type of #$Truck and #$MaterialTransporter designed to carry relatively large quantities (thousands of gallons) of some liquid, such as water, milk, or petroleum products. #$TankerTruck is a #$RoadVehicleTypeByBodyStyle, a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType, a #$VehicleTypeByIntendedUse, and a #$RoadVehicleTypeByUse.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd19).
