x_comment(x_MusicTypeByArtist,"A collection that facets #$Music into sub-collections based on the artist.  \"based on the artist\" is defined broadly here, so as to include: a) performers of the music (including live performances as well as music played from a recording of a performance), so that the music generated from a recording of Jimi Hendrix playing \"All Along the Watchtower\" counts as the music of Jimi Hendrix in the relevant sense; b) authors of the work that the music instantiates, so that the same music in the example above would also count as the music of Bob Dylan; and, in some contexts, c) the music closely associated with an artist, so that, for example, a Jimi Hendrix tribute band's performance of \"All Along the Watchtower\" counts, not only as Bob Dylan's music (due to the criterion in b)), but as Jimi Hendrix music, due to his having made the song into a hit.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd1a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd1a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
