x_comment(x_prescriptionTakeAsNeededForSymptomType,"(#$prescriptionTakeAsNeededForSymptomType SCRIP SYMPTOM-TYPE) states that the #$DrugPrescription-Specification, SCRIP, instructs the patient to take a dose of the specified drug when the patient is troubled by instances of SYMPTOM-TYPE. The effect of this instruction is to remove the necessity that the patient take each dose on schedule, up to and including finishing all doses, in order for their treatment to conform to the prescription.  This instruction is usually accompanied by a dosage limit (#$prescriptionDosageRateNotToExceed).") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd26).
