x_comment(x_PharmaceuticalSalesItem,"Instances of #$PharmaceuticalSalesItem are objects that can be available for sale at a #$Pharmacy or by a #$MedicalCareInstitution, and contain one or more doses of a #$DrugSubstance.  These include bottles of #$Pills, packages of #$TransdermalPatches, single-dose ampules of some #$InjectableLiquid-Medical, etc.  Note that this collection is not a spec of #$DrugSubstance.   Also note that, while a significant portion of an instance might be some naturally-occuring substance that can't be considered to be an artifact, the instance itself, by virtue of being created (assembled, packaged) by an agent, is an instance of #$Artifact-Generic.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd28).
