xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505efd3d,[]).
x_comment(x_HandTool,"A specialization of both #$Tool and #$PortableObject.  Each instance of #$HandTool is a portable tool which is hand-held, hand-supported and hand-guided throughout its operation.  Typically the work piece (the object being acted on when the tool is used) remains stationary.  Members of this collection can be contrasted with #$StationaryTools, which remain in a fixed location while the work piece is moved (although in some cases the tool has moving parts that are operated by hand, e.g. a #$Chopsaw.  Specializations of #$HandTool include the collections #$Screwdriver, #$ManualDrill, and #$BlowDryer.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd3e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd3e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
