x_comment(x_essentialPartTypes,"<code>(#$essentialPartTypes WHOLE-TYPE PART-TYPE)</code> means that <code>PART-TYPE</code> is an essential type of part for every instance of <code>WHOLE-TYPE</code> -- i.e., there can be no instance of <code>WHOLE-TYPE</code> such that it lacks an instance of <code>PART-TYPE</code> as a part; accordingly, an event that removes all instances of <code>PART-TYPE</code> from an instance of <code>WHOLE-TYPE</code> would destroy that instance.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd43).
