x_comment(x_essentialParts,"A specialization (see #$genlPreds) of #$parts, #$essentialParts relates an object to those parts of it that are essential to its existence.  Specifically, the removal of an essential part will be or cause an instance of #$DestructionEvent in which the original object plays the role of #$inputsDestroyed.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd45).
