x_comment(x_characteristicEssentialProperSubEventTypes,"<code>(#$characteristicEssentialProperSubEventTypes EVT-TYPE SUB-EVT-TYPE)</code> means that events of type <code>EVT-TYPE</code> are characterized by and require the occurrence of proper sub-events of type <code>SUB-EVT-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd47).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd47,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
