x_comment(x_Woodworking,"A specialization of #$CraftActivity and an instance of #$SkilledActivityType.  Instances are activities in which portions of #$Wood are shaped, or assembled, or otherwise manipulated in the course of making some #$Artifact.  Instances of #$Woodworking need not have an output which is a completed artifact.  For the collection of events which have wooden artifacts as their intended output, see (#$ProjectTypeFn #$Woodworking).") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd4d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd4d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
