x_comment(x_SawingSomething,"An instance of #$LearnedActivityType and a specialization of #$ShapingSomething.  Each instance of #$SawingSomething is an event in which an agent cuts at least partially through some hard object by making a more-or-less continuous series of small cuts.  The #$CuttingDevice used in an instance of #$SawingSomething is often a saw (e.g. a #$HandSaw or #$PowerSaw), but it need not be; for example, one might saw through a tree branch with a #$Knife. Often the material being cut is #$Wood, but other materials can be cut this way, e.g., #$Plastic.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd52).
