x_comment(x_JointingSomething,"An instance of #$LearnedActivityType and a specialization of #$ShapingSomething.  Often, the #$objectActedOn is an instance of #$Board-PieceOfWood.  Each instance of #$JointingSomething is an event in which an agent smooths a narrow edge or a face of a (probably #$Beam shaped) piece of material, making it into a flat plane.   In #$Woodworking, for example, #$JointingSomething is performed in the course of turning a rough piece of lumber into a board that more closely approaches the shape of a #$RectangularParallelepiped.  A tool commonly used to perform #$JointingSomething is a #$Jointer.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd58).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd58,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505efd58,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
