x_comment(x_ThreeDimensionalShapeType,"A collection of collections and a specialization of #$GeometricShapeType (q.v.).  Each instance of #$ThreeDimensionalShapeType is a specialization of #$ThreeDimensionalGeometricThing (q.v.) all of whose own instances have something in common as regards their shape.  Instances include the collections #$Cylinder and #$Cube.  Cf. #$TwoDimensionalShapeType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd59).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd59,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
