x_comment(x_artifactTypeMadeMainlyOfType,"<code>(#$artifactTypeMadeMainlyOfType ARTIFACT-TYPE STUFF-TYPE ARTIFACT-SUBTYPE)</code> means that <code>ARTIFACT-SUBTYPE</code> is the collection of all instances <code>INSTANCE</code> of <code>ARTIFACT-TYPE</code> which are composed chiefly (see #$mainConstituents) of some portion of <code>STUFF-TYPE</code>. See the function that corresponds to this predicate, #$ArtifactTypeMadeMainlyOfTypeFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd76).
