x_comment(x_Jointer,"The collection of all jointers, also called edge jointers. A type of #$Tool-PowerTool and #$WoodworkingTool.  #$Jointers have a rotating cutter head and flat infeed and outfeed surfaces, and are designed so that when a piece of #$Wood is moved from the infeed surface over the cutting head to the outfeed surface, material is removed causing the affected face of the piece to become more like a flat plane with each pass through the tool.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd79).
