x_comment(x_PlaningABoard,"An instance of #$SkilledActivityType and a specialization of #$Woodworking.  Each instance of #$PlaningABoard is an event in which an agent flattens one surface of a board.  This can be accomplished by running a #$Board-PieceOfWood through a #$ThicknessPlaner.  This will make the affected surface equidistant to its opposite surface at all points affected by the cutting knives of the planer.  If the opposite surface was a truly planar surface, the two surfaces will be parallel after this operation if the entire extent of the affected face was cut.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd7a).
