x_comment(x_BeltSander,"Instances of #$BeltSander are power tools which may be stationary or hand-held, and which have an abrasive belt which moves on two or more powered rollers.  Either the workpiece is brought against this abrasive belt, or the tool is moved across the surface of the workpiece, to remove material and smooth the surface.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd83).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd83,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
