x_comment(x_MakingSomething,"A collection of creation events -- a specialization of both #$CreatingAnArtifact and #$PhysicalCreationEvent (qq.v.).  Each instance of this collection involves some #$PartiallyTangible thing being made (by some #$Agent-PartiallyTangible) from raw materials or from parts. The end result (see #$productsCreated) might or might not be a #$Product or even a completed artifact (it could be an intermediate form, or a component of a completed artifact). Examples include baking a loaf of bread, assembling a high-fidelity audio component and fabricating a part for a chair. See also the more specialized #$Constructing.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd91).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efd91,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505efd91,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
