x_comment(x_workpieceIn,"<code>(#$workpieceIn ACTION OBJECT)</code> means that the physical object <code>OBJECT</code> is an intended input to <code>ACTION</code> (an instance of #$CraftActivity or #$ShapingSomething), and is the input that is transformed or destroyed to produce the intended result, the #$workpieceOut.  The matter that makes up the intended result of <code>ACTION</code> was part of <code>OBJECT</code> before <code>ACTION</code> occured.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efd94).
