x_comment(x_Screwdriver,"A hand tool used for driving screws and bolts, for UNscrewing, or for prying.  Comprised of a handle, a long shank, and a head specifically shaped to fit into cavities on the heads of screws and bolts so that rotary force may be transferred.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdac).
