x_comment(x_RotaryDrivingImplement,"A specialization of #$HandTool.  Instances of RotaryDrivingImplement are used to apply rotational force to fasteners like screws or to nuts on bolts.  This collection includes user-powered devices such as #$Screwdrivers and #$Wrenches, as well as electrically- or air-powered tools like impact drivers.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdae).
