x_comment(x_TurningWorkpieceOnLathe,"A specialization of #$ApplyingATorque.  In each instance of #$TurningWorkpieceOnLathe, a piece of material (often #$Wood or #$Metal) is rotated while attached to one or both centers of a #$Lathe.  Such events are a necessary subevent of using a lathe for shaping the material.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdaf).
