x_comment(x_CuttingOffPiecesToShapeSomething,"Instances of this class are events in which small pieces of a rigid whole are repeatedly cut off.  The resulting workpiece (see #$workpieceOut) is thus smaller than the #$workpieceIn.  In such events, the whole is not completely chopped up.  The smaller, shaped object is the intended goal of the performer, and the pieces cut off are #$scrap.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdb0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efdb0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
