x_comment(x_RemovingWoodWithWoodturningTool,"Instances of this class are events in which an agent uses a #$WoodturningTool to repeatedly remove small pieces of #$Wood from a wooden workpiece, as it rotates on a lathe.  Such events are an essential subevent of #$Woodturning. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdb1).
