x_comment(x_holdsInHand,"<code>(#$holdsInHand AGENT OBJ)</code> states that the #$EmbodiedAgent, <code>AGENT</code>, and the #$PartiallyTangible, <code>OBJ</code>, are in physical contact and that furthermore force is applied by <code>AGENT</code> to restrain the motion of <code>OBJ</code>.  Additionaly, the part of <code>AGENT</code> in contact with <code>OBJ</code> is one or more of <code>AGENT</code>'s parts which is a #$HolderGripper - e.g., the #$Hand of a #$HomoSapiens or the #$Pincer of some insect.  This relation is agnostic as to which of potentially several appendages is applying the force, and what sort of motion is prevented. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdb2).
