x_comment('x_Lining-Cloth',"The collection of all cloth that is either a) intended to be used as lining, or b) is serving as lining.  Lining is used to cover the inside surface of textile products, such as garments.  Although often a lining piece is created from fabric intended to be used for that purpose, it is possible to use almost any fabric or even non-fabrics sheets of material like leather or plastic as linings.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdd9).
