x_comment(x_SewingActivity,"Instances of #$SewingActivity are events which are associated with a sewing project.  This includes actually making stiches (see #$Sewing) as well as other events such as cutting out the parts of a garment (#$CuttingOutASewingPatternPiece), transferring pattern markings to the cut pieces (#$MarkingSewingProjectPiece), etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdfa).
