x_comment(x_CuttingOutASewingPattern,"Instances of this collection are events in which all the pieces of cloth or leather required for a sewing project are cut out.  The number of pieces so created is determined by the number of #$SewingPatternPieces in the #$SewingPattern used, and the number of each individual piece that is needed. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdfb).
