x_comment(x_CuttingOutA2DPiece,"Instances of this class are events in which a piece in the desired shape and size is cut free of a sheet of material (the #$workpieceIn), by cutting around its perimeter with a suitable tool, such as scissors, a sharp knife or a laser cutter, or by cutting the desired shape in one operation with a blanking punch and die. The #$objectRemoved is the resulting workpiece (see #$workpieceOut), and the remaining material is #$scrap   In such events, the whole is not completely chopped up.  The #$scrap that remains often will become the #$workpieceIn for another instance of #$CuttingOutA2DPiece.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efdfc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efdfc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
