x_comment(x_MarkingSewingProjectPiece,"A collection of events.  #$MarkingSewingProjectPiece is a specialization of #$MarkingOnASurface, instances of which involve an agent making or placing marks on an instance of #$ClothingItemPart-SingleSheet as directed by the #$SewingPatternPiece from which it was cut.  Such markings show darts, fold lines, locations that must line up when two pieces are sewn together, locations where stitching must start or stop, and other features that should be heeded when the project is assembled. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efe00).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efe00,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
