x_comment('x_Dart-SewnConnection',"A specialization of #$Seam-SewnConnection.  Each instance of #$Dart-SewnConnection is a seam which joins one piece of #$Foldable material to itself in such a way that it no longer lays flat, but can assume the shape of a #$ConicalSurface-WithoutBase.  Darts are created in instances of #$ClothingItemPart-SingleSheet to make the piece of material follow the shape of the body on which it will be worn.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efe02).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efe02,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
