x_comment('x_MakingASeam-Sewing',"Instances of this collection are events in which flexible sheet material (usually #$Cloth or #$Leather) is correctly positioned, held in place if necessary by pinning, and then stitched.  Seams are made that hold two or more pieces together, that hem a raw fabric edge, that create a #$Dart-SewnConnection, that merely mark a location on the affected material, and for a variety of other functions. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efe03).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505efe03,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
