x_comment(x_AreaFrequencyOfObjects,"A #$TotallyOrderedQuantityType (q.v.) and a specialization of #$RatioQuantity (q.v.).  Quantities that are instances of #$AreaFrequencyOfObjects apply to (see #$quantityRange) #$SpatialThings, and measure the number of some type of object per some (specified or unspecified) unit of area (e.g. #$SquareMile).<p>One sample specialization of #$AreaFrequencyOfObjects is the collection, #$DensityOfPopulation. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efe38).
