x_comment('x_StackBasedMemory-Entire',"A given instance of #$StackBasedMemory-Entire is an #$AbstractIndividual that is best thought of as a reified functional role within a computational architecture.  At any given time in processing operations, a #$StackBasedMemory-Entire is associated with a list of positive integers that serve as memory addresses. The identity of this list changes over time in predictable ways based on the operations executed on the #$Computer whose stack-based memory it is.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efe3a).
