x_comment(x_gravitationalPotentialEnergyOfObject,"A #$FunctionalSlot and specialization of #$hasPhysicalQuantity that relates a #$PartiallyTangible to an #$EnergyQuantity.  <code>(#$gravitationalPotentialEnergyOfObject OBJ QUANT)</code> means that the total quantity of potential energy had by <code>OBJ</code> by virtue of its relative position inside a gravitational field is <code>QUANT</code>.  If <code>OBJ</code> is allowed to fall, some of this potential energy is converted into kinetic energy and its resulting gravitational potential energy will be less.  In general, assertions made with this predicate should be temporally qualified.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efe88).
