x_comment(x_MetabolicPathway,"This is the collection of metabolic pathways. A metabolic pathway is a series of chemical reactions that take place in a biological living object, to break down molecules to generate energy (see #$CatabolicPathway) or to use energy to generate complex molecules (see #$AnabolicPathway).  The complete set of metabolic pathways in a biological living object is its #$Metabolism.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efeaf).
