x_comment(x_gibbsFreeEnergyOfSystem,"A #$FunctionalSlot and specialization of #$hasPhysicalQuantity that relates a #$PartiallyTangible to an #$EnergyQuantity.  <code>(#$gibbsFreeEnergyOfSystem OBJ QUANT)</code> means that <code>QUANT</code> is amount of energy had by <code>OBJ</code>, a thermodynamic system at constant pressure and temperature, that is available to do work.  A change in the Gibbs free energy of a system is equivalent to its change in enthalpy (see #$enthalpyOfSystem) minus the product of its absolute temperature and its change in entropy (see #$entropyOfSystem). ") :- x_cid(a65b16505efeb2).
