x_comment(x_FluidAbsorptionEvent,"A specialization of #$AbsorptionEvent.  Instances are events in which some quantity of fluid enters some #$PartiallyTangible thing.   For example, events in which gaseous #$Oxygen is absorbed into an animla's bloodstream, and events in which a #$Sponge-CleaningImplement absorbs (#$LiquidFn #$Water).") :- x_cid(a65b16505efefe).
