x_comment(x_AbsorptionEvent,"A specialization of #$TransferIn. Instances are events in which things are taken into some #$PartiallyTangible thing.  The thing taken in may be another #$PartiallyTangible, such as a liquid or gas, or a non-tangible thing such as a quantity of energy.") :- x_cid(a65b16505efeff).
