x_comment(x_ChemicalObjectTypeBySharedStructuralFeature,"A type-level collection. Each instance is a collection of #$ChemicalObjects characterized by the fact that all of its instances are molecules that share some structural feature.  Collections such that all instances have the same chemical formula and structure are one special case, and they will be instances of #$ChemicalObjectTypeByChemicalSpecies, a spec of #$ChemicalObjectTypeBySharedStructuralFeature.  Other instance of this class include #$PorphyrinMolecule, all instance of which have a #$PorphyrinRing, and (#$MoleculeFn #$Aldehyde), all instances of which contain a #$FormylGroup.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eff10).
