x_comment(x_indirectInstanceForQuantityBasedFormula,"<code>(#$indirectInstanceForQuantityBasedFormula QBF INSTANCE)</code> means that <code>INSTANCE</code> is a term that, while not being mentioned in the formula <code>QBF</code>, is an import part of its context.  Specifically, for <code>QBF</code> to hold of a set of quantities in the world, those quantities must bear some relation to <code>INSTANCE</code>.  If these constraints are binary, they can be stated with the predicates #$formulaTermRelationFromIndirectInstance and #$formulaTermRelationToIndirectInstance.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eff3e).
