x_comment(x_ElectromagneticRadiationFilteringProcess,"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$Filtering-Generic.  Each instance of #$ElectromagneticRadiationFilteringProcess is an event in which #$ElectromagneticRadiation passes through a #$PartiallyTangible.  Radiation that exits on the other side will typically have a different #$IrradianceDistribution than the entering radiation, because some #$wavelengths have been absorbed (see #$ElectromagneticRadiationAbsorption) by the filter.  This collection includes both intentional filtering, as might be done to produce particular colors of light to illuminate actors on stage, or to project an image on a screen, as well as filtering that happens as a result of natural processes such as the filtering of #$Sunlight by #$TheEarthsAtmosphere.") :- x_cid(a65b16505eff8d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505eff8d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
