x_comment(x_quantumEnergyLevel,"<code>(#$quantumEnergyLevel OBJ ENERGY)</code> states that the quantum mechanical particle or system <code>OBJ</code> has the energy value, <code>ENERGY</code>.  In practice it may usually be impossible to measure this value, and where it can be predicted, <code>OBJ</code> will never assume a particular value of <code>ENERGY</code> for a significant duration (more than a fraction of a second unless it's at a ground state or metastable state.  A given particle or system can only assume certain values for <code>ENERGY</code>; thus these levels are said to be quantized.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effa1).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505effa1,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
