x_comment('x_ThylakoidMembrane-Eukaryotic',"A specialization of #$Membrane-Biological.  Instances of #$ThylakoidMembrane-Eukaryotic partition the interior space of #$Chloroplasts into the #$ChloroplastStroma and the #$ThylakoidSpace. The thylakoid membrane contains many membrane-bound complexes called #$Photosystems that are the molecular-scale sites of the #$LightDependentStepOfPhotosynthesis.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effc0).
