x_comment(x_PhotosystemII,"A specialization of #$Photosystem. Each instance of #$PhotosystemII is a super-complex including one #$P680ReactionCenter and several #$LightHarvestingComplexes in close association.  #$PhotosystemII instances are found bound to the thylakoid membranes of #$Chloroplasts (see #$ThylakoidMembrane-Eukaryotic) and to the photosynthetic membranes of #$BlueGreenAlgae.  There is variation between species in the exact structure, type and numbers of photosynthetic pigment molecules, and exact composition of protein subunits of #$PhotosystemII instances.  ") :- x_cid(a65b16505effc1).
