x_comment(x_NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate,"The collection of NADP   molecules. Such molecules are found in both plants and animals, and have important roles in electron transfer, able to become reduced (transformed into #$ReducedNicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate) by accepting an electron, and then able to act to reduce other molecules by giving that electron up.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effc4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505effc4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
