x_comment(x_ReducedNicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate,"The collection of NADPH molecules. These are the reduced form of #$NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate. Such molecules are found in both plants and animals, and have important roles in electron transfer, able to act to reduce other molecules by giving up an #$Electron (being transformed into #$NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate), then able to become reduced (transformed back into this form) by accepting an electron.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effc5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505effc5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
