x_comment(x_oxidizingAgent,"An instance of #$ActorSlot. (#$oxidizingAgent REDOX REACTANT) means that during REDOX, an instance of #$RedoxReaction, REACTANT, an instance of #$ChemicalObject, acts as an oxidizing agent and is reduced as a result. I.e., one of the #$Atoms of REACTANT gains one or more #$Electrons and thus has its oxidation state decreased.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effc7).
