x_comment(x_NaiveQuantumPhysicsMt,"#$NaiveQuantumPhysicsMt is a #$Microtheory which attempts to capture aspects of non-Newtonian physics such as the wave nature of particles, the quantization of electromagnetic radiation, electron excitation and other phenomena to the extent necessary to understand and explain processes in chemistry and biology, for example photosynthesis.  A correct and modern Quantum Physics Microtheory, if fully developed, would express the mathematical framework of quantum mechanics (describing physical interactions in terms of Hilbert spaces and operators thereon) and describe its fundamental concepts, such as wave/particle duality, the Uncertainty Principle, quantum states of matter, quantum entanglement, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effc8).
