x_comment(x_ChemicalObjectExcitation,"A collection of events.  In each instance of #$ChemicalObjectExcitation, a #$ChemicalObject absorbs energy, which boosts an electron in the molecule or atom to a higher-energy molecular orbital.  This can occur because the object absorbs a #$Photon, or because it absorbs the energy of a neighboring chemical object that is in an excited state. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505effd2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505effd2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505effd2,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
