x_comment('x_PhotosyntheticLightReactions-CyclicElectronFlow',"A specialization of #$BiochemicalPathway.  Instances of  #$PhotosyntheticLightReactions-CyclicElectronFlow occur during #$OxygenicPhotosynthesis and also during some types of #$AnoxygenicPhotosynthesis. Unlike #$PhotosyntheticLightReactions-LinearElectronFlow, which can also occur during photosynthesis in green plants, instances of this class involve only #$PhotosystemI, do not split molecules of #$Water, and do not produce NADPH. However, ATP is produced.  ") :- x_cid(a65b16505effda).
