x_comment(x_EnergyTransferFromLHCToReactionCenter,"A specialization of #$EnergyTransferEvent.  Each instance of #$EnergyTransferFromLHCToReactionCenter begins when a pigment molecule in a #$LightHarvestingComplex becomes excited by the absorption of a #$Photon. The energy in that molecule's excited electron is passed from pigment molecule to pigment molecule in a series of #$ResonanceEnergyTransfers until finally one of the core #$ChlorophyllA molecules in the #$PhotosyntheticReactionCenter becomes excited.") :- x_cid(a65b16505effdd).
