x_comment('x_Telophase-Generic',"#$Telophase-Generic is a specialization of #$PhysicalTransformationEvent whose instances take place as part of cell division, either mitotic (see #$MitoticPhaseOfCellCycle) and thus as an instance of #$Telophase, or meiotic (see #$Meiosis) and thus as an instance of #$TelophaseI or #$TelophaseII. #$Telophase-Generic events are essentially characterized by the formation of two nuclear envelopes around the two sets of chromosomes defined by a previous #$Anaphase-Generic event.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0004).
