x_comment('x_necessaryConditionFor-InSitType',"<code>(#$necessaryConditionFor-InSitType SITUATION-TYPE STEP-TYPE1 STEP-TYPE2)</code> means that in the type of #$Situation,  <code>SITUATION-TYPE</code>, <code>STEP-TYPE1</code> is a necessary condition for <code>STEP-TYPE2</code>. This means that if an instance INS2 of <code>STEP-TYPE2</code> is part of an instantiation S of <code>SITUATION-TYPE</code>, then INS2 will start after INS1 -- an instance of <code>STEP-TYPE1</code> that is also part of S.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0029).
