x_comment('x_preconditionFor-InSitType',"<code>(#$preconditionFor-InSitType SITUATION-TYPE SCENE1 SCENE2)</code> means that <code>SCENE1</code> and <code>SCENE2</code> are both scenes in <code>SITUATION-TYPE</code>, and that <code>SCENE1</code> is a precondition for <code>SCENE2</code>.  This means both that <code>SCENE1</code> comes before, and is a necessary condition for <code>SCENE2</code>.  Cf. #$necessaryConditionFor-InSitType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f002a).
