x_comment(x_QSSingleVariableQuaternaryQueryFn,"<code>(#$QSSingleVariableQuaternaryQueryFn PRED ARG-L ARG-M ARG-N VARPOS)</code> denotes the Query Suggestor query for bindings for the <code>VARPOS</code>-th argument of a quaternary CycL sentence where the arg0 is <code>PRED</code>, and the other three arguments, in order of argument number, are <code>ARG-L</code>, <code>ARG-M</code> and <code>ARG-N</code>. For example <code>(#$QSSingleVariableQuaternaryQueryFn #$travelTime #$CityOfLondonEngland #$CityOfParisFrance    (#$TravelingByMeansOfFn #$EurostarChunnelTrain) 4)</code> specifies the Query Suggestor query for the amount of time it takes to travel from London to Paris by means of the Eurostar Chunnel tran.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0031).
