x_comment(x_metaphorSalientBasisBinPred,"<code>(#$metaphorSalientBasisBinPred  METAPHOR PRED N)</code> means that if, for the basis <code>BASIS</code> of <code>METAPHOR</code>,  <code>PRED</code> is a binary predicate that holds of <code>BASIS</code> and some further thing <code>THING</code> where <code>BASIS</code> is the Nth argument to <code>PRED</code>, then when <code>METAPHOR</code> is applied to something <code>FOO</code>, <code>PRED</code> holds of <code>FOO</code> and some further thing <code>THING</code> where <code>BASIS</code> is the Nth argument to <code>PRED</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0050).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f0050,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
