x_comment(x_checkSentence,"A #$KBDependentRelation (q.v.) and specialization of #$knownSentence (q.v.) that pragmatically delays attempting to prove its sentence argument until it has no free variables. More precisely, (#$checkSentence SENT) means that SENT is provable by the Cyc inference engine from sentences currently in the Knowledge Base. #$checkSentence is a non-assertible predicate (see #$notAssertible). Note that this predicate is not to be confused  with #$assertedSentence, which is used to state that a given  sentence is explicitly asserted in the KB.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f006e).
