x_comment('x_in-EmbeddedInAndPassesThroughFluidMatrix',"A #$ConnectionPredicate and specialization of #$in-EmbeddedInFluidMatrix (q.v.) that relates #$PartiallyTangibles to the #$FluidTangibleThing matrices in which they are embedded in and pass through. Note that <code>(#$in-EmbeddedInFluidMatrix OBJ MATRIX)</code> does not mean that OBJ is #$in-ImmersedGeneric in <code>MATRIX</code>, nor that it is wet in any appreciable way. Such embeddings have many of the properties associated with #$inRooted-PassesThrough, except that one of the associated objects is technically a fluid. Most instances of #$in-EmbeddedInAndPassesThroughFluidMatrix relations occur at the molecular level (e.g., #$Molecules and #$MacromolecularComplexes embedded in #$CellularMembranes).") :- x_cid(a65b16505f007d).
