x_comment(x_electronCarrier,"<code>(#$electronCarrier ET-CHAIN CARRIER)</code> means that <code>CARRIER</code> carries an electron during part of the #$ElectronTransportChain, <code>ET-CHAIN</code>.  Specifically, the #$ChemicalObject <code>CARRIER</code> is the #$electronAcceptor in one #$ElectronTransfer in <code>ET-CHAIN</code>, and is the #$electronDonor in the subsequent step in the chain.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f009c).
