x_comment(x_chemicalObjectsInElectronTransportChain,"<code>(#$chemicalObjectsInElectronTransportChain CHAIN-TYPE LIST-OF-OBJ-TYPES)</code> means that: <p>(1) for each instance <code>ETC</code> of <code>CHAIN-TYPE</code>, there exists some instance of each element of <code>LIST-OF-OBJ-TYPES</code>. The first in the list is the #$fromLocation for the chain of transfers as a whole, the last in the list is the #$toLocation, and each intermediate element plays the role of #$electronCarrier in the #$ElectronTransportChain <code>ETC</code>; <p>(2) there are no further chemical objects playing those roles in <code>ECT</code> that are not spatiotemporally subsumed by some instance of some element of <code>LIST-OF-OBJ-TYPES</code>;<p>(3) for each pair of #$ChemicalObject types <code>TYPE1</code> and <code>TYPE2</code> adjacent in ?LIST, there exists an instance <code>TRANS</code> of #$ElectronTransfer which is a #$properSubEvents of <code>ECT</code>, and in which an instance of <code>TYPE1</code> is the #$electronDonor, and <code>TYPE2</code> is the #$electronAcceptor; <p>(4) the #$firstSubEvents of <code>ETC</code> will be an instance of #$ElectronTransfer between instances of the first two elements of ?LIST; <p>and (5) the #$lastSubEvents of <code>ETC</code> will be an instance of #$ElectronTransfer between instances of the last two elements of ?LIST;   <p>For example, (#$chemicalObjectsInElectronTransportChain #$ElectronTransportChainFromPSII-To-PSI  (#$TheList #$PrimaryElectronAcceptor-PhotosystemII (#$MoleculeFn #$Plastoquinone) #$CytochromeB6FComplex #$PlastocyaninMolecule #$P700ChlorophyllAMolecule)).  This means that, for example, (#$properSubEventTypes #$ElectronTransportChainFromPSII-To-PSI (ElectronTransferFromTypeToTypeFn #$PrimaryElectronAcceptor-PhotosystemII (#$MoleculeFn #$Plastoquinone)).  Further, for any instance of #$ElectronTransportChainFromPSII-To-PSI <b>PSIIToPSIChain-001</b>, there is no sub-event of <b>PSIIToPSIChain-001</b> that is not spatiotemporally subsumed by some instance of some element of (#$TheList #$PrimaryElectronAcceptor-PhotosystemII (#$MoleculeFn #$Plastoquinone) #$CytochromeB6FComplex #$PlastocyaninMolecule #$P700ChlorophyllAMolecule)).  Other things are entailed as described in 3 - 5 above.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f009d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f009d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505f009d,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16505f009d,21017).
