x_comment(x_towardLocation,"The predicate #$towardLocation is used to indicate a location toward which something moves in a particular movement.  <code>(#$towardLocation MOVE LOC)</code> means that, when movement ends, each #$objectMoving in <code>MOVE</code> (a #$Movement-TranslationEvent) is found closer to <code>LOC</code> than it was when the event <code>MOVE</code> started. <code>LOC</code> may be, but is not necessarily, the final location of each #$objectMoving in that event. For that stronger meaning, see the spec-predicate #$toLocation See also #$motionPathway-Complete, #$pathConnects.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f00b9).
