x_comment(x_iterativeSubEventTypesTotality,"<code>(#$iterativeSubEventTypesTotality EVENT-TYPE SUB-SUB-EVENT-TYPE SUB-EVENT-TYPE)</code> identifies <code>SUB-EVENT-TYPE</code> as the collection of all instances of #$IteratedEventScene that are iterations through instances of <code>SUB-SUB-EVENT-TYPE</code> as part of the unfolding of some event of type <code>EVENT-TYPE</code>.  This is the corresponding predicate to #$TotalityOfSubEventsOfTypeFn.  See that term for a more formal definition of the meaning of this relation.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f00cc).
