x_comment(x_electronAffinityOfType,"(#$electronAffinityOfType ELEMENT KJ_PER_MOLE) means that the amount of energy needed for adding electrons to atoms of ELEMENT is the specified amount (normally expressed in kiloJoules per mole).  Electron affinity has often been expressed with the opposite sign -- indicating energy released when an electron is added") :- x_cid(a65b16505f00cd).
