x_comment(x_MolarEnergy,"A specialization of #$RatioQuantity (q.v.). Each instance of #$MolarEnergy is a ratio of an amount of energy (#$EnergyQuantity) to the number of moles (see #$Mole-ChemicalCountUnit) of some chemical species, and is often measured in (#$PerFn #$Kilocalorie #$Mole-ChemicalCountUnit) or (#$PerFn (#$Kilo #$Joule) #$Mole-ChemicalCountUnit).  Instances of #$MolarEnergy can be used to talk about the concentration of chemical energy in a type of substance, or the rate of energy released when a type of compound is catabolized.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f00e7).
