x_comment(x_AmbientClimateSituation,"The collection of all instances of #$WeatherEvent that may be correctly characterized as 'climates' or 'climate situation'.  The exact requirements for a #$WeatherEvent's meeting this criterion are vague, but it seems relatively safe to say that duration is a key feature:  that is, a 'climate' is a weather situation with distinguishing features that persist for more than hours, days, or probably weeks or months.  A year may be the minimum granularity (the collection of #$AnnualClimateCycles is precisely the collection of all #$AmbientClimateSituations of a duration of exactly one year). A given #$AmbientClimateSituation is characterized by certain metric ranges of temperature, humidity, pressure, and maybe other #$MeasurableQuantitySlots (e.g., pH level) that are never contravened for the duration of the #$AmbientClimateSituation in question. Every #$AmbientClimateSituation is an important situational subcomponent (#$subSituations) of the implementing process (#$autocatalyticProcessImplementsSystem) of some #$Ecosystem:  we do not foreclose on the possibility that, in some cases at least, the #$AmbientClimateSituation *is* the implementing process, i.e., the process whereby the #$Ecosystem is realized.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f00fd).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f00fd,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505f00fd,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16505f00fd,21140).
xc_kb_names(a65b16505f00fd,[]).
xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505f00fd,[]).
x_comment(x_ambientClimateTypeOfRegion,"(#$ambientClimateTypeOfRegion REGION CLIMATE-TYPE) means that #$GeographicalRegion REGION is a constituent in (#$situationConstituents) in some #$AmbientClimateSituation that is an instance of they type CLIMATE-TYPE and whose temporal extent subsumes the time at which (#$ambientClimateTypeOfRegion REGION CLIMATE-TYPE) is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f00fe).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f00fe,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505f00fe,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
