xc_mapping_rows(a65b16505f0101,[]).
x_comment('x_Ecosystem-Extreme',"The class of all #$Ecosystems whose ambient climates feature some metric or metrics that contravene the ordinary systemic requirements of normal instances of #$Cell.  More specifically, an #$Ecosystem is considered an instance of #$Ecosystem-Extreme if its ambient climate (#$ambientClimateOfEcosystem) entails a value on the #$MeasurableQuantitySlot SLOT (#$climateEntailsValueOnSlot) that is greater than or less than a value that is a #$systemicMetricRequirement of #$Cells on the same #$MeasurableQuantitySlot SLOT, owing to cellular functional requirements and the limitations of the subcellular agents that ordinarily fill those requirements.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0102).
