x_comment(x_MultiStepRedoxReaction,"A specialization of #$RedoxReaction and an instance of #$TemporalObjectType.  Instances of #$MultiStepRedoxReaction are #$ChemicalReactions in which #$Electrons are transferred between #$ChemicalObjects in two more more steps, each of which are an instance of #$SimpleRedoxReaction.  The objects providing  electrons are oxidized while those gaining electrons are reduced.    <p>Examples of #$MultiStepRedoxReaction include the oxidation of organic molecules in #$CellularRespiration, and sequences of electron transfers that occur in an #$ElectronTransportChain. ") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0109).
