x_comment('x_NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotide-Generic',"The collection of NAD  and NADH  molecules. Such molecules are found in all #$Cells, and have important roles in electron transfer.  The oxidized form, NAD  (#$NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotide) is able to become reduced (transformed into #$ReducedNicotinamideAdenineDinucleotide) by accepting an electron, and then able to act to reduce other molecules by giving that electron up.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f010a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f010a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
