x_comment('x_NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate-Generic',"The collection of NADP  and NADPH  molecules. Such molecules are found in both plants and animals, and have important roles in electron transfer.  The oxidized form, NADP  (#$NicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate) is able to become reduced (transformed into #$ReducedNicotinamideAdenineDinucleotidePhosphate) by accepting an electron, and then able to act to reduce other molecules by giving that electron up.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f012f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f012f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
