x_comment(x_entailsRoleInEventOfType,"The purpose of this predicate is to relate #$SystemRolePredicates (i.e., relations representing functional roles) to their corresponding #$BinaryRolePredicates (i.e., relations representing the roles that agents play in events).  (#$entailsRoleInEventOfType SYS-SLOT EVENT-TYPE SYS-ACT-SLOT AGT-ACT-SLOT) means that if an agent plays the functional role SYS-SLOT in a particular functional system, and that system in turn plays the role SYS-ACT-SLOT in an event of type EVENT-TYPE, then the agent will play the role AGT-ACT-SLOT in that same event.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f015a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f015a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505f015a,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
