x_comment(x_ConversionOfTypeToTypeByEnzymeFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction used for representing #$ChemicalReactions that are types of #$EnzymaticActivity.  (#$ConversionOfTypeToTypeByEnzymeFn FROM-TYPE TO-TYPE ENZYME-TYPE) denotes a collection which is an instance of #$SpecifiedChemicalInteractionType and specialization of #$EnzymaticActivity in which instances of FROM-TYPE are converted to instances of TO-TYPE with an instance of ENZYME-TYPE serving as the #$catalyst.  For any given type of reaction denoted by a use of this function, instances may involve other chemical reactants or chemical objects besides FROM-TYPE and TO-TYPE, but FROM-TYPE and TO-TYPE are in some sense the focal inputs and products for the type of reaction.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0160).
