x_comment(x_recognizedInCellularRecognitionEvent,"This predicate relates an instance of #$Cell\n<code>CELL</code> to an instance of #$CellularRecognitionEvent in\nwhich specific #$MembraneGlycoconjugateMolecules of the\n<code>CELL</code> bind to #$MembraneGlycoconjugateMolecules on another\n#$Cell, resulting in a possibly differential response from the other\ncell. A cell may be both #$recognizedInCellularRecognitionEvent and\nalso #$recognizerInCellularRecognitionEvent, provided that\n<code>CELL</code> both responds and is responded to as a result of the\n#$CellularRecognitionEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f016e).
