x_comment(x_SelectiveBarrierTransport,"The collection of all instances of #$RegulatedTransportSituation wherein the #$transportBoundarySystem in question is a physical surface such that whatever is admitted (#$itemAdmitted) is admitted in virtue of the surface's physical structure, either jointly or individually, and such that whatever is excluded is excluded because some physical feature will not allow it ingress (in the simplest case, the structure lacks pores for admitting what is excluded, but more complex situations are allowed, e.g., the pores might feature sensors which close portals when a certain type of agent is detected, a la Maxwell's demon).  Every #$SelectiveBarrierTransport includes a (#$GroupFn PassingThroughPortal) which is the situational sum of all 'admissions' that occur during the filtration, and a (#$GroupFn BarrierSituation) (which is also a #$BarrierSituation in its own right) which is the situational sum of all the 'interdictions' that occur during the filtration.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0311).
