x_comment(x_EnzymeMoleculeActivityRegulationEvent,"Instances are #$ChemicalInteractions in which, by virtue of being bound to or unbound from some other #$ChemicalObject, an #$EnzymeMolecule has its 'activity' altered.  By 'activity', we mean the #$EnzymeMolecule's ability to act as the #$catalyst in the typical kinds of #$ChemicalReactions it normally participates in (see, e.g., #$enzymeTypeCatalyzesProductionOfType).  Specializations of this collection include the activation of enzymes (see #$EnzymeActivationEvent), their inactivation (see #$EnzymeInactivationEvent) and their inhibition (see #$EnzymaticInhibition).") :- x_cid(a65b16505f032c).
