x_comment(x_securityTypeHasFeatureType,"Relates a type of security to a collection such that it is typically the case that an instance of that security type has some important relationship to some instance of the collection in arg2.  For example, most securities are assigned a credit rating.  Hence, (#$securityTypeHasFeatureType #$TradeableSecurity #$CreditRating-TradeableSecurity) means that it is typically the case that an instance of #$TradeableSecurity is related in some important way to some instance of #$CreditRating-TradeableSecurity.  This is a general relation as the exact relationship between the two concepts is not explicit.  In essence, this is a financial product specific analogue of #$instanceInvolveType.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f03ca).
