x_comment(x_ContractWithVendorWithIDFn,"A binary reifiable function.  This function takes a vendor and an ID string and denotes the instance of #$Contract that is the contract with that vendor that has that ID as an identifier.  Note that uses of this function are highly context dependent.  The source of the ID string should be made clear.  E.g. in the context of a particular business's representation of their contracts, it may be an assumption of their application microtheory that the ID is provided by the licensee assigned ID provided by some customer system.  In other contexts it may be provided by the vendor.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f03fd).
