x_comment(x_marketDataProductWithContentType,"this is the corresponding predicate to #$MarketDataProductWithContentTypeFn.  It relates a market data product type, PRODUCT-TYPE, to some type of thing, TYPE such that the instances of PRODUCT-TYPE include information about the instances TYPE as attributes of some focal entity type that the product is about.  See the comment on #$MarketDataProductWithContentTypeFn for more detail.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0418).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f0418,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505f0418,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
