x_comment(x_marketDataProductHasInformationOfType,"(#$marketDataProductHasInformationOfType PRODUCT TYPE) means that the market data product PRODUCT includes information about instances of TYPE where that information is used to characterize some focal entity of PRODUCT.  E.g. (#$marketDataProductHasInformationOfType PRODUCT #$CorporateRevenueEstimate) means that PRODUCT includes data fields that express or report instances of #$CorporateRevenueEstimate as attributes of the focal entities of the product.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0419).
xc_microtheory(a65b16505f0419,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16505f0419,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part07.krf').
