x_comment(x_licenseTypeMoreRestrictiveInScopeThan,"(#$licenseTypeMoreRestrictiveInScopeThan LICENSE-TYPE1 LICENSE-TYPE2) means that the class of licensed users given by the terms of the instances of LICENSE-TYPE2 is more restricted than that of LICENSE-TYPE1.  This does not entail that any given instance of LICENSE-TYPE2 has less licensed users than some (or indeed any) instance of LICENSE-TYPE1.  Rather, this indicates a dispositional relation to the effect that for a given organization, they will have fewer licensed users if they were to license under LICENSE-TYPE2 vs. LICENSE-TYPE1 -- e.g. were they to purchase a department wide license vs a enterprise wide license.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f043a).
