x_comment(x_licensedByContractForProductType,"(#$licensedByContractForProductType CONTRACT PRODUCT PARTY) means that a licensed user for PRODUCT as specified by CONTRACT is PARTY.  Note that PARTY may be an organization or group or an individual.  if a group, then each #$groupMembers is also licensed provided any other conditions in the contract related to licensed users is also satisfied.  For example, a license may specify that a particular group in an organization is the pool of licensed users, but specify certain fees for each member that uses the product.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0446).
