x_comment(x_rolePlayerOfTypeStatesConservedOverSituationType,"<code>(#$rolePlayerOfTypeStatesConservedUnderSituationType SIT-TYPE ROLE TYPE)</code> means that if an instance of <code>TYPE</code> plays <code>ROLE</code> in an instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, any state true of the instance before the situation (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateBeforeSituationType) will be true after the situation (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateBeforeSituationType). i.e., the situation leaves the role player unchanged.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f044b).
