x_comment(x_rolePlayerOfTypeStatesConservedOverSubSituationType,"<code>(#$rolePlayerStatesInvariantOverSituationType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE ROLE TYPE)</code> means that if an instance of <code>TYPE</code> plays <code>ROLE</code> in an instance of <code>SUBSIT-TYPE</code> which is a subsituation of an instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, any state true of the instance before the subsituation (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateBeforeSubSituationType) will be true after the subsituation (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateBeforeSubSituationType). i.e., the subsituation leaves the role player unchanged.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f044c).
