x_comment(x_rolePlayerOfTypeStatesTransformedOverSituationType,"<code>(#$rolePlayerOfTypeStatesTransformedOverSituationType\nSIT-TYPE ROLE TYPE FROMSTATE TOSTATE)</code> means that if an instance\nof <code>TYPE</code> plays <code>ROLE</code> in an instance of\n<code>SIT-TYPE</code>, and prior to playing that role has state\n<code>FROMSTATE</code> (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateBeforeSituationType),\nafter the\nsituation (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateAfterSituationType) the role\nplayer will have state <code>TOSTATE</code> and will not have state\n<code>FROMSTATE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f044d).
