x_comment(x_rolePlayerOfTypeStatesTransformedOverSubSituationType,"<code>(#$rolePlayerOfTypeStatesTransformedOverSubSituationType\nSIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE ROLE TYPE FROMSTATE TOSTATE)</code> means that if\nan instance of <code>TYPE</code> plays <code>ROLE</code> in an\ninstance of <code>SUBSIT-TYPE</code> that is a subsituation of an\ninstance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, and prior to playing that role has\nstate\n<code>FROMSTATE</code> (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateBeforeSituationType),\nafter the\nsituation (q.v. #$rolePlayerOfTypeHasStateAfterSituationType) the role\nplayer will have state <code>TOSTATE</code> and will not have state\n<code>FROMSTATE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f044e).
