x_comment(x_sqlAppendedToTableAtImport,"This predicate is used to state an arbitrary constraint that should be appended to the SELECT statement used when the RDB reflector imports a data from a table. That is, if the sentence <code>(#$sqlAppendedToTableAtImport TABLE SQL)</code> is asserted in the mapping microtheory for the database table <code>TABLE</code> then when the RDB Reflector imports the data from <code>TABLE</code>, it should append the string <code>SQL</code>, separated by a single space, to the end of the SELECT statement that is generated to fetch the table data. Cyc need not do anything to ensure that the resulting SELECT statement is well-formed. If the result of appending <code>SQL</code> leads to a malformed SELECT statement, or otherwise leads to an error when fetching the data, Cyc should exit with an error message.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0470).
