x_comment('x_chemicalEquation-SimplifiedUnbalanced',"(#$chemicalEquation-SimplifiedUnbalanced REACTION-TYPE REACTANT-LIST PRODUCT-LIST) means that in #$ChemicalReactions of type REACTION-TYPE instances of the substances included in REACTANT-LIST react to form instances of the substances included in PRODUCT-LIST, where the elements of REACTANT-LIST and PRODUCT-LIST are derived from a mathematically simplified version of the balanced equation. As such, the REACTANT-LIST and PRODUCT-LIST may lack some chemicals found in the true, balanced equation, having replaced them with more general classes of chemical that share a common proportion of atomic decomposition..") :- x_cid(a65b16505f04cd).
