x_comment(x_beliefSystemAssociatedCulture,"The predicate that corresponds to #$BeliefSystemCultureFn, <code>(#$beliefSystemAssociatedCulture BELIEF-SYSTEM CULTURE)</code> identifies <code>CULTURE</code> as the instance of #$Culture-Practice whose constituent customs and practices are influenced by <code>BELIEF-SYSTEM</code>, an instance of #$BeliefSystem.  See also #$cultureBeliefs, which relates an instance of #$Culture-Practice a specific beliefs; in general, the #$cultureParticipants of a given culture <code>C</code> need not accept each and every #$cultureBeliefs of a belief system <code>S</code> where <code>(#$beliefSystemAssociatedCulture S C)</code> holds, nor must every proponent of <code>S</code> be a #$cultureParticipants of <code>C</code>, but there will in general be high overlap.\")") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0518).
