x_comment('x_coveringOfEvent-Nonoverlapping',"<code>(#$coveringOfEventType-Nonoverlapping EVT LIST-OF-EVTS)</code> means that: <p> (1) each element of <code>LIST-OF-EVTS</code> is a proper sub-situation of <code>EVT</code>; <p> (2) there is no further sub-situation of <code>EVT</code> that is not spatiotemporally subsumed by some some element of<code> LIST-OF-EVTS</code>; <p> (3) the first element of <code>LIST-OF-EVTS</code> starts at the starting of <code>EVT</code>; <p> (4) after the first element of <code>LIST-OF-EVTS</code>, each subsequent element of <code>LIST-OF-EVTS</code> starts after the end of the instance of the prior element in <code>LIST-OF-EVTS</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16505f0555).
